<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">LUK- Bangubangu Traduction</book>
  <para style="h">LUKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Musau Ulweela wa Yeesu Kilisito <optbreak /> bebye bye sinya Luka</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUKA</para>
  <para style="imt">SHWEDELO</para>
  <para style="ip">Luka ni wesinya kiiki kitabu. Wene mubuki, na ndeene Muyuda. Wesinya kiiki kitabu mukuboya ti wasaudile basidi Bayaudi Musau ulweela wa kufuuka kwa tima kukidila Yeesu Kilisito. Na niiye wesinya kitabu kya Bye byeeta mitonge. Luka mwinikindu ndeemona Yeesu, ila weekeba na wefifulula mauya kukidila Yeesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Luka ukimonesha ti Yeesu Kilisito ni Mwaana wa Mundu weeva na kukeba baaba bezizimina (Luka 19.10). Byakebee ukimonesha ti Yeesu wemonena bandu lusa baaba bene babusadi bidi: Tushuvi, na baabakazi, na baana. Luka wayakula kukidila mudimo wa Tima dya Kabejya kumaama meetanga Yeesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu kya Luka ni kikiyakananga kilakila kukila bitabu byooso bya Kilao Kiya. Kwa kusomba kiiki kitabu, Luka wasaula mabule kukidila kubutuka kwa Yeesu (Luka 1-2), wasaula byakebee kukidila kilongo kya Yeesu (Luka 3.23-38). Byakebee wasaula kukidila kuyabikibwa kwa Yeesu mumeema (Luka 3.21), na kulabudibwa kwaaye na Shetani (Luka 4.1-13), na mudimo waaye (Luka 4-21), na kulamikibwa kwaaye ku musalaba (Luka 22-23), na kufukuka kwaaye (Luka 24). Kisha Luka wa saula byekwimonesha Yeesu kudi badingisi baaye mbendo ya bule kisha kufukuka kwaaye. Byababika tonaa mumudimo wakusaudila bandu mauya ma Kabejya. Kumongo Luka wasaula mbini Kabejya bye mubajya Yeesu haulu mbinguni.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s">Musombo wa musau wa Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Mutumbibwa Theofilo, kudi bandu babule baheleka kusinya kukidila maama makumo meekidika hamukidi hiitu. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Be masinya bebya byatwe saudibwa na baaba bee mona maama makumo na meeso maabo kusombela kumusombo, na be mwangidijya wowa musau wa Kabejya. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Mulukizya lwaami vafifulula zizii mudimo wa Yeesu kusomba kusombelo tii leelo. Kukidila beebyo vamona buya kukusinyina kamo kwa kamo, mtumbibwa Theofilo. <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />Nakusinyina mukuboya ti uyuke zizii mama mawe langidibwa ti makwinikindu.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Badijyo dya kubutuka kwa Yohane <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yowa wakusinyulula ukibambana kusaudibwa haŋa ti Luka ukivula kooko itu watena bandu bakimoneye "tuuku" kuteena mabua mabaki yakana. </char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Mumaa mafuku meene Helode Kolo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kolo: Mukulu, mukulu wa mukola, mundu yidi na butangala, mukulu ki talukila kisi.</char></note> wa kisi kya Yadea, kwene mundu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dyemo: Mundu yumo yidi bushwale muzio wa kulunga bandu kudi Kabejya, kukidila kujyijya kafa</char></note> yumo we taanibwa Zakadia. Yowa Zakadiya, wene yumo mupelo wa kiandu kya mupelo Abiya. Mukajyaye we taanibwa Elizabeti wa kilongo kya Aluni. Yowa Aluni ni wene mupelo* wa busu mu Isilaeli.<verse eid="LUK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Zakadia na Elizabeti booso babidi be sumuka bilweela busu bwa Kabejya, na be yakana mukujyanga Buta* na mubilao bwa Vidi-nyambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Nembebya ndabeene na baana, kumona Elizabeti wene kiumba; na booso babidi bene ndabate banunu.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Lumo lusu, Zakadia weyena ku lubunga lwa Kabejya* kukata mudimo waaye wa bumupelo, kumona lwene lukijya lwaaye lwa kuvuba mukiandu kyaabo. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Haŋo kukidila bwaama bwa ba mupelo* ni Zakadia we sobolebwa kukidila<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kusobolebwa: Ngusobolebwa kukidila ndonge.</char></note> ndonge ti washweele mu lubunga lwa Kabejya na wa jyijye<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kujyijya: Brûler ici c'est dans le sens du service d'offrir le parfun. </char></note> kafa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Kulozoka 30.7-8 </char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Mukekya kindi kye jyijya Zakadia kafa, kiandu kikata kya bandu, be kumaana haaza baki hajya Kabejya. <verse eid="LUK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Kisha Malaika* wa Kabejya bya nyomokela Zakadia mwakemo munda mwa lubunga lwa Kabejya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lubunga lwa Kabejya: Ni bua dyaku hazyila Kabejya. Disidi bua bobo dyaku yakudila mauya ma buyakane bwa bandu.</char></note>. Yowa malaika bya taluka mwajyo mulume wa kabunga ka kujyijyila kafa.<verse eid="LUK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Zakadia hevamumoneye bya hanunuka na kuteejya moyo. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Ila yowa malaika* bya mujyongodela ti: «Zakadia, ndutiina, kumona Kabejya watabuka kuajya kwoobe. Mukajyobe Elizabeti uku butudila mwaana wa mwamulume, na beebe umuhunika zina dya Yohane. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Useelela kwa kwinikindu na bandu babule biseelela kubutuka kwaye. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Yowa mwaana uyakana mundu mukata busu bwa Vidi-nyambi. Kwa biibi, ndakunywanganga divai wala maluvu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maluvu: Byakukubila biki visha munyungo kudi mundu (kulevya). </char></note>, tima dya Kabejya diyakana kukumo naye kusombela muifu ndya naazye<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Kubala (hesabu) 6.3</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Ualusha bandu babule ba Isilaeli kwa Vidi-nyambi Kabejya waabo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Malaki 2.6</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Uuva bushwa muvubi wa Kabejya usumuka na butangala bwa tima dya Kabejya na tima bidi dya mubushi Elia. Ulunganga ba tata na baana baabo. Ufundulula ma tima mabaaba basiki tiina Kabejya,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Malaki 3.23-24</char></note> mukuboya ti bayakane na butangala bwa kuyuka mauya bidi bandu badi balweela busu bwa Kabejya. Biibi, ubikila Vidi-nyambi bandu tonaa kwa kumutabuka.»<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Ila Zakalia bya yuujya yowa malaika* ti: «Ngike kindu kingu monesha ti maama mauya maukisaula madi ma kwinikindu? Mona bangu, miimi na mukajyami tudi banunu byakebee.» <verse eid="LUK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Malaika bya muyaka ti: «Jyaami Gabilieli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Danieli 8.16-17; 9.21-27; Luka 1.26</char></note>, ngitebamanga busu bwa Kabejya kwakumuvubila. Uvanguyiisha kwaudi ti nakuvishile huu mukizi ulweela. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Maama mauya mibambana aŋa heboyela Kabejya. Kumona nduvamatabuka uyakana kifuma. Ndwakusamuna lungi kuyakula mupaka lufuku lwa maa mambivakusaudila hamibambana.»<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Mukekya kindi, bandu benange muku dindila Zakadia haaza habasikianunuka kumona bebya byaloweye momwa munda mwa lubunga*. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Zakadia henyomokeeye haaza, ndee samuna kuyakula naabo. Haŋo bya yakana muku jyobola na bandu na minyu bobo, kumona huvanange ndate kifuma. Haŋo baaba bandu bya bayuka ti huvamona bindu bidi kilooto mo munda mwalubunga*.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Haŋa hewa Zakadia mafuku maaye makuvuba mulubunga lwa Kabejya*, bya haluka ku kyende kyaye. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Hekila mamo mafuku Elizabeti mukajyaye bya shwala yimi. Bya kwifyamisha munda mwa kyende kindi kya miango yitano, bya yakulanga ti: <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />«Lola buuya bwangu ndeela Mwaba-kalunga!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mwaba-kalunga: Kiaba baandu, kihaana bindu kudi mundu kivuleeye.</char></note>; wangujyejyela buuvu bwa kuyakana kiumba busu bwa bandu booso.»<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Badijyo dya kubutuka kwa Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Haŋa hebambana yimi dya Elizabeti miango mutuba, Kabejya bya yiisha malaika* Gablieli, wa yeene mu mukola wa Nazaleti mukisi kya Galilaya, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />kudi musika yumo katumbi we taanibwa Malia. Yowa musika katumbi we songolebwa na henda yumo zina dyaye Yozefu, wene wa kilongo kya kolo Daudi. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Yowa Malaika* bya shwela kwene Malia na kumujyongodela ti: «Na kusambitila Malia! Huseelele kumona waheebwa mbejya yi kata na Kabejya! Naiye udi kukumo noobe.» <verse eid="LUK 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Haŋa heteejya Malia maama mauya bya nyingama kwa bule, bya somba ku kwiyujya ti: «Kuuku kungusambitila kwa Malaika* kukivula kuyakula kai?»<figure style="fig" alt="L'ange dit à Marie qu'elle va angendré Jésus" file="DN00401b.tif" size="span" copy="Darwin Dunham" ref="1.19">Malaika wajyongodela Malia ti hubutula Yeesu</figure><verse eid="LUK 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Ila Malaika bya mujyongodela ti: «Teejya bangu Malia! Ndu tiina, kumona Kabejya wakuabila mbejya. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Mona bangu! Ushwaala yimi, na kubutula mwaana wa mwamulume; na umuhunika zina dya Yeesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Uyakana mukulu, na hutaanibwanga: ‹Mwaana wa Kabejya yidi haulu›. Vidi-nyambi Kabejya iye mwinikindu umwaabila kauna kashaye mukulu Daudi. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Utangala misha yooso haulu habaana Baisilaeli, bukolo bwaye ndabwakuyakana na mongo.»<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Malia bya yuuzya Malaika* ti: «Mbini maama makumo mi samunika bini, haŋa miimi sheyuka byaami mulume?» <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Malaika* naaye bya muyaka ti: «Tima dya Kabejya dikuviila haulu hoobe na butangala bwa Kabejya yidi haulu bukuzikila bidi mwiziizi. Kukidila beebyo, mwaana hubutuka hutaanibwa sidi nabubi, na hutaanibwa Mwaana wa Kabejya. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Teezya bangu: nee Elizabeti wa kilongo kyoobe naiye hudi na yimi dya miango mutuba, dya mwaana wa mwamulume, iye yidi mununu na kiumba. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Kumona ndakudi kisiki samunika kudi Kabejya.» <verse eid="LUK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Haŋo Malia bya yakula ti: «Miimi mbidi muvubi wa Vidi-nyambi, Kabejya wangundeele beebya bya uki jyongola.» Ni Malaika* bya yeena.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malia wamu sumukila Elizabeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Kisha mafuku mashee kukila, Malia bya hamba luendo yayaya mupaka mumukola umo hudi bituulu bya Yudea. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Hesosokeye kokwa, bya shweela mu kyende kya Zakadia na kumu sambitila Elizabeti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Hakeaŋa he teejya Elizabeti Malia wamu sambitila, mwaana wene muifu dya Elizabeti bya kwitenganya. Elizabeti bya yudibwa na Tima dya Kabejya. <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Bya bajya muuya na kuyakula ti: «Kabejya waku fiyuudila kukila baabakazi booso na mwaana waubutula naiye wa fiyuudibwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Miimi ni naani kwa kuboya ti naazye na Vidi-nyambi waami wangu sumukile? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Kumona hambivateezya muuya wakungusambitila kwoobe, mwaana yidi muifu dyami huvatenganya kwaku seelela. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Hufiyuudibwe beebe, kumona huva tabuka ti maama mavakujyongodela Vidi-nyambi mibambana bobo.»<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa Malia</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Haŋo Malia bya jyongola ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">«Tima dyaami dya shisha sisu Vidi-nyambi, <verse eid="LUK 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />na dya sehelela kudi Kabejya sisu, mufuudi waami. <verse eid="LUK 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Kumona wangulola miimi muvubi waaye wabasikibadika.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Kwa kwinikindu kusomba leelo bandu booso bingundaananga mufiyuudibwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />Kumona Kabejya-mutangala wa ngundeela bindu bikata.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">Zina dyaye didi disidi na bubi kwinikindu.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Kindi kyooso huyakana mukumonesha buuya bwaye ku baaba bakimutiinanga.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Na kukidila kiboko kyaaye waata bindu bikata.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:51">Wa mwangidizya booso bakiyakananga na kishu mumatima maabo.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Bene mukutangala wabashajya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:52">na baki kwishajya waba bandisha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Ayubu 5.11; 12.19</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Beteejyanga zala waba biika tubobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:53">ila tubobo watualusha minyu busadi.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Huvaava kuva nyanguzya kisi Isilaeli kyaye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:54">ndavaluba kumumonesha buuya bwaaye,<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />Beebya bye badijyeeye kudi bashitu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:55">Abulahamu na nguku yaye misha yooso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:55">beebya bye badijyeye bashiitu.»<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Madia bya yakana kudi Elizabeti kindi kya miango yisatu, ni bya halukeeye kwaabo.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubutuka kwa Yohane Luyabikana mumeema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />He bambana kindi kya Elizabeti kubutula, bya butula mwaana wa mwamulume. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Bandu ba tonono naye na baa bakilongo kyaye habe teezya wowa mukizi ti Mwaba-kalunga wamu monena lusa lwabule, haba seelela kukumo naye. <verse eid="LUK 1:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Mwaana he bambanyeeye mafuku muhanda makubutuka, haba yena naye mukumutemba ndeezwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.59 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Walawi 12.3</char></note>. Habavula kumu hunika zina dya shaye Zakadiya, <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Ila, najye na mwaana bya bajyongodela ti: «Nda bebya, mwaana uhunikibwa zina dya Yohane.»  <verse eid="LUK 1:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Naibo haba musaudila ti: «Ko! Mukilongo kiinu ndakudi mundu nee yumo kitaanibwa dedya zina!»<verse eid="LUK 1:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Kwa bebya haba yuujya shaye na mwaana kwaku musungila na minyu, ti: «Ndikezina dyaukivula kuhunika mwaana?» <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Zakadiya bya bahajya kaba kalubao bya sinya haulu hako ti: «Zina dya mwaana ni Yohane.» Ibo booso haba kanya (ao kukeka). <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Akeaŋa mu bua, ludimi lwa Zakadia halwa hanguka lungi, bya somba lungi kuyakula na kushisha sisu Kabejya. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Haŋo bandu booso ba tonono naye haba teejya moyo. Na wowa musau hawamwangalala mabua mooso mu bituulu bya kisi kya Yudea.<verse eid="LUK 1:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Bandu booso beteezya woowa musau haba siki kwiyuujya mumatima maabo ti: «Yuu mwaana wabutuka huyakana mundu wa yike namuna?» Kwinikindu butangala bwa Kabejya buvane kukumo naye.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa zakadia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Zakadia shaye na mwaana, bya yudibwa na tima dya Kabejya, bya busha na kuyakula biibi:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />«Watumbibwe Mwaba-kalunga Kabejya wa Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:68">kumona waava kuvanyangujya bandu baye na kufuule bandu baaye.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Watuvishila wakutufuula yidi na butangala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:69">wanyomokela mukilongo kya muvubi waye Daudi.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Yeya yidi bebya kukidila bye badijyeye kalee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:70">kukidila babushi* baaye basidi na bubi.<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />Ti, hutuvishila wakutu fuula mu biboko bya balwishi biitu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:71">na kunyomoka mubiboko bya baaba booso baki tubenganga.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Wemonesha lusa lwaye kudi bashitu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:72">na ndeluba kilao kyaye kitokatoka. <verse eid="LUK 1:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Weeta bebya kukidila bebya bye lapileye Abulamu shitu mukulu:<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />Ti utufuula mu biboko bya balwishi biitu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:74">mukuboya ti tumuvubile kusidi moyo,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />mubutooke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:75">na mukuta bidi mubuludi busu bwaye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:75">mafuku mooso mubuyakane bwiitu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.75 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Sombelo 22.16-17</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Na beebe mwaana waami, utaanibwanga mubushi* wa Kabejya yidi haulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">kumona njyoobe husosoka busu bwa Vidi-nyambi kusosoka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">kwaku boya ti umulungakanyine zila.<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />Na njyoobe usaudila bandu baaye ti waava mukubafuula,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:77">muku bamonena lusa bubi bwaabo.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Kumona Kabejya wiitu ukiyakananga na lusa lwabule,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">hutuvishila mwimwi wa haulu bidi munyinya wa mukisi hutu munukila.<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />Humunikila baaba badi mumukunga, na mumwiziizi wa kumota,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">kwa kuboya ti watunyangujye kulonda zila ya nyaa.»<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Yowa mwaana bya kula, na kuhama mukulu fondo. Bya yena kukayakana mulungu mupaka bebya bye kwi monesheeye hululu kukisi kya Isilaeli.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Kubutuka kwa Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mat 1.18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Mu maa masu, kolo wa Lumi Kaizalia Ogusto bya hana kilao ti bandu booso ba sinyibwe mazina moomwa mu kisi kye tangadibwa na Lumi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kokwa kusinya mama mazina ma bandu ye tebwa mukuboya ti kila mundu wayakane mukuloosha mulambo kudi kolo wenange Loma.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Kokwa ku sinyibwa kwa mazina lwendo lwa busu yetebwa mukindi kyene Kilenio mukulu wa Silia. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Bandu booso habaava mukukwisinyisha mazina, kila yowa mumukola waaye wakubutuka.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Yozefu naiye bya nyomoka mukisi kya Galilaya mu mukola wa Nazaleti. Bya yena Yudea mumukola we butukila Daudi ukitaanibwa Bethelehemu, weyena kokwa kumona wene wa kilongo kya Daudi. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Mukuyeena mukukwisinyisha bya yena na Malia, musika wenangiye muku musongola naiye wene na yimi tonono na kubutula. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Habenange kokwa ku Betelehemu, mafuku maye makubutula hama bambana. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Haŋo bya butula mwaana waaye wabusu wa mwamulume, bya muzikila ngubu ya mwaana mulebeela na kumutandibika musaani dya kudishila nyama, kumona nda bemona bua mu kyende kya baini.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaika wasaudila baki dindikijya mikoko kubutuka kwa Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Mu kyakekyee kisi, kwenange baki dindikijya. Baaba badindikijyi be yakananga kumangene kwaku dindikizya nyama yaabo. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Malaika wa Vidi-nyambi bya banyomokela mukivuku, na mwimwi wambunda ya Kabejya byawa bamunukila mbanga yooso. Haba tiina koo kwa kwinikindu. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Ila Malaika* bya basaudla ti: «Ndamutiina, kumona ti namuvishila musau ulweela huyakana wabandu booso kuseelela kwa bule. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Leelo diino mufuudi wiinu wabutuka mumukola wa Daudi, kitaanibwa Kilisito, lungi Vidi-nyambi wiinu. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Kimumonesha ti niiye ni kiiki, mubanga mwaana wazikibwa ngubu ya kubutuka, na watandibikibwa musaani yakudishila nyama.» <figure style="fig" alt="les bergés reçoivent la nouvelle de la naissance de Jésus" file="WAO3803b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="2.12">badindikijyi bateejya musau wakubutuka kwa Yeesu</figure><verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Mukivuku bobo, yowa malaika bya moneka na kiandu kikata kya Malaika bangi kunyomokela haulu, habasiki shisha Kabejya ti: <verse eid="LUK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />«Kabejya watumbiibwe ku haulu, na bandu baaba bakivuleeye mukisi bayakane nyaa.»<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Badindikijyi bayeena mukumona mwaana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Baba Malaika habakwisamijyena na baba bakidindikijya habahaluka haulu, ni badindikijyi habasomba kukwisaudijyena ti: «Kwabiibi tweene bangu ku Bethelemu tukamone maama manyomokela, maama maava tusaudila Vidi-nyambi.» <verse eid="LUK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Haŋo haba yeena kokwa yayaya ku Bethelehemu, habaka banga Malia na Yozefu na yowa mwaana mutokatoka mutandabale musaani dyaku dishila nyama. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Haŋa baba badindikijyi habeewa kumona mwaana haba yena kukasaula wowa mukizi webasaudila Malaika kukidila yowa mwaana. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Bandu booso be teejya wowa mukizi waba dindikijyi haba kanya kwa bule. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Ila Malia, we bika maa mauya mooso mutima dyaye na bya yakana mukumahejya fikidijyo. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Kumongo baaba badindikijyi haba haluka. Beyenanga kushisha Kabejya na kumuyimbila kukidila mauya mooso mabava teejya na kumona. Kumona bava banga mauya mooso byakebee biva basaudila malaika.*<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwaana waunikibwa zina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Mwaana hebambanyeye mafuku muanda ya kubutuka, habamukijya mu nyoo dya kumutemba ndeezwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndeejywa ya Bayaudi yikikwikidijyena na nyoo dya ba lega, basongola, yikishwala batende kumwiito</char></note> Byaba muhunika zina dya Yeesu, zina dye moneshebwa na Malaika busu Malia ndeshwala yimi.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wa shwadibwa ku lubunga lwa Kabejya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Mafuku makukwitosha kwa Malia na Yozefu hamabambana kukidila bebya biki yakula Buta bwa Musa, Yozefu na Malia haba mushwala mwaana ku Yelusalemu, kwaku boya ti bamumoneshe kudi Vidi-nyambi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Walawi 12.2-6</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />Beeta bebya kumona yidi businyibwe mu buta* bwa Vidi-nyambi ti: «Kila mwaana wa mwamulume kibutuka wabusu muifu dyanajye uhanibwa kwa Vidi-nyambi.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Kunyomoka 13.2,12.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Na lungi habatuula tudilo kukidila bebya biki yakulanga buta ti: «Yiki bambana kutuula tutiti tubidi ao byokela bibidi bya ngudimba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Walawi 12.8</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Busho dya Simeoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Mumukola wa Yelusalemu kwene mundu yumo wetaanibwanga Simeoni. Yuu Simeoni wene mundu kisumuka buludi busu bwa Kabejya na kumutiina. Wene mukudindila kufuuka kwa kisi kya Isilaeli. Na Tima dya Kabejya dyeene haulu yaye <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Lungi wene wa mumonesha ti ndakumota itu ndeemona Kilisito wayishibwa na Vidi-nyambi. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Simeoni muku moneshebwa na Tima dya Kabejya, bya shwela mulubunga. Bashaye na Yeesu haba shweela naye munda mukuboya ti bamuteele beebya bikiboyanga buta. <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simeoni haya shwala mwaana mu biboko byaaye, bya somba kushisha Kabejya mukuboya ti:<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />«Vidi-nyambi wabambanya bindu bya weebadijya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:29">ukibambana kunguzama miimi muvubi woobe na kwimotele byaami bilweela.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Kumona miimi mwinikindu na kwimonena Mufuudi* wa wavisha.<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />wauva biika tonaa, wayakane Mufuudi* busu bwa bandu booso.<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />yowa Mufudi mwiimwi umunukila bisi byooso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:32">lungi ni yiabila kisi kyobe Isilaeli mbunda.»<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Maama mauya mavayakula Simeoni uvayakula kukidila Yeesu hamakanyisha ba Shaayi. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Ni Simeoni haya bafiiyudila,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.34</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ihani simoni haya bahaazyila fiyiguzyi na isehu kyaata </char></note> haya jyongodela Malia naajye na mwaana ti: «Muteejye bangu: Mwaana yuugu wabutuka uyakana kashu songo kakuzizimisha bandu babule hamukidi haba Isilaeli, na kutalusha babule hamukidi haabo. Uyakana lutondo kunyomokela kudi Kabejya yi bengebwa na bandu babule. <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />Biibi, miejyo ya bandu babule yikifamishibwa yi monekanga. Na bee bunga usubanga bidi yowa wamanikibwa fumu mutima dyaaye.»<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana washisha Kabejya kukidila Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Ubwanangi ŋangabiloto yumu wa mwaazi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Kut 15.20 Debola, Amu 4.4 Huluda, 2Fal 22.14, Mdo 21.9 na misi'a ya Filipo. Yeesu wamonesha hululu tii, ba ŋanga bilooto bya Kabezya nda babanumi yega udi babaazi neebo,</char></note> wetaanibwanga Ana, uvane musi'a wa Fanueli, wa kilongo kwa Asheli. Yowa Ana weta bobo misha muanda ya kutunduka, mulume waaye bya mota. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Haya shaala mwadyangu, mupaka misha makumi muanda na yinaa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mununu wa micha moomi mu gandaa na yinaa.</char></note> Wene mukuyakana mukyende kya Kabejya mukumuvubila bufuku na munyinya mukuajya kusidi kudya. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Naiye bya sosoka mukyakekee kindi na bya somba kuta abee kudi Kabejya. Wene muku saula musau wa Yeesu kudi bandu booso benange mukudindila bebya bifuula Kabejya bandu ba Yelusalema mukusuba kwaabo.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bashaye na Yeesu baaluka u Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Bashaye na Yeesu habaawa kuta bindu byooso kukidila beebya bikiyakakula buta bwa Vidi-nyambi kisha habahaluka naye mumukola waabo kya Nazaleti mukisi kya Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Mwaana haya kula na heekidi na butangala, na hekidi na nyinyi ya bule, na mbejya ya Kabejya yivane bobo kukumo naye.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu mu lubunga* lwa Kabejya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Musha na musha, bashaye na Yeesu bene na bwaama bwa kuyena ku Yelusalemu ku kiandu kya Pasaka*.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Kut 12.13, 23, 27 babwani muuta igandu kya Pasaka* mu masu umi na ganaa mu mwangu wa bunaa.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Yeesu hefisheye misha kumi na yibidi, iye na bashaaye haba banda kukekya kiandu bebya byene bwaama bwaba Yuda.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kubayuda haŋa mwaana wenange wabambanya misha kumi na yibidi, beboya ti iye ndamwaana lungi. Haŋa yene mukuyakula ti watuluka sasa bandu baloa mu dini. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Haŋa kiandu kya Pasaka* hakyeewa, bashaye na Yeesu bealuka kwaabo. Ila Yeesu uvashaala ku Yelusalema haboobwa ebu ndababuyu'a. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Ebu babwanangi munijya tii, Yeesu gudi munda mwa 'igandu ibwanangi ayinanga na bezinaye ba luendo. Habe sumu'a lusu luzima, habakilu mukebela munda mwabezinabo na baba babekwiyukijyena nabo. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Haboobwa ndabumumona. Ni habagalu'a 'u Yelusalema amukebanga. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Masu gasatu ukila, habamuheta munda mwa lubunga* lwa Kabejya mukuyaana tega mubwaata bwa balangidijyi ba buta*, eyu muubatelegejya na mubayujya. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Booso babu mutelegejya mauya maaye, babu kanya manee ga nyinyi yaayi na byeebya byebwanangi mubaluula. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Yosefu na Madiya najyaayi haba bumumona haba kanya. Ni najyaayi haya muyuujya ti: «Mwaana waami, nyaayi kya watuteela biibi? Lola, miimi na shobe tuvanange na susu mukukukeba!» <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Yeesu haya basawiila biibi: «Nyaayi kyamudi munikebela? Ndamuluyu'a tii, yilunihaajya uyaana munda mwa yendi kya Shaami?» <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Haboobwa ebu ndababuyu'a kwakai byebwanangi mubasaudila beebya.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Kumongo, Yeesu bya haluka nabo ku Nazaleti, uvanange mukuta beebya bye musaudilanga ba shaye. Maama mauya mooso, najyaye bya yakana mukumabiika mutima dyaaye. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Na eyu Yeesu haya kula na heekidi na nyinyi, na haya monesha buuya kudi Kabejya na bandu. booso.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Mukandu wa Yoane waku lungakanya zila ya Vidi-nyambi Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:1-8">Mal 1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoh 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Mumusha wa kumi na yitano yabukolo bwa Kaizaili Tibelio, baaba ni beevuba naye: Pontio Pilato wene mukulu wa kisi kya Yudea, na Helode wene kolo wa kisi kya Galilaya, na Filipo mukwaye na Tibelio, wene kolo wa kisi kya Itulea na Talakoniti. Na Lusania wene kolo wa kisi kya Abilene, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Hanasi na Kayafa bene bamupelo bakata. Haŋo ni mauya ma Kabejya hamamuvila Yohane mwaana wa Zakadia kokwa ku lungu*. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Yuhu Yohane bya yeena mu mikola yooso yidi tonono na luyi lwa Yolodani, kusaudila bandu ti: «Ba fundulujye matima maabo na kuyabikibwa mu meema kwa kuboya ti Kabejya wa sheejye bubi bwaabo.» <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Bebya byaye sinyibwa mu kitabu kya Isaya ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">«Mundu yumo ukita mukandu ku lungu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">‹Mubiike tonaa zila ya Vidi-nyambi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">na muolole buludi zila yaaye.<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Kila kinene kiyuzwibwa, kila kituulu kikata na katuulu bishajyibwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Zila yidi buvungame yiololoshebwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">na zila yisidi bilweela yilungakanyibwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Na bandu booso bimona kufuuka kwa tima kwe hebwa na Kabejya.›»<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Kwa biibi bandu babule bemuvila Yohane mukuboya ti bamutudibwe mumeema huvane mukubajyongodela ti: «Banyu mudi kilongo kya nyoka! Ni naani huva bamanya zila ya kujyuuka kiizi kya Kabejya kivanga? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Mumoneshe kwakuta bindu bilweela biki monesha ti mwasama bubi. Na ndamusomba kuyakula muma tima miinu ti:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:8">‹Tudi baana ba Habulahamu!› Kumona ngimusaudila ti Kabejya uki bambana kunyomosha baana mumaa mabu kwa kuhabila Habulahamu. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Muteejye temo dya bikibwa tonaa mu sina dya kila muti. Kwa kuboya ti kila muti husikita bimuka bilweela utembebwa na kukasibwa kumudilo.»<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Kisha kekya kiandu kya bandu hakya muyuujya ti: «Yikibambana tute kai?» <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Naiye Yohane bya bayaka ti: «Yowa yidi na ngubu yibidi waabile yowa husidi na ngubu na yowa yidi na bidyazi wate byakebee.»<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Baki hajya milambu bamo naibo habaava byakebee kudi Yohane kwa kuboya ti bayabikibwe mumeema. Habamuyuujya Yohane ti: «Mulangidijyi bashu tute kaayi?» <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Na iye bya bayaka: «Ndamuhajya mulambu kukila bebya byamwesaudibwa.»<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Balonga-buvadi naabo haba muyuujya, na kuboya ti: «Na baashu tute kaayi?» Naiye bya bayaka ti: «Ndamukuzula falanga ya mundu. Wala ndamu sosela mundu kwa maanu. Mubadile bobo falanga yabakimuabila ya mudimo wiinu.»<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Kumona bandu booso bene muku dindila minyomokela, habasikiejya muma tima maabo ti itu Yohane ubambana kuyakana Kilisito. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Haŋo Yohane bya basaudila booso ti: «Miimi, ngimuyabika mumeema, ila yowa vanga nyuma yaami ni yidi na butangala kungungila miimi. Na sikibambana nee nguangula mikulu yidi kumikalabanda yaye, iye ni yimu mumutula kwa Tima dya Kabejya na kwa mudilo. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Iye udi na puupa dyaye mubiboko byaye kwaku habulula tumuka na mbeewa. Ukumanya tumuka twa ngano kukibikilu kyaye, ila ujyijya mbeewa mumudilo usiki zimika nee lumo.»<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Yohane bya yidididye mukusaudila bandu Mauya ma Lweela, na kubaabila yingi milao yabule.<verse eid="LUK 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Helode wa kasa Yohane Muzitikilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Kolo Helode huvakuzula Helodia mukazi wa mukwaye. Na kumona weeta bingi bindu byabule bidi biibi. Kukidila beebyo Yohane bya muhanunukila. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Ihani Helodi, hayoota ndindi mu bubi bwebu hetebwa nabu udi Yohane: haya mutasha Yohane muzitikilu.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu bamu yabi'a</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat 3.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:9-11">Mal 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Haŋa bandu booso hababuhwa uba yabi'a, Yeesu na eyu haba muyabi'a. Na haŋa hee bwanangi muhaajya, lububi lubu gangu'a,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 5.16; 6.12; 9.18, 28-29; 11.1; 22.41-46; 23.34, 46.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />na Tima dya Kabejya hadya musadila na dibu fwandaana na tagaya. na muhuuya hawahuma u lububi na hawaboya: «Beebe i Mwaana waami waanduvula;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Malaku 9.17; Luka 9.35; 2Petelo 1.17; Zab 2.7. huuya didi hanha ngusobolebwa na Kabezya.</char></note> na miimi niluvudisha na bebe unindu.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Zab 2.7</char></note><verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ilongo kya Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:17">Mat 1.17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Haŋa Yeesu hebufisha misha moomi ga satu. Haya somba uta mwambu waayi. Bandu babwanangi mumu niijya tii, ni mwaana wa Yosefu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:23">Yoowa Yosefu gubwanangi mwaana wa Heli.<verse eid="LUK 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Na Heli gubwanangi mwaana wa Mathati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:24">na Mathati gubwanangi mwaana wa Lawi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:24">na Lawi gubwanangi mwaana wa Meliki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:24">na Meliki gubwanangi mwaana wa Yanai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:24">na Yanai gubwanangi mwaana wa Yosefu.<verse eid="LUK 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Yosefu gubwanangi mwaana wa Matathia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:25">na Matathia gubwanaangi mwaana wa Amosi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:25">na Amosi gubwanangi mwaana wa Nahumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:25">na Nahumu gubwanaangi mwaana wa Esli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:25">na Esli gubwanangi mwaana wa Nagai.<verse eid="LUK 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Na Nagai gubwanangi mwaana wa Maathi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:26">na Maathi gubwanangi mwaana wa Matathia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:26">na Matathia gubwanangi mwaana wa Semeani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:26">na Semeani gubwanangi mwaana wa Yoseki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:26">na Yoseki gubwanangi mwaana wa Yoda.<verse eid="LUK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Na Yoda gubwanangi mwaana wa Yohanani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:27">na Yohanani gubwanangi mwaana Lesa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:27">na Lesa gubwanangi mwaana wa Zelubabeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:27">na Zelubabeli gubwanangi mwaana wa Shealitieli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:27">na Shealitieli gubwanangi mwaana wa Neli, na Neli gubwanangi<verse eid="LUK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />mwaana wa Meliki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:28">na Meliki gubwanani mwaana wa Addi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:28">na Addi gubwanangi mwaana wa Kosamu, Kosamu gubwanangi mwaana wa Elimadamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:28">na Elimadamu gubwanangi mwaana wa Eli,<verse eid="LUK 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />na Eli, gubwanangi mwaana wa Yoshuwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:29">na Yoshuwa gubwanangi mwaana wa Eliezeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:29">na Eliezeli gubwanangi mwaana wa Yolimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:29">na Yolimu, gubwanangi mwaana wa Mathati, Mathati gubwanangia mwaana wa Lawi,<verse eid="LUK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />na Lawi gubwanangi mwaana wa Simeoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:30">na Simeoni gubwanangi mwaana wa Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:30">na Yuda gubwanangi mwaana wa Yosefu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:30">na Yosefu gubwanangi mwaana wa Yonamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:30">na Yonamu, Eliakimu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:30">Na Eliakimu gubwanangi mwaana wa Melea,<verse eid="LUK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />na Melea gubwanangi mwaana wa Mena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:31">na Mena gubwanangi mwaana wa Mathata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:31">na Mathata gubwanangi mwaana wa Natani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:31">na Natani gubwanangi mwaana wa Daudi,<verse eid="LUK 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />na Daudi gubwanangi mwaana wa Yese,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:32">na Yese gubwanangi mwaana wa Obedi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:32">na Obedi gubwanangi mwaana wa Boazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:32">na Boazi gubwanangi mwaana wa Salomoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:32">na Solomoni gubwanangi mwaana wa Nashoni,<verse eid="LUK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />na Nashoni gubwanangi mwaana wa Aminadabu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:33">na Aminadabu gubwanangi mwaana wa Alamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:33">na Alamu gubwanangi mwaana wa Hesoloni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:33">na Hesoloni gubwanangi mwaana wa Pelesi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:33">na Pelesi gubwanangi mwaana wa Yuda,<verse eid="LUK 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />na Yuda gubwanangi mwaana wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">na Yakobo gubwanangi mwaana wa Isaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">na Isaka gubwanangi mwaana wa Abalamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">na Abalahama gubwanangi mwaana wa Tela,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">na Tela mwaana wa Naholi.<verse eid="LUK 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />na Naholi gubwanangi mwaana wa Lelu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:35">na Lelu gubwanangi mwaana wa Pelegi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:35">na Pelegi gubwanangi mwaana wa Ebeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:35">na Ebeli gubwanangi mwaana wa Sala, na Sala gubwanangi<verse eid="LUK 3:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />mwaana wa Kenani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:36">na Kenani gubwanangi mwaana wa Alfaksadi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:36">na Alfaksadi gubwanangi mwaana wa Shemu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:36">na Shemu gubwanangi mwaana wa Noa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:36">na Noa gubwanangi mwaana wa Lameki.<verse eid="LUK 3:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />na Lameki gubwanangi mwaana wa Methusela,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:37">na Methusela gubwanangi mwaana wa Enoki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:37">na Enoki gubwanangi mwaana wa Yeledi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:37">na Yeledi gubwanangi mwaana wa Mahalaleli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:37">na Mahalaleli gubwanangi mwaana wa Kainamu,<verse eid="LUK 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />na Kainamu gubwanangi mwaana wa Enoshi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:38">na Enoshi gubwanangi mwaana wa Sethi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:38">na Sethi gubwanangi mwaana wa Adamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:38">na Adamu gubwanangi mwaana wa Kabejya.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Shetaani wa labula Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat 4.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mlk 1.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Kisha Yeesu kumutudibwa mumeema, wenyomoka ku luuyi lwa Yolodani, buyudibwe na Tima dya Kabejya. Yowa Tima dya Kabejya bya muyelekejya ku lungu. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Kokwa kwe labudibweeye na Musimbusimbu mafuku makumi manaa. Mu mama mafuku ndee dyanga nee kamo, haŋa hekila maa mafuku bya teejya zala.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Haŋo Musimbusimbu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wewe ni zina dya Shetani muki baangubaangu</char></note> bya musaudila Yeesu ti: «Itu beebe ni Mwaana wa Kabejya, saudila diidi ibwe dya funduluke mukati.» <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yeesu bya muyaka ti: «Yikisinyibwa mubusinye butokatoka ti: ‹Mundu ndakiyakana bobo kukidila kudya mukati<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuejya 8.3</char></note>›».<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Ni Musimbusimbu bya mushwala Yeesu mubua dyaaulu. Bya mumonesha hakeaŋa butangala byooso bwa mumusenge. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Bya mujyongodela ti: «Nikwabila butangala bwooso na mona ya bobwa bukolo, kumona bebya byooso byabengwabila miimi na miimi ngiabila yowa wooso wangi vula. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Biibi byooso biyakana bindu byoobe itu wangunyinamina.» <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yeesu bya muyaka: «Yikisinyibwa ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:8">‹Ni Vidi-nyambi Kabejya woobe waukibambana kumunyinamina</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:8">na kumuvubile iye bunga.›»<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Haŋo Musimbusimbu bya muyelekejya mupaka ku Yelusalemu, Byamu bika kusongo ya lubunga* lwa Kabejya na kumusaudila ti: «Itu udi Mwaana wa kabejya, ukwikase kunyomokela haŋa mupaka haasi; <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Kumona yiki sinyibwa ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">Kabejya usaudila malaika* baye bakudindikizye.<verse eid="LUK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Na lungi ti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:11">‹bikushwala mubiboko byaabo, kwaku boya ti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:11">ndukwi kukala kidimba kyoobe muibu.›»<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Yeesu bya muyaka ti: «Businye butokatoka buki boya ti: ‹Nduyakana wakulabula Vidi-nyambi woobe.›»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuejya buta 6.16.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Haŋo haŋa heewa Musimbusimbu kumulabula mukila kindu, Musimbusimbu bya musama Yeesu kwa kudindila mu kindi kingi.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wasomba mudimo waaye ku Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat 4.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mlk 1.14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Nyuma ya haaŋo Yeesu bya haluka ku kisi kya Galilaya, na butangala bwa Tima dya Kabejya. Na musau waye hawa mwangalala mubisi byooso bya mumangondo. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Bya somba kulangidila bandu muma sinagogi* maabo, na bandu booso haba yakana muku mushisha.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bandu ba Nazalethi bamubenga Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13.53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mlk 6.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Haŋo Yeesu bya yena Nazaleti kokwa kwe lelebweeye. Lufuku lwa Sabato, bya shweela mu sinagogi ya Yaudi kukidila bwaama bwaye, bya taluka kwaku boya ti wasome businye bwa Kabejya, <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />na haba mwabila kitabu kivungiibwe kya mubushi Isaya. Bya humbula kitabu na kubanga bua haŋa habe sinya:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />«Tima dya Kabejya didi haulu haami, kumona wangulalabisha maani kwaku saudila tushuvi mauya maleela,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Uva nguyiisha kwaku boya ti na saule hululu kuangudibwa kwa baba badi buzitikibwe kuangudibwa kwaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">na bakufu kumbudiibwa kwa meeso maabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">na kubalekela baba beene muku monenebwa.<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />Na kuta mukandu wa musha wowa umonesha Vidi-nyambi mbejya yaye.»<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Haŋo kisha Yeesu kusinyulula, bya vunga kekya kitabu, bya kialusha kwa muvubi, na bya yakana haasi. Bandu booso beene mu sinagogi* bee fiikidijya meeso kudiye. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Haŋo Yeesu bya somba kuba saudila ti: «Leelo diino, maama Mauya matokatoka mabambana kwamudi banyu bakinguteejya.» <verse eid="LUK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Bandu booso habasiki hanuka kukidila mauya ma mbejya mee saulangeye, habasiki kwiyujyujyena ti: «Yo! Yuwu nda mwaana wa Yosefu?» <verse eid="LUK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yeesu haya basawiila: «Muni hondolwedi musunga guugu: ‹Ŋanga wayifuula eyu munindu!› Gungi mwanisawiilanga lungi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:23">Tubu telegejye byooso byatubu u Kapelanaumu, ubiti na kuni u moola goobe.» <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Gungi Yeesu haya boya: «Nami sawiila unindu, nganga biloto nangi yumu wabalutabu'anga mu moola waayi gootote'a. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Unindu namisawiila, ubwanangi badyangu babutu mu Isilaeli mu ihindi kya nganga biloto Eliya, mu ihindi kii'i, vula ndayinywa mu misha yi satu na miangu mutubaa, na ashwa kaatakaata hakashweela mu isi kyooso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola 1Wafalume 17.1.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Haboobwa Eliya ndibu takiibwa ku luula mwadyangu nangi yumu, haboobwa gubu mutakiibwa kwa mwadyangu yugumu ye, wa Salepata mu isi kya Sidona<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola 1Wafalume 17.8-16.</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Lungi mu isi kya Isilaeli kubyee Elisha gukidi muumi, bandu babutu babwanangi na nimba. Na byeebya ndoodi nangi yumu gubufuu'a, ha Naamani halaa, wa isi kya ba Suliya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola 2Wafalume 5.1-14.</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Bandu booso babwa nangi mu kaa'a sinagogi* hababu telegejya gaaga mahuuya, haba waata iizi kyabubu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Babu waata iizi kya butu, manee Yeesu gububa sawiila tii, lusa lwa Kabezya nda 'u baana ba Isilaeli yega, lusa lwa Kabezya ludi 'u baandu booso.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Ihani haba talu'a, haba mu loosha mu isi kyaabu. Haba mu tutubula haajya wa isi kyaabu kyababu vuba hegulu wa abanjwa. Haba weena u songo ya abanjwa tii, bamu humbi haasi. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Yow 8.59; 10.39.</char></note>Haboobwa Yeesu haya kila mu bwaata bwaabu haya ba funyu'a haya wéena.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu wajyanga muhehe gubi-gubi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mlk 1.21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">4.31 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 4.13.</char>
    </note>Ihani Yeesu haya sala na haya weena u moola wa Kapelanaumu, u ꞌisi kya Galilaya. Lusu lwa Sabato halubu fi'a heekidi muu baluula baaba bandu. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Bandu haba hanunu'a u nindu umona mahuya gaayi gabwanangi na butangala. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Munda mwa sinagogi* ubwanangi mundu gubwa nangi na muhehe gubi-gubi. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muhehe gubigubi ndgudi na mubidi. Gulukebe baandu na bubi. gubuyibagasha 'udi Kabezya. Yeesu wavueya kuu gangula baandu babu gangibwa na butangala bwa muhehe gubigubi na utitiminywa kwa mweedi wa muhehe, eyu ni Musimbusimbu.</char></note>yuugu mundu haya yaba na muhuuya watagadi, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 8.28-29; Malaku 1.24; Yak 2.19.</char></note>«Utusami! kyoobe ngyaayi, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kyoobe ngyayi, mahuya galumonesha bubi na ushidi 'u yinweena.</char></note>beebe Yeesu wa Nazaleti? I 'uboya tii, wavueya kuutu titiminya? Miimi nilukuyu'a beebe bilegela. Beebe ni Muto'ato'a wa Kabejya weebu yiisha!»<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">4.35 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 8.26; Luka 8.24.</char>
    </note>Yeesu haya hanunwiina guugu muheehe gubi-gubi tii: «Gunda nyaa! Na huma munda mwaayi!» Guugu muhehe gubigubi hawa mu honesha haasi mabusu ga bandu, na hawa huma na ngumusuvya nangi hashoo.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">4.36 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 7.28-29; 10.1.</char>
    </note>Bandu booso haba kanya, haba mu sawiila: «Habakilu yi yujyijyeena tii; didi ni huuya dyumini! manee gudi muu jyanga muhehe gubigubi mu butangala bwaayi na muhehe, na hawa huma!» <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Mwiizi wa Yeesu hawa bengenena mu kyee'a, isi kyooso.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wa fuula bandu ba butu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mlk 1.29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yeesu haya huma momwa musinagogi, haya weena u yendi kya Simoni. Haboobwa haya sosoka na haya heta najyayi mweenu na Simoni na kitukutuku kyumini, haba yigaaya udi Yeesu tii, wamu fuudi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">I yendi kya Simoni Petro koo'a 'u Kapalanaumu.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Ihani Yeesu haya vueya haya tebema nena nayu, haya hanunwiina kyee'a kitukutuku. Na kyee'a kitukutuku hakya musama. Haya talu'a hanga haŋa, na eyu heekilu bakela biyaazi. <verse eid="LUK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Haŋa habufi'a yowolwa, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yuba hadibu sala: Yilumonesha tii, Sabato na mizilu yaayi yoohwa, ihani baandu haba somba hangahaŋa uchaala baaba babwa naangi na lufu na ubafila 'udi Yeesu, manee ndabibwanaangi bilegela uta biibi lusu lwa Sabato.</char></note>haba muvwiishila Yeesu, bandu booso babwanangi na lufu halahala. Na Yeesu heekulu ba hibiila yumu na yumu mabo'o, na haya ba fuula booso. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Guugu muhehe gubigubi gubu huma munda mwa bandu babutu hawayabaŋana kwa butu ti: «Beebe i Mwaana wa Kabejya!» haboobwa Yeesu haya batanywiniina na haya banyajya ndaba sagulanga lungi, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Suungu dya Yeesu dyoomutagana Masiya ao Mulondolweezyi, nda dya bweedi bwa bwinaandu, nguboya tii, gudi na mwaandu woo fuula baandu babu gaangibwa na bubi. Yeesu gubutabu'a heebuyuzyibwa na ngana mwatagadi wa lubunga* nena naeyu kuu suba Malaku 14.61-62.</char></note>manee babu muyu'a eyu tii, ni Kilisito.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kilisito i uboya; Masiya, au Gubuladishibwa maŋani</char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu wa sagula Mahuya gahyagahya mu isi kya Yudea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">4.42 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Malako 1.35</char>
    </note>Hakeelu ka bwesha bwayi, Yeesu haya baagala mu isi haya weena mu buga dya eyu bunga. Bandu ba butu habakilu mukeba. Haŋa haba mumona, haba muzimbila na uboya tii, ndibagalanga. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 3.2</char></note>Haboobwa Yeesu haya ba sawiila tii: «Yilunihajya uhanda mahuya ga mwiizi gulegela munda mwa miola yingi, manee i mwambu Kabejya weebu ni yiishila.»<verse eid="LUK 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Na Yeesu haya weena a handa mahuya mu ma sinagogi gooso ga bisi byooso bya Yudea.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yudea: lola Luka 1.5 usinya kuungi kwa ubo'o ni zina dya Galilaya.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yeesu wasobola Badingisi baye ba busu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat 4.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mlk 1.16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Kwene lumo lusu, Yeesu we taluka hangondo yaziba dya Genezaleti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ziba dya Genezaleti: dedya ziba ni dyabakitaanaga ziba dya Galilaya.</char></note>. Bandu babule bavasomba kumufinga, kumona bavavula kuteejya Mauya ma Kabejya. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Bya mona mitumbu yibidi hangondo haziba. Haŋo bakuloba bene mukulozoka mwakale mu yeya mitumbu mukutumba tubabila twaabo. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Haŋo Yeesu bya banda munda mwa mutumbu umo wene haŋa. Wowa mutumbu wene wa mundu yumo wetaanibwa Simoni. Yowa Simoni, Yeesu bya musaudila ti waumbe ashoo mu meema, munonga ashee na kibimbi bya yakana moo munda, na kusomba kulangidila bandu.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Haŋa hewa Yeesu kulangidila, bya saudila Simoni ti: «Tulusha mutumbu kokwa kudi muyungu, haŋo mukakase tubabila twiinu mukwate bibelelo.» <verse eid="LUK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simoni bya muyaka ti: «Mulangidishi, twatua leelo bufuku booso nee kamo kaku kwaata. Ila, kumona ti jyoobe wasaula nikasa lungi tubabila mumeema.» <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Haŋo habekaasa tubabila mumeema, haba kwaata bibelelo bya buule, na tubabila twaabo hatwa somba kuhandika. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Ni haba taana bezinabo bangi bene mumutumbu hungi, kwa kuboya ti baave bava banyanguzye. Booso habakwata bibelelo, na kuyujya mitumbu yooso yibidi haya somba kumotoka mu meema.<verse eid="LUK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Simoni Petelo he moneeye beebyo, bya hona manyu fuka busu bwa Yeesu nakusaula ti: «Ee ha Vidi-nyambi wandi hezela busu bwaami, Kumona miimi mbidi mundu yidi na bubi!» <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Simoni uvayakula beebya kumona iye na beezinaye be hanunuka kwabule kukidila bungi bwa bibelelo byabeekwaata.<verse eid="LUK 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Byakebee Yakobo na Yohane, baana ba Zebedayo naibo bavane mukuloba na Simoni, naibo habahanunuka kwa bule. Ila Yeesu bya jyongodela Simoni ti: «Ndutiina, kusombela leelo uyakana wakuloba bandu.» <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Haŋo haba tulusha mitumbu haŋongo haba sama byooso na kujyanga Yeesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wa fuula mundu yumo wa kivu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mlk 1.40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Lumo lusu, haŋa Yeesu wene mu humo mukola. Mundu yumo wene na kivu lukoba lwooso. Haŋa heeva moneye Yeesu, byaona manyu fuka busu bwa Yeesu lukebo mupaka mumateke na kukwiaya na Yeesu ti: «Vidi-nyambi itu wavula, ukibambana kungufuula.» <verse eid="LUK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Haaŋo Yeesu bya holola kiboko, bya mulengela yowa mundu na kuyakula ti: «Navula, fuuka!» Akeaŋa, bisiteye too. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Haŋo Yeesu bya saudila yowa mundu ti: «Ndusaudila mundu nee yumo wuuwu musau. ila yena uka kwimoneshe bangu kudi mupelo,* na ukatuule bindu kukidila bebya byesinya Musa kwaku monesha ti wafuuka».<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yowa mundu weyakana mukumonesha bamupelo ti wafuuka, wetanganga bebya kwakuboya ti bamutabuke kuyakana lungi na bandu bangi. Lola Walawi 13.45-46, 14.1-32</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Ila nembebya, mbunda dya Yeesu hadya mwangalala mabua mooso. Biandu byabule byabandu haba kumaana kwaku teezya mauya maaye. Na kwaku fula nyifu yaabo. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Ila Yeesu bya yakana mukuezela na kuyena mubua disidi bandu kwa kuajya Kabejya.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wa fula mundu yidi bulebele bibandu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mlk 2.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Lumo lusu Yeesu wene mukulangidila bandu. Mafalisayo* bamo na balangidishi bamo ba Buta benyomoka mumikola yooso ya Galilaya na ya Yudea na ya mukola wa Yelusalemu booso bene haŋa; na butangala bwa Vidi-nyambi Kabejya bwene naye kwaku fula baaba bene na lufu.<verse eid="LUK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Bandu bamo habaava kushwala mundu yumo yidi bulebele bibandu mu kipoyo. Habasikikeba zila yakumu shwejya mukyende kwaku mubiika busu bwa Yeesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Haŋo kukidila bungi bwa bandu, ndabeemona zila yakushwela naye. Kwabiibi haba banda naye haulu hakinduulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bayaudi bamo, mukuluka byende byaabo, benange mukubaaza miti haulu kisha babika haulu haayo mapaa.</char></note>, haba humbula mamo mapaa na habamushajyila hamukidi habandu, busu bwa Yeesu iye bobo mukipoyo kyaaye.<figure style="fig" file="WA03824b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="5.19">Bandu bakijyila mundu yidi na lufu kukinduulu kya kyende </figure> <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Haŋa heeva mona Yeesu butabuke bwa baaba bandu kudiye, bya saudila yowa wene na lufu ti: «Mwizinami, wamonenebwa lusa bubi bwoobe!»<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Baaba <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lala Isa 43.25; Luka 7.49; Yow 5.12</char></note>Bafalisayo na baaba balangidiji ba Buta*<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Balangidi ba Mahuya Golulu* babwanangi na mwaambu goo, langidila na umonesha hululu byeebya bilusagula Mahuya Golulu* na mizilu yiingi ya Bayuuda.</char></note> habasomba kukwiyujya: «Ngwabini yuugu ki kaya Kabejya,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Babu sagula biibi manee goo niizya tii, Yeesu gudi muu yiha, eyu muniindu butangala bwa Kabezya boo bagasha bubi budi muunda mwa baandu. Lola (Luka 7.48-49).</char></note> Ndaudi mundu gudi na butangala boo bagasha bubi, ha Kabejya halaa!»<verse eid="LUK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Na Yeesu gubuyu'a migejyu yaabu, haya bayuujya ti: «Ngyayi kyamudi muu gejyela biibi mu matima giinu? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Munguzaudile, ngyaayi idi ihela heela mukuyakula, umusawiila mundu ti ‹Wafwilwa lusa mu bubi boobe,› ao kusaula ‹Talu'a na usumuke›? <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 8.20</char></note>Haboobwa, ngivula muyuke ti miimi Mwaana wa mundu mbidi na butangala bwakufila lusa bubi muune mumusenge.» Kisha, yeesu bya jyongodela yowa yidi bulebele bibandu ti taluka ubuule kipoyo kyoobe na ualuke kukyende kwoobe. <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Hakeaŋa yowa mundu bya taluka busu bwa bandu booso, na bya buula kipoyo kyaaye kivanangiye mukutandandabadila bya yena kwaye kushisha Kabejya. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Baaba bandu booso haba kanya kwa bule na habatiina. Habasikishisha Kabejya mukuboya ti: «Leelo twamona bindu byatu hanunusha!»<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wasaudila Lawi wamujyange</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mlk 2.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">5.27 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 4.19</char>
    </note>Biibi habibu kila, Yeesu gubu huma haajya, haya mumona yoowa gulu haajya mitulu yumu wabalu teena Lawi, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lawi, hanha bamu teena byeebya bya babu muteena mu kitabu kya Malaku 2.14; mu kitabu kya Mat 9.9 bamu gabila zina dya Matayo.</char></note>wayaana mu bilo dyaayi. Yeesu haya musawiila: «Unikumbi mimi!» <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 5.11; Mat 4.19</char></note>Lawi haya talu'a, haya siga bindu byaayi byooso na haya mu kumba Yeesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">5.29 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 15.1</char>
    </note>Biibi ukila, ihani Lawi haya mu teela Yeesu igandu kyatakyata u yendi kyaayi. Mu kyee yendi mubwa nangi balu haajya mitulu na bandu bangi babutu babwanangi muudya hamonga nabu. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mdo 23.9; Mat 9.11</char></note>Hababu mona biibi Bafalisayo* na balangidijya ba Buta* habakilu ŋunuŋuta na usawiila mitongi ya Yeesu tii: «Ngyaayi kya mudi muudya hamonga na unywa hamonga na baaba balu haajya mitulu na baluta bubi?»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baandu badi na mbuunda yibiyibi. Babu bataŋana biibi manee ebu, babu mona baandu booso bashibu kuumba Mahuya Golulu bidi ebu. Baaba babuta ndiindi 'u biindu byaba mona ebu bya busadi, bidi byeebya; utuula mitulu, na bingi bya butu.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yeesu haya balunga tii: «Baaba badi na mubidi gushidi na lufu, nda balukeba gooba mubuki. Haboobwa mbaaba badi na lufu balukeba bandu booba fuula. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Yow 3.17</char></note>Yeesu haya basawiila; shibu vueya kuukeba baba batebami, haboobwa nibu vueya kukeba baba badi na bubi tii basami bubi.»<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uhajya nangudya biyaazi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mlk 2.18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">5.33 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 7.18; Yow 1.35; 3.25-26; Mat 14.17; Malako 2.18-22</char>
    </note> Bafalisayo bamu* haba musawiila Yeesu: «Mitongi* ya Yohane lu yabika na baaba yiishu balu haajya ndaba ludya biyaazi na u haajya kwa butu. Haboobwa baaba boobe ndabaluta biibi, baludya na unywa. Ndabalu ziti'a bi yaazi.» <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Yow 3.29; Mat 14.17; Malako 2.18-22</char></note> Yeesu haya ba lunga: «Baaba babu lagibwa u igabu kyoo yi tundu jyeena balu zila biyaazi ishu mweedi wa igandu gudi hamonga nabu? Hebo nda beebo. <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 9.22; Mat 14.17; Malako 2.18-22</char></note>Habobwa ihindi kyafi'anga haŋa yuugu ngana wa halusi haya bagalanga mu bwaata bwaabu; mu kii'i ihindi, baziti'anga biyaazi.»<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">5.36 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 14.17; 9.16,17; Malako 2.18-22</char>
    </note>Yeesu haya bateela muele guugu, haya basawiila: «Nda 'udi mundu gulu bugula ilaka kya ngubu yihya na u kinami'a mu ngubu yuluulu; ishu boota bibi, kii'i ilaka kya tatununanga boobwa buhandi'i bwa ngubu guluulu, na kii'i kilaka ihya nda kyoo namata bilegela mu ngubu guluulu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Musunga guugu gudi muu tugabila nyinyi yilayila ya umuyu'a Yeesu bilegela. Baaba badi na ndangizyu ya Bayahudi, nda balutabu'a ndangizyu ya Yeesu. Yilu haazya mbala nanu bisonga nanu.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 14.17; Malako 2.18-22</char></note>Nda 'udi mundu gulu bii'a divayi dihya mu biseba byuluulu. Ishu boota bibi divai dihya dyahandanga bibi biseba na dya hudi'anga dyooso haasi. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Ila <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 14.17; Malako 2.18-22</char></note>Divai dihya ikibikibwa bobo mu taba dya biseba bihya. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 14.17; Malako 2.18-22</char></note> Nda 'udi mundu nangi yumu luvula unywa divai dihya ishu gubunywa mabusu divai dyuluulu. Nguboya tii: ‹Dedya divai dyuluulu ndilegela.› »<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Yeesu ni Vidi-nyambi wa sabato*</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mlk 2.23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Lusu lumo lwa sabato, Yeesu we kalanya muma kunda ma ngano, badingisi baye haba yakana mukubela bitombo bya yeya ngano, habasiki tikinya mubiboko byabo na kudya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mundu itu wakila mukunda udi na zala uvanange na sambo ya kutemba ao kudya bidyaazi bya koma. Kuta beebya ndayeene kuyiba. Lola Hejyo dya buta 23.26</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Bamo mafalisayo* haba bayuujya ti: «Kwakayi mwaata kindu kikibengebwa na buta* bwiitu kutebwa lusu lwa sabato*?» <verse eid="LUK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yeesu bya ba yaka: «Mbini, Ndamweesinyulula keekya kyeta Daudi lusu lumo yene iye na bezinaye habenange na zala? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Weshwela mulubunga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mumafuku ma kolo Daudi, Lubunga lukata lwene ndalwelukibwa kokwa ku Yelusalemu.</char></note>, byabuula mikati yene ya tuula bandu kudi Kabejya. Bya yidya, na kuabila baba benangiye naye, nee ti mikate bidi yeeyo mbamupelo bobo ni bene bakudya.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola 1Samueli 21.2-7</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Yeesu bya basaudila lungi: «Jyaami Mwana wa Mundu yidi Vidi-nyambi wa sabato.»*<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wa fuula mundu lusu lwa sabato*</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mlk 3.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Lufuku lungi lwa sabato*, Yeesu bya shwela mu sinagogi, bya somba kulangidila bandu. Muyeya sinagogi mwene mundu yumo wene na kyazaza kyamwajyo mulume kilebele. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Balangidishi ba buta* na Bafalisayo* beyundila Yeesu kwa bule, itu ufuula yowa mundu lusu lwa sabato*; Beeta bebya, ti bamone huya dya kufiikila Yeesu. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Haŋo Yeesu wene wa yuka miejyo yaabo. Yeesu bya jyongodela yowa vane na kyazaaza kilebele: «Taluka na uve busu bwa bandu booso.» Yowa mundu bya taluka na bya yena busu bwa bandu booso.<verse eid="LUK 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Kisha Yeesu bya basaudila baba balangidishi babuta na Mafalisayo ti: «Nabayuujya: ngikayi kikivula buta bwiitu tuyakane mu kuta lufuku lwa sabato? Kuta buuya ao kuta bubi? Kufuula mundu ao kumuyaa?»<verse eid="LUK 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Yeesu bya ba lola booso ni bya saudila yowa mundu ti: «Holola kyazaaza kyobe.» Bya kiolola na hakeaŋa hakya fuuka. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Ila baaba bafalisayo na balangidishi ba buta* habayula baa na kiizi. Haba somba kukwiyujyujyena ti bamuteele Yeesu kaayi.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wa sobola badingisi* kumi na babidi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mlk 3.13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Lufuku lumo, Yeesu bya banda kukituulu mukuboya ti waajye Kabejya. Na bya hajya bufuku bwooso mupaka mukisi. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Mweesa waye mukisi, bya taana mitonge baye, bya sobola kumi na babidi hamukidi haabo, na kubaunika zina dya «Badingisi.» <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Ni baaba: Simoni, yowa we hunika Yeesu zina dya Petelo na mukwaye we taanibwa Andelea, na Yakobo, na Yoane, na Filipo na Baltholomayo, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />na Matayo, na Tomoso, na Yakobo mwana wa Alfayo, na Simoni ukitaanibwa kivula kisi kyaye, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />na Yuda mwana wa Yakobo na Yuda Iskaliota, niyowa we tuula Yeesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu walangidila bandu na kufuula badi na lufu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mat 4.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Yeesu Bya sala kunyomokela ku kituulu kukumo na mitongi yaaye. Hesosokeye mudimo bua didi kisazabaleela, bya tukama. Bya banga kiandu kikata kya badingisi baye, na kiandu kikata kyabandu benyomokela mukisi kyooso kya Yudea, na mumukola wa Yelusalemu, na bamwaajyo wa Tilo na Sidoni yene hangodo haziba. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Baaba bandu beeva kwaku muteejya Yeesu, na wafuule nyifu yaabo. Na bandu bene basubishwa na mizuka naibo we bafuula. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Bandu booso bevulanga kumulengela, kumona butangala bwe nyomoka munda mwaye bwe bafuula booso.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fiyujyi na kukokolebwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mat 5.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Haŋo Yeesu bya lola badingisi baye na kubajyongodela ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">«Buuya banyu badi tushuvi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">kumona butangala bwa Kabejya* budi bwiinu!<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Buuya banyu baki teejya zala kiino kindi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">kumona muyakana nabidyaazi kwa bule! Buuya banyu, bakidila kiino kindi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">kumona musea! <verse eid="LUK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Buuya banyu itu bandu bamubenga, itu bamu tonda, bamukaya na kuteena mazina miinu bibibibi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:22">kukidila miimi Mwana wa Mundu. <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Haŋa hivanga maama mauya, muyakane mukuseelele na muvumbuuke! Kumona kitata kiinu ngikata haulu. Ni byakebee, bashabo benange mukusubisha babushi*.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Ila mwakokolebwa banyu badi na mona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:24">kumona ndamute kalee na buuya bwiinu. <verse eid="LUK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Kusuba kwiinu banyu bashiba mukiino kindi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">Kumona hakeano muteejya zala!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Kusuba kwiinu banyu baki sea mukiinu kindi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">Kumona muyakana mukudila na kuyakana kidilo.<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">6.26 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 7.15; Yow 15.19; 1Yow 4.5</char>
    </note>Kusuba kwiinu banyu bandu bakishishibwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:26">Kumona ni byakebee bashabo bene mukushisha babushi* ba manu.»<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uvula ba lwiishi biishu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mat 5.38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7.12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />Yeesu bya yidididye nakuyakula ti: «Lakini banyu bakingundeejya maama ni mangi basaudila: Balwiishi biinu muyakane mukubavula. Na baaba bakibabenganga muyakane mukubateela buuya. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 23.34; Mdo 7.6o</char></note>Baaba balu ba loga muba hajyidi Kabejya waba fiyugudi. Na baaba badi muumi suvya, na muba haajyidi Kabejya wa fiyugudi. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 5.39; 1kolinto 6.7</char></note>Ishu mundu wakuta u tama dimu, umu gabidi tama dya bubidi na 'edyu. Na ishu mundu wa kukujya atagaya koobe, umugabidi na simisi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Atagaya na simisi; Atagaya alu vwaadibwa heegulu wa ngubu yiingi, i boobwa hanha nguboya tii; wamu gabidi na yeye ngubu yidi muunda mwa atagaya </char></note> yoobe. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Kumb 15.7-10; Mat 21.36</char></note>Umu gabidi yoowa wooso waku hajyanga indu kyooso, na ishu mundu wakuujya indu kyoobe na ngumu haajya lungi tii, waku galushidi.» <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 7.12</char></note>Byeebya bya muluvula babandu umi teela, muba teedi byanga bee.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">'U teela baandu byeebya byoluvula baandu 'uku teela Bayuda babuyu'a na baangi mu bwaata bwiichu tulu yu'a. Ba shiitu haba boya, nangu galushila muundu bubi, fuku teela bubi, ha boobwa Yeesu haboya: Muba teedi byeebya byamulula baandu 'umi teela. Yeesu wa kookela musimani. Tuti bibi ndatu samaanga</char></note><verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">6.32 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 5.42-46</char>
    </note>Ishu mwavula baaba balu mivula yega, ngyaayi kya moota kyoo kila bandu bangi? Nda udi! Baaba baluta bubi na ebu balu vula baaba baluta bubi! <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Ishu mwaba teela bilegela, baaba babu miteela bilegela, ngyaayi kyaba mitutwilanga? Baaba badi na bubi na ebu baluta byanga byeebya. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 5.42</char></note>Lungi, ishu mwahaana iyu u baaba bamulu kuuyi dila uba galushila, ngyaayi kya moota kyooba tutwiila? Nda udi! Manee baaba Badi na bubi balu bagabila biyu baaba Badi na bubi bezinabu ebu mulungila ugalushilwa mona yaabu yooso!. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Loma 8.14; Malaku 5.7</char></note>Habobwa banyu mubavudi balwiishi biinu. Muyaani muuba teela bilegela. ishu moota biibi, mwashulanga kwa butu, na banyu mwayananga baana ba Vilulu didi Heegula. Manee eyu gulutanga bilegela u bandu bashiluyu'a buuya bwa mundu na baaba baluta bubi. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Yak 2.13; 1Pet 1.17; 1Yow 3.1</char></note> Muyaanangi na lusa, byeebya Shiinu byeedi muba monena lusa.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nangu mona yega bubi bwa bandu bangi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mat 7.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">6.37 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 7.1; 6.14</char>
    </note>Yeesu haya boya lungi: «Nangu mona bubi yega bwa bandu bangi, na banyu Kabejya, ndoo mona bubi bwiinu. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Utitiminya. I uboya tii, na baanyu Kabezya ndoo mi titiminya</char></note>Ndamu yananga muhindila bandu minomo, na banyu Kabejya ndoo mi hindila minomo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Utitiminya. Luyua utitiminya ni Kabezya mbungu. I uboya tii, nda moo titiminywa na Kabezya.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Mubagabidi bandu bindu, na banyu Kabejya wami gabilanga. Na byeebya Kabejya bya mihabilanga ya yananga yilegela na uyujya na usindidila na mushu. Byeebya bya mulugabila bangi, ni byeebya Kabejya bya ya mi gabilanga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu mabo'o yiinu, uchu baandu badi mu shuula biyaazi bamu balu shwaala mu bamabo'o na mu nduunda.</char></note>»<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">6.39 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 15.14</char>
    </note>Lungi Yeesu haya ba teela gungi muele haya boya: «Mukufu ukibambana kuyelekejya mukufu yungi? Hebo! Itu waata beebya booso babidi kwinikindu biona mukineene. <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 10.24; Yow 3.16</char></note>Mu langidibwa* ndoo mu tambu'a mu langidijyi waayi. Lakini kila mulangidibwa itu waawa kilangidibwa bilweela ni kibambana kuyakana bidi mulangidishi waaye.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">6.41 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat7.3</char>
    </note>Kwa kai ukibambana kumona kashooshwa kasheenene muiso dya mwizinobe, lakini ndudi mukubala kumona ihindi kya muti, idi mu yisu dyoobe? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 18.17</char></note>Kwakaayi ukibambana kusaudila mukwobe ti: ‹sama nakusheejye kashooshwa kadi muiso dyoobe›, haŋo muiso dyoobe mukidi kibangwa kya muti? Beebe udi wandimi yibidi! Sheejya bangu kibangwa kidi mu iso dyoobe ni hausamuna kusheejya kishooshwa kidi mu iso dya mukwobe.»<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baluyu'a muti ukidila bimu'a byaayi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mat 7.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12.33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">6.43 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 12.23</char>
    </note>«Yeesu haya boya lungi; nda udi muti gulegela gulu loozosha bimu'a bibibibi, na nda udi muti gubigubi gulu loozosha bimu'a bilegela. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Muti gooso gulu yu'ibwanga ukidila bimu'a byaayi. Manee bandu nda balukusula amu mu mti wa meeba, na zabibu mu mti wa masengedi ao abavu mu mti wa muhunga. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Na i byanga byeebya mundu mulegela gulu sagula mahuya galegela galu huma munda mwa tima dyaayi, na mundu mubimubi, mahuya gabigabi geelu sagulanga galu huma mububi budi munda mwa tima dyaayi.Manee kwanywa kwa mundu ulusagula yega mahuya gadi munda mwa tima dyayi.»<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baluvuba babidi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mat 7.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">6.46 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Malaki 1.6; Mat 7.21</char>
    </note>Yeesu haya sagula lungi tii: «Ngyayi kya mudi muu niteena, ‹Vidi-nyambi, Vidi-nyambi.› Na banyu ndamudi muuta byeebya byandi mu misawiila? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Lika 11.28; Yak 1.22-25; Mat 8.9-13</char></note>Niluvula ubamonesha munda gulu ni kumba na utelegejya mahuya gaami na ugata byeebya byandi mumu sawiila, gulu fwandana: <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Eyu gulu fwandana na mundu gubu vuba yendi kyaayi, gubu fula haasi na ufi'a u abu. Ukaa'a abu, i kweebu teela iyeezi kyeebu yengela yende, haŋa yogo dyatagadi hadibunywa, na mbila yibu fi'a u yende, yende nda ibu sagala manee yendi ibu lukibwa bilegela. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Haboobwa mundu yoowa wooso gulu telegejya ndangijyu yaami, nanguta indu, gulu fwanda na mundu gubu vuba yendi kyaayi heegulu wa maavu nangu fula haasi. Haŋa habu fi'a mbila u yendi, kyee yendi, kyooso hakya hona haasi kubuu! Na hakya hongo'a kyooso.»<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Yeesu wa fuula muvubi wa mukulu wa Loma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mat 8.5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Haŋa heewa Yeesu kuyakula mama mauya kukiandu kya bandu bemunyunganaga, bya yena ku mukola wa Kafalnaumu. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Muwowa mukola, kwene mukulu yumo wabalonga-buvadi wene na muvubi waye wemuvula sisu, yowa muvubi wene na lufu tabataba mukukala kakuzi. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Yuu mukulu wabalonga-buvadi heteejyeye musau wa Yeesu, byamutumina bamo bakulu ba Bayaudi kwakumuajya ti wave wavafuule muvubi waaye. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Baba banunu habekajya kudi Yeesu, habakwihaya naye kwakwinikindu mukuboya ti: «Yowa mukulu wabalonga-buvadi ukibambana kunyangujyibwa, <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />kumona iye ukivulanga kisi kiitu na niiye weluka sinagogi.» <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Kwa biibi Yeesu bya yena kukumo nabo. Haŋa habenange tonono na kyende kya yowa mukulu wabalonga-buvadi, yowa mukulu wabalonga-buvadi bya yiisha beezinaye kwaku musaudila Yeesu ti: «Mumusaudile ti ndakwisubisha kuva, miimi sikibambana iye kushwela mukyende kyaami. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Ni kumona sivakwimona ti ngibambana nenguva kudiye. Lakini wayakula bobo huya didimo bobo, na muvubi waami ufuukanga. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Kumona miimi mwinikindu ngiyakananga hasi ya butangala bwabakulwami na miimi ngiyakananga na balonga-buvadi haasi haami; Itu na saudila yumo ti: ‹Yena!› Naiye ukiyenanga. Na itu na saudila yungi ti: ‹Viyaa!› Naiye ukiviyanga. Na itu na saudila muvubi waami ti: ‹Tanga Biibi!› na ukitanga.» <verse eid="LUK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Yeesu heteejyeye beebyo, bya hanunuka kukidila yowa mukulu wa balonga-buvadi. Ni bya fundulukila kiandu kyemunyunganga na kusaula: «Nabasaudila ti nee mukisi kyooso kya Isilaeli shemona mundu yidi na butabuke<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Butabuke ni imaani mukibangubangu</char></note> bukata bidi buubu.» <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Baba bandu beyishibwa na yowa mukulu wabalonga-buvadi habeehaluka kukyende hababanga yowa muvubi wa fuuka.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wafukula mwana wa mwadyangu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Nyuma yabebya, Yeesu bya yena mumukola umo ukitaanibwa Naini,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Naini: Mukola udi tonono na Nazaleti</char></note> mitonge baye na bandu babule beyenaa naye. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Haŋa, hetulukeye tonono na kibelo kya lukuta lwa wowa mukola, byakumaana na bandu bavaa kushwala kitumba kyaenda yumo kumifungu: yu henda wemota wene mwaana wa sii wa mwadyangu. Na bandu babule bawowa mukola be yena kufila yowa mwadyangu. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Haŋa hemona Vidi-nyambi Yeesu yowa mwadyangu bya mufiila lusa. Bya mujyongodela ti: «Yeeye ndudilanga!» <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Haŋo, Yeesu byatuluka tonono na sanduku ya kitumba byayilengela, baaba benange mukuyishwala habatukama. Yeesu bya boya ti: «Henda, ngi yakula ti tungumuka!» <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Yowa henda wemota hakeaŋa bya tungumuka, na yakana haasi, na kusomba kuyakula. Yeesu bya mwalusha kudi naajye. <verse eid="LUK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Bandu booso haba yudibwa na moyo, haba somba kumutumbijya Kabejya mukuboya ti: «Mubushi* mukata wanyomokela hamukidi hiitu!» Haba yakula lungi ti: «Kabejya waava kuva fuula bandu baaye!» <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Kekya kindu kyeeta Yeesu hakyabambana mu kisi kyooso kya Yudea na mumikola yooso yatonono naye.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yohane wa yishila Yeesu badingisi baaye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mat 11.2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Mama mauya mooso meeta Yeesu, ba dingisi ba Yohane haba mujyongodeleemo, kukidila beebyo Yoane bya taana badingisi baye babidi hamukidi haabo. <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />Na kubayiisha kudi Vidi-nyambi bamuyuujye ti: «Beebe ni yowa Masiya* uvanga ao tudindile yungi?» <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Baba badingisi habekajya kudi Yeesu haba musaudila ti: «Yohane muyabika ni watuyiisha kwobe tukuyuujye ti beebe ni Masiya uvanga, ao tudindile yungi»<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Mukyakekyee kindi, Yeesu bya fuula bandu babule bavane mukusuba na lufu, na bavanange binema na kujyanga mizuka yabule. Na kumbula meeso ma bakufu babule. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Kumongo, Yeesu bya yaka baba badingisi ba Yoane ti: «Mualuke mukasaudile Yoane mama mooso mamuvakwimonena na kukwiteejyela: Bakufu basomba kumona, na bibula byasomba kusumuka, badi nakivu batooshwa, basikiteezya bateezya, bamote bafukuka, na tushuvi tudi mukusaudibwa Musau Ulweela<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Isaya 35.5-6, 61.1</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Buuya yowa shakuzizimishanga! butabuke bwaaye kwambidi!»<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Baaba badingisi ba Yohane haba haluka. Yeesu bya somba kusaudila kiandu kya bandu kukidila Yahone ti: «Hamweyena kokwa kulungu* mweyena kukalola kayi? Mbini, mweyena kukamona lenge dikitengebwa na muhee;? Ndabeebyo! <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Itu ndabebya, mweyena kukamona bangu kayi? Mweyena kuka mona mundu yidibutubile ngubu yilweela? Ila baba bakikwitubila ngubu yilweela na kuyakana buyakane bulweela, mu kyende kya bukola ni mwabakiyakananga! <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lol Mat 11.9-10</char></note>Haboobwa, muni sawiidi kya mubu weena kuu lola ayi? Mubu mona mubushi? Ni beebya nami sawiila ti, eyu gulukila nganga biloto. Na kwinikindu gungi hulukila mubushi. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Guug'u i Yohane gubu sagudibwa mu Mahuya Gato'ato'a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">‹Lola miimi Kabejya namutaki'a (namuyiisha) muvubi waami wakidi mabusu goobe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">koo boya tii, wakulongedi zila.›»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Malaki 3.1; Mat 11.10; Malaku 1.2; na Luka 1.76. Na ebu babu sagula byanga byeebya.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Nami sawiila tii: «Munda mwa bandu baaba ba butote'a na ba baazi, nda udi mundu mwatagadi umukila Yohane lububimi'a (luyabika). Na byeeba, yoowa gudi mu shoo, munda mwa Butangala bwa Kabejya ni mwatagadi umukila Yohane.»<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Bandu booso na baaba balu haajya mitulu hababu telegejya mahuya ga Yohane, habatabu'a tii, Kabejya muleela ihani haba tabu'a uya na Yohane. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Matayo 22.25</char></note>Haboobwa Bafalisayo na Balangidijyi ba Mahuya Golulu* (Buta), babu keezema byeebya biluvula Kabejya kwa badi. Ihani haba keezema ububumihwa (kuyabikibwa) na Yohane.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yeesu haya boya lungi: «Haboobwa, naba fandakanisha na bandu ba bini, bandu ba guni mulongo? Mbandu ba buyaani buni? Na balu fwandana na bandu ba bini? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Balu fwandaana na magenda babu yaananga u ijyumbidilu, ebu muyi sehejyeena mu igandu imu na imu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">‹Tubu bayimbila tumba ndamubu semba!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">Twami yimbila simu ya madilu haboobwa, ndamubu dila!›<verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Manee Yohane woo bubumi'a heebu vueya, ndi bwanangi muudya mikati na unywa divai, na banyu hamukilu sagula tii: ‹Gudi na misimbusimbu!›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yowani lububumi'a gubu yaana mu buyaani bunyumini, booyi nyumina; lola Luka 1.15.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Haboobwa miimi Mwaana wa Mundu hambu vueya, muudya na unywa, na banyu hamwa boya ti: ‹Mumulodi yuugu didi na afyuulu! Na lunywa maluvu, na monyi dya baaba balu haajya mitulu na baluta bubi!› <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 11.6</char></note>Haboobwa twamona tii, nyinyi ya Kabejya yidi mu buludi udi bandu booso balu yitabu'a.»<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu mu yendi kya Simoni Mufalisayo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu Kibangu-bangu ni: Ahenga-malala.</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Mufalisayo* yumu gubu mutaŋana Yeesu u yende kyaayi kuudya biyaazi. Yeesu haya fi'a mu yendi kya Mufalisayo* haba kiludya biyaazi. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Na mumola guugu ubwanangi wamwaazi yumu, gudi na bubi. Boobwa bweebu telegeejya tii, Yeesu guudi muudya u yende kya yoowa Mufarisayo, haya shwela momwa na kushwaala mu langi gu yuudi bababa na malaasi. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Haya yaana manyuma gaayi, u ma guulu gaayi. Hee kilu dila; haya teevya ma gulu ga Yeesu na masheejyu gaayi. Haboobwa haya ga kuula na fu'i dyaayi na <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">U Bayuda ichu mundu gudi muuvula umosha tii, gulu mu gayidila mundu; gulu mutambula bilegela na unyinamina magulu ga munyini</char></note>u nyinamina magulu ga Yeesu na haya mu hundila malaasi.<figure style="fig" alt="la femme prostitué essuie les pieds de Jésus avec ses larmes" file="WA03839b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="7.38">Wa mwaazi wa masenga watumba magulu ga Yeesu na masheejyu gaayi</figure>. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Ihindi kyee'a yuug'u Mufalisayo gubu mutaŋana Yeesu, bweebu mona biibi bidi muuta yuugu wa mwaazi, haya booya munda mwa tima dyaayi ti: «Mundu yuug'u haya mbwanangi nganga bilooto wambu muyu'a yuugu wa mwaazi gudi mumu lengela tii, ngwa mwaazi wa bini.» <verse eid="LUK 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Ni Yeesu haya mu lunga yowa Mufalisayo ti: «Simoni, nidi na huuya dimu dyoo ku manya.» Simoni haya musaudila ti: «Mulangidijyi, sagula.» <verse eid="LUK 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Yeesu haya muteela mu sunga ti: «Ubwanangi mundu yumu gu bwanangi muba kenda maayu gaayi udi bandu ba bidi. Wa busu gu bu kenda iyu kya dinali mia yi tanoo;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dinali ni mona. Na mona yiyimu ni kitata ibu vubilanga mundu lusu lulumu.</char></note> wabu bidi fwalanga moomi ga tano. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Baaba bandu babidi boobwa bwababu hina bindu byoo galusha, haya bafwiila lusa booso ba bidi. Nakuyujya ngyuni, munda mwa baaba bandu ba bidi wa muvulanga kwabutu?» <verse eid="LUK 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simoni haya mulunga: «Nagejya tii, ngyoowa gu bwanangi na iyu dyatagadi.» Yeesu haya mu sawiila ti: «Wa lunga bilegela.»<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Haboobwa, haya fululu'a udi yoowa wa mwaazi, haya mu sawiila Simoni ti: «Gudimumona yuugu wa mwaazi? Unindu, bwambu shweela muni mu yendi kyoobe, ndubu ni gabila meema tii, na tumbi ma gulu; haboobwa yuugu wa mwaazi, wa tumba ma gulu gaami na ma sheejyu na wa kuula na fu'i dyaayi. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Ndubu ni yambidila, eyu, usomba miimi ushweela, eyu ndidi muusama unyinamina ma gulu gaami. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Ndubu niladibisha maŋani ga vumba u mushu waami, haboobwa eyu, gubutinya malaasi u magulu gaami<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">U Bayuda ichu mundu wa tambula munyini; gubwa nangi mumu tambula na umugabila meema n umulabisha maŋani</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Nakusawiila nangi bungi bwa bubi bwabutu booso bwa yuugu wa mwaazi, biibi bya yoota, wanimonesha hululu uvula kwaayi kwabutu kwa ndidi. Ishu mundu wafwiilwa luusa mu bishoo, wamoneshanga uvula kwaayi ushoo.»<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Hani Yeesu haya sawiila yuugu wa mwaazi ti: «Wafwiilwa lusa mububi boobi booso.»<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Baaba booso babwanangi muudya hamonga na Yeesu haba kilu yiyujyijyeena mu bwata bwaabu: «Mundu wabini yuug'u guudi muuyizimba ubagasha bubi?» <verse eid="LUK 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Hani, Yeesu haya musawiila yuug'u wa mwaazi tii: «Utabu'a koobe kwa kufuula. inanga bilegela.»<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Baabakazi besindikila Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Nyuma ya bebya, Yeesu bya yakana mukunyunga mubisi na mumikola kuyee kusaula mauya ma Kabejya. Baba mitonge* kumi na yibidi be yenanga naye. <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />Na bamo baabakazi be booshebwa mizuka na Yeesu na kufuudibwa lufu, beyenanga naye. Hamukidi habaa baabakazi kwene Malia kitaanibwa (Malia Magdalene), yowa Malia Yeesu wemushejya mizuka musambo. <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Yohana mukazi wa Kuza, yowa Kuza ni kitalukila bandu bakuvuba ba kyende kya Helode; Suzana na baabakazi bangi. Baaba baabakazi bene mukuvubila Yeesu na mitonge baaye na bindu byabo benikindu.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muele wa mundu we kuna kunda dyaye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mlk 4.1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Bandu babule benyomokanga mu mikola mbalambala na bekumanikanga kudi Yeesu. Naiye bya basaudila huu muele: <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />«Mundu yumo weyena kukunda dyaye mukumiana tumuka twaye. Henangiye muku miana totwa tumuka twaye, tumo tumuka hatwaonena hangondo ha muzila. na bakila zila haba sikitufinya na tuni hatwa tudya. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Tumuka tungi hatwaona mumavu mamabu. Na kisha itwo kumena hatwa nyuma kwakukushwa meema mumateke. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Na totwa tungi tumuka hatwaonena hamukidi hameeba. Na mama meeba hameemena kukumo na totwa tumuka hamafinga totwa tumuka. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Lakini tumuka tungi hatwaonena mumateke malweela. Hatwamena na kuhaa mitijya: kila wowa hawa haa tumuka miamia.» Kisha kuwa kuyakula bebya, Yeesu byabajya muuya na kuyakula ti: «Yidi na makushu makuteejya wateejye!»<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwakai Yeesu ukilangidila bandu mumiele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mlk 4.10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Haŋo, mitonge ba Yeesu haba muyuujya ngingu ya wowa muele. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Yeesu byaba yaka: «Banyu mwahebwa mbejya ya kuyuka fyamino dyabutangala bwa Kabejya*; ila kubangi bandu ndabeebyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">ngiyakula mumiele kwakuboya ti: ‹Balole ndabamona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">na bayakane mukuudikijya ndabateejya.›»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Isaya 6.9</char></note><verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wafifulula muele wa mundu we miana tumuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13.18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mlk 4.13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />Na lungi Yeesu bya yakula ti: «Ngingu ya wowa mueli ni yiiyi: Tumuka mauya ma Kabejya. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Totwa tumuka tweona muzila tukimonesha baba bandu bakiteejyanga Mauya ma Kabejya. Naiwo Musimbusimbu waava na ku shejya Mauya mu matima maabo ngasi batabuka na kufuuka muma tima maabo. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Totwa tumuka tweonena mumateke madi na mabu tukimonesha baba bandu bakiteejyanga Mauya ma Kabejya na kumatabuka na tuseo. Ila ndabadiyakananga na mizi munda mwaabo. Bakitabuka mukindi kishenene bobo, na itu balabudibwa basama butabuke bwabo. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Totwa tumuka tweonena mumeeba tuki monesha bandu bakiteejya Mauya ma Kabejya. Ila mulwendo lwabo bakifingibwa na mauya mabule na kukeba falanga, na kalabwa kabuune buyakane, naibo ndabakibutula tumuka tudi bunyingitile. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Ila totwa tumuka tweonena mumateke malweela tukimonesha baba bandu bakiteejya wowa musau wa Kabejya, na kuukwata munda mwamatima maabo na kumateejya, naibo balembelejya kwabule babutula bimuka.»<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muele wa katoditodi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:21-25">Mat 4.21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />Haŋo Yeesu bya boya: «Mundu nee yumo ndakimunika katoditodi kwaku fukikila na ndamba ao kwakubika haasi hatanda. Ila ukikabiika haulu hakibikilo kwakuboya ti bandu habakishwela munda mwakyende bamone kimunyi. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Kumona kindu kyoso kyefyamishibwa kimoneka hululu. Na tufyongofyongo twooso twetebwa tumoneka mukyambala. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Kwabiibi, mukwikengeyele mu maama mamukiteejya! Kumona yowa yidi na kindu, ni kiebwanga kindu kingi. Ila yowa sidi na kindu, na kekya kikiningeye kuyakana nakyo, kikuzudibwa.»<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Naajye na bakwaye na Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mlk 3.31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Kindi kimo naajye na Yeesu na bakwaye beeyena kudi Yeesu, ila ndabeesamuna kutuluka tonono naye kukidila kiandu kyabandu. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Haŋo habamuvishila Yeesu musau ti: «Najyobe na bakwobe badi haaza bakivula kukumona.» <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Ila Yeesu bya saudila bandu booso: «Najyami na bakwami mbaaba bakiteejyanga mauya ma Kabejya na kumakwata.»<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wasamisha muee muziba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mlk 4.35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Lusu lumo, Yeesu webanda mumutumbu kukumo na mitonge baye. Bya basaudila ti: «Tuyabuke ziba twene muyeŋongo.» Haŋo byaba somba luendo.<verse eid="LUK 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Mukindi kyabeyenanga muluendo lwabo, Yeesu bya kwatibwa na tulo, bya tandabala mutulo. Mukivuku, muee unyumine hawayakana mukutenga haulu haziba; mutumbu hawasomba kuyula meema na habayakana mulufu. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Baaba badingisi* ba Yeesu haba tuluka tonono naye, haba mubusha, mukuyakula ti: «Mulangidishi, Mulangidishi twamota!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Yeesu bya buuka, bya hanunukila wowa muee na mama mabimbi; muee hawatalala, hakusite nyaa! <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Haŋo Yeesu bya saudila badingisi* baye: «Butabuke bwiinu budi kuni?» Ila ibo haba habakanya na kuteejya moyo, haba yakana mukukwiyujyujyena ibokwaibo; «Yuu ni naani bangu, wasaudila muee na mabimbi, naibyo byamuteejya?»<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wajyanga mizuka munda mwa mundu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mlk 5.1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Nyuma ya beebyo Yeesu na badingisi baaye haba yena muluendo, habatuyuka na kutukama mukisi kya Bagelasi, kikikwilolejyena na Galilaya muyeya ŋongo ya ziba. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Haŋa hesala Yeesu haŋongo, mundu yumo wawowa mukola weva kwakukumaana na Yeesu. Yowa mundu wene buyudibwe na mizuka, naiye mafuku mabule ndetubila ngubu na ndetandabalanga mutulo mukyende, ila wetandabalanga mutulo kumifungu. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat. 8.29; Malaku 5.7</char></note>Haŋa hemoneye Yeesu, byakwikasa haasi busu bwaye na kubajya muuya na kuyakula mu muuya ukata ti: «Beebe Yeesu Mwana wa Kabejya yidi haulu, kyauki keba kwaami ngikayi? Nakwiaya noobe ndungusubisha!» <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Gubu boya biibi manee Yeesu gubwanangi muu jyanga gugu musimbusimbu wahumi munda mwa yuugu mundu. Gugu musimbusimbu gubwanangi mumu banda bihindi byooso. Nangi byeebya bandu byababu uganga na miyololo ya biela na ingungudi koomu talajya, haboobwa, mweena lusu gubukala miyololo ya biela na uhandanga ingungudi. Lungi musimbusimbu hawa mutaki'a u buga dishi bandu.<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Ihani Yeesu haya mu yuujya: «Zina dyoobe ninani?» Eyu haya mu lunga, «Zina dyaami ni ‹Muyogo› Manee misimbusimbu ya butu yibwa nangi munda mwaayi.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Igandu, ubusagudi bwa Baloma, balonga buvaadi 6000. buubu busagudi hanha budi muu monesha buungi bwa muhehe gubigubi gubwanaangi muunda mwa guugu muundu.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Wuuwu musimbusimbu hagu kilu yigaaya udi Yeesu ndiba taashanga munda mwa ibenga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibenga: ni buga Kabezya dyeebu zitiila munda mihehe yibiyibi muu dindila lusu lwa monga lwa yayi titi mi nyaanga</char></note> kyatagadi kya Gehena.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Mu dyeedya buga mu bwanangi muyogo wabutu wa ngulubi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngulubi: mweena lusu, ngulubi ni bwina nyama bubibubi, ikidila ndangidizyu dya lubunga lwa Bayahudi Lawi 11.7 yamone'a babubu yaana mu didi buga ndaba bwanaangi Bayahudi.</char></note>. Ihani guugu musimbusimbu hawa yi gaaya udi Yeesu washeedi mu muyogo wa ngulubi. Na Yeesu haya ba tabwiila. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Ihani <note caller="+" style="fe"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 8.22-23</char></note>yeya misimbusimbu haya huma munda mwa yuugu mundu, haya shweela munda mwa yeeya ngulubi. Na yeeya ngulubi haya gulumu'a haasi wa ibanjwa ilaila haya kwaa moto'a mbunduu, munda mwa iziba na kumota.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Babwanangi muu dindijya ngulubi hababumona biibi byooso bibukila haba jyonda, na uweena amwanga lajyanga guugu mwiizi u bandu babwanangi u moola na u bibebe. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 10.39</char></note>Haboobwa bandu haba huma haba weena kulola biibi Yeesu byee buta. Haŋa habufi'a nena na Yeesu, habamona yoowa gubwanangi na misimusimbu, yalozo'a munda mwaayi, wa yaana hangondo wa Yeesu, mutubidi ngubu, na ndidi na nyinyi yilegele. Baaba bandu haba mona mooyo. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat. 4.24</char></note>Baaba babu mumona yuugu mundu na meesu gaabu, haba basawiila bandu bangi, byeebya yoowa mundu byebwa nangi na musimbusimbu na byeebya byeebu fuu'a.<verse eid="LUK 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">8.37 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mdo. 16.39</char>
    </note>Haboobwa bandu booso munda mwa kyee isi kya Bagelasi haba tiina. Ihani habamu sawiila Yeesu wabagadi mu isi kyaabu. Manee babwa nangi na mooyo wabutu. Ihani Yeesu haya banda mutumbu haya weena. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat. 5.18</char></note>Yuugu mundu gubufuu'a hekilu vula uweena hamonga na Yeesu. Haboobwa Yeesu haya keezema na haya mu sawiila: <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />«Galu'a u yendi kyoobe na abasawidi byooso Kabejya byeebu kuteela.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:39">Ihani, yuugu mundu haya galu'a na haya weena asawilanga bandu mu moola wooso bindu byatagadi Yeesu byeebu muteela.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu wafuula wamwaazi yumu na ufukula musi'a wa Yailo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9.18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mlk 5.21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">8.40 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 9.18-26; Malako 5.21-43</char>
    </note>Haŋa Yeesu heebu yabu'a lungi mugela wa bubidi wa iziba, igandu ibwa nangi mumu dindila hakya mu tambula bilegela. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Malaku 5.22</char></note>Mukyanga kyee'a ihindi, mundu yumu wabalu taŋana Yailo, gubwa nangi muu tebemena sinagogi*, haya vueya na haya hona u magulu ga Yeesu, hee kilu mugayidila Yeesu tii, weenangi u yendi kyaayi, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 7.12</char></note>menee gubwa nangi na musi'a wa lufu mukuhumina.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Gubwa nangi mwaana waayi yugumu ye, gubwa nangi na misha umi na yibidi. Haŋa Yeesu hebwa nangi ayinanga u yendi kya Yeilo Igandu kyatakya kya bandu ibumukumba.<verse eid="LUK 8:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">8.43 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Lawi 15. 26-30 </char>
    </note>Mu kyee igandu, ubwanangi wa mwaazi yumu gubwanangi na lufu loo susa muloha munda mwa misha umi na yibidi, haaya tuula mona yaayi yooso muu yi fuhulula, ubabuki, babuki ndababu mu fuula! <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 9.20</char></note>Haboobwa hee kyee nanga amushenenanga Yeesu umugongo waayi, haya kwa lengela songo ya ngubu ya Yeesu hanga haŋa muloha gubwanangi mumu huma hawa kama.<verse eid="LUK 8:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">8.45 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 5.5</char>
    </note>Yeesu haya yuujya binu: «Inaani wani lengela?» Bandu booso haba tuna. Ihani Petelo haya boya: «Ngana, mitii gudi mumona igandu kya bandu baku nyungalala na bakufinga mugela gooso!» <verse eid="LUK 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 14.36; Malaku 3.10; Luka 5.17-6.19</char></note>Ihani Yeesu haya boya: «Udi mundu yumu gubu ni lengela manee namona bu tangala bwaami bwanihuma.» <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Yuugu wa mwaazi bwebu yu'a tii, Yeesu wamuyu'a na wayu'a byeebya byee buta, haya yiitutula eyu munindu, eyu muu zeeza, haya hona u magulu ga Yeesu. Haya sagula mabusu ga bandu booso, ibumutaki'a ulengela ngubu, na boobwa bwebu lengela ye, haya fuu'a hanga haŋa. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 9.22; Mdo 15.33</char></note>Ihani Yeesu haya mu sawiila: «Musi'a waami, ulungila koobe kwaku fuula. Inanga bilegela.»<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">8.49 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 8.41</char>
    </note>Hanga haŋa Yeesu eyu muu sagula, hakwa vueya muvubi wa Yailo u humina u yendi kya Yailo, na haya mu sawiila tii: «Edi, musi'a woobe womota! Nangu musuvya mulangidijyi!» <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Boobwa Yeesu bwebu telegejya biibi byaba mu sawiila, haya mu sawiila Yailo: «Nangu tiina. Lungila ye, mona musi'a woobe wa fuu'anga.»<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">8.51 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 4.21</char>
    </note>Haŋa Yeesu heebu fi'a u yendi kya Yailo, ndibu vula bandu booso ushwela mu yendi, ila, Petelo na Yakobo na Yohana hamonga na shaayi na najyaayi na yuugu musi'a.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yiiyi ndingizi yi satu bamo naanga na 'usawiila baandu, byeebya bya fululuanga lwebu lwa Yeesu 9.28-36 na ebu ye, babu yikakula luuya loo hete'a mu bigaandu bya butu bya mbuunda ya Yeesu, mulangidizyi waabu</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 23.27; Mat 9.24; Yn 11.11-13</char></note>Mu ihindi kii'i, bandu booso babwangi munda mwa yendi babwa nangi mumu didila mwaana. Ihani Yeesu haya ba sawiila: «Musami udila. Yuugu musi'a ndikyee mota, watandabala ye!» <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Na ebu haba kilu museha Yeesu, manee babuyu'a tii mwaana womota. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />'Ihani Yeesu haya mu waata kuu bo'o, haya tungula muhuuya na uboya: «Musi'a, buu'a!» <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Hanga haŋa, tima dyaayi hadya galu'a na haya talu'a hanga haŋa. Na Yeesu haya ba sawiila tii, bamu gabidi bi yaazi. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.56 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 8.4</char></note>'Ihani shaayi na najyaayi haba kanya unindu, ihani Yeesu haya ba nyaajya tii, ndaba sawilanga mundu nangi yumu biibi bibuteebwa.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Yeesu wayiisha badingisi baye kumi na babidi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10.5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mlk 6.7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Nyuma ya bebya, Yeesu bya taana ba mitonge baye kumi na babidi na kubaabila butangala bwa kujyanga mizuka yooso, na butangala bwa kufula badi na lufu. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Haŋo bya bayiisha bayeene kusaula mauya ma butangala bwa Kabejya na kufuula badi na lufu. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Bya basaudila: «Ndamushwala kindu neekimo muluendo lwiinu: Nee ngikoma, nee nitaba dyaluendo, nee mukati, nee ni falanga, na ndamushwala nee ni ngubu yibidi. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Na kyende kyooso kyamushwelanga na kutabukibwa, muyakane momwa mupaka bebya byamuezela muwowa mukola. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Itu bandu baumo mukola babenga kumutabuka, muezele mumukola waabo na mukukumune kauto kabidimba biinu, yiyakana kumanyibwa kwabadi.» <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Haŋo, baba badingisi habasomba luendo, habakila mukola umoumo kusaula mauya ma lweela na kufula badi na lufu kila bua. <verse eid="LUK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Haŋo Kolo Helode weteejya musau wa makumo mooso menange mukuteebwa, byabeleka mutima mumama mabeeboyanga ti: «Yohane wafukuka hamukidi haba mote!» <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Bandu bangi beboya ti Elia waba nyomokela, na bangi bandu beboya ti yumo hamukidi hababushi ba kale wafukuka. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Lakini Helode bya boya ti: «Mimi mwinikindu niwetembesha mushu wa Yohane; haŋa nzyuke mundu yuu wangiteejya musau waye?» Na bya yakana na muuma wakumumona Yeesu.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wadisha bandu helufu mia yitano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mlk 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoh 6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Haŋa baba badingisi habee haluka, haba saudila Yeesu byooso byabeeta. Yeesu bya babuula bya yena nabo mubua dya bunga mupaka kumukola ukitaanibwa Bethesaida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Lakini haŋa baba bandu habeyuka kweyeneye habamujyanga. Yeesu bya batabuka tonono naye byabasaudila kukidila butangala bwa Kabejya na kufula baba booso bene na lufu. <verse eid="LUK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Haŋa hayene ti yuba ndadi sala, baba Badingisi* kumi nababidi haba muyila Yeesu na kumusaudila ti: «Ulae baaba bandu, kwakuboya ti bayene mumikola na makunda madi tonono, bakwikebele bidyazi na mabua ma kutandabala, kumona tudi mubua disidi bandu.» <verse eid="LUK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Lakini Yeesu byabajyongodela: «Banyu benikindu mubaabile bidyazi.» Naibo haba muyaka ti:«Haŋa tudi bobo na mikati yitano na bibelelo bibidi. Itu niini twene tukaule bidyazi byakubambana baba bandu booso!» <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />(Kumona haŋa hene hangi babalume elufu yitano), haŋo Yeesu byasaudila badingisi baye: «Musaudile bandu bayakane haasi mubiandu bya bandu makumi matanomatano.» <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Baba badingisi habata bebya byabavasaudibwa, haba yakanisha bandu booso haasi. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Haŋo Yeesu bya buula yeya mikati yitano na bebya bibelelo bibidi, byatundula meeso haulu, byabifiyudila, haya bibela na kuabila badingisi baye kwakuboya ti babiabanyine kiandu kya bandu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Haŋo bandu booso habadya na kushiba. Habakumaanya makombwa meshaala, haba yujya taba kumi na yibidi.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petelo wayakula hululu ti Yeesu ni Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mat 16.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mlk 8.27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Lusu lumo, Yeesu wehajya iye bunga, na badingisi baye bene kukumo naye. Haŋo bya bayujya: «Buune bangu! Kiandu kya bandu kikiboya bini kumbanga yaami?» <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Naibo haba muyaka ti: «Bamo bandu bakiboya ti beebe ni Yohane kiyabika bandu mumeema; bangi bandu baki boya ti beebe ni Elia, na bangi bandu lungi baki boya ti njyumo wa babushi bakalee wafukuka.» <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Haŋo Yeesu bya bayujya: «Ko, na banyu mukiboya ti miimi ni naani?» Petelo bya yaka ti: «Beebe ni Kilisito wa Kabejya.»<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu wajyongola kukidila kumota kwaye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:30">Mlk 8.30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:1">9.1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Mat 16.20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Haŋo Yeesu bya balanga kushu minyee ti ndabasaudila mundu neeyumo dedya huya. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Na byayakula lungi: «Yikibambana Mwana wa Mundu wasube kwabule na kubengebwa na banunu, bakulu babamupelo na balangidijyi ba buta. bimuyaishanga na lufuku lwa kasatu ufukukanga.» <verse eid="LUK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Haŋo Yeesu bya saudila bandu booso: «Mundu wooso wavula kungujyanga miimi, ukibambana kukwibenga iye mwinikindu, wabuule musalaba waye kila lusu wangujyange. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Kumona, mundu kivula kufuula mwejyo waye iye mwinikindu uuzizimisha; lakini yowa yizizimisha mwejyo waye kukidila miimi, uufuula. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Buune bangu, yinyangujya kaayi kudi mundu kuvuka mona yooso yamumusenge, na itu wakwizizimisha ao kukwisubisha iye mwinikindu? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Itu mundu wamona buuvu kungidila miimi na mauya maami, miimi Mwana wa Mundu ni monene yowa mundu buuvu mukindi kyambiva mubutangala bwaami na butangala bwa Shami kukumo na malaika basidi na bubi. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Ngibasaudila bya kwini kindu, kudi bamo bandu bakitaluka haŋa bashakumota busu ndabemona butangala bwa Kabejya.»<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wafunduluka lukebo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mat 17.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mlk 9.2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Mafuku muanda kukila he yakula Yeesu mama mauya, bya buula Petelo na Yohane na Yakobo bya yena nabo kukituulu kwakukaajya. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Henangiye mukuajya, lukebo lwaye halwa funduluka na ngubu yaye hayisite yitokatoka pepeepe. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Mukivuuku, hakwamoneka haŋa bandu babidi bakiyakula na Yeesu, baa bandu ni Musa na Elia, <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />beemoneka mubutangala bwaaulu, habasiki yakula na Yeesu bebya byandi bambanyeye byevileye kwakumota kokwa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 26.43</char></note>Petro na bezinayi babu waati'a na tulu twa ndulubila. Haŋa hababu buu'a haba mumona Yeesu washweela mu butangala, hamonga na bandu babidi batebema hamonga nayi. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Musa na Eliya. Haŋa Musa na Eliya hababu bagala, ihani Petela haya mu sawiila Yeesu: «Mulangidijyi, mbilegela tu yaani hanu! Tuvubi bibumbi bisatu: Imu kyoobe, kingi kwa Musa na kingi kya Eliya.» Haboobwa Petela ndibwa nangi muu yu'a bibi byeebwa nangi muu sagula. <verse eid="LUK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Hanga haŋa Petelo eyu muu sagula, timba hadya huma hadya ba bwiila, na ebu babu tiina unindu habu shweela munda mwa dyeedya timba. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Isaya 42.12; Mat 3.17</char></note>Na muhuuya hawa huma munda mwa timba na hawa boya: «Yuugu ni mwaana wandu vula na wambu sobola. Mumu telegejyi eyu!» <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Mu ihindi kyee'a, manyuma woo telegejya mu huuya, haba mumona Yeesu wa shagala eyu bunga. Ndingizi yaayi haya gunda nyaa. Na ndabu sawiila mundu nangi yumu gaaga mahuya ga babu mona.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">1 Yeesu wa fuula genda gubwa nangi na musimbusimbu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mat 17.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mlk 9.14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Bweesha bwaayi hana hababu sala kwii bandjwa, igandu kyatakyata kya bandu hakya kumaŋana nabu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Mundu yumu mu kyee'a igandu kya bandu, haya tungula muhuya na haya boya: «Mulangidijyi, tasha mesu goobe udi mwaana waami yuugu yugumu. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Mu bihindi byooso musimbusimbu gulu mu banda, na ishu wamu banda i haŋa ndilu yabaŋana, umu sinda haasi na umu salusha mi koo'o na eyu muu huma poofu kwanywa. Guugu musimbusimbu wamu suvya u nindu gulu musama mu bihindi bi shoo yega. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Nibu ba sawiila ndingizi yoobe bamu fuudi, haboobwa ndababu samuna.» <verse eid="LUK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Haboobwa Yeesu haya ba lunga: «Banyu bandu ba leelo bashidi na u lungidila, na bazizimini! Nayaani niinu masu ganga kooboya tii, muni telegejye? Vuisha mwaana woobe hanu.» <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Kumb 32.5</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Boobwa mwaana bwebu vueyanga ashenanga udi Yeesu ye, musimbusimbu hawa musinda haasi kubuu na hee kilu yi sala mu maavu! Ihani Yeesu haya gu tanyunywiina guugu musimbusimbu, hawa huma na mwaana haya fuu'a. Yeesu haya bugula mwaana haya mu gabila shaayi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola luka 7.15</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Haboobwa bandu booso haba hanunu'a kwa butu bwababu mona butangala bwatagadi bwa Kabejya<verse eid="LUK 9:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu waba sawiila lungi byeebya byaya motanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mlk 9.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />«Mu telegejye bilegela mahuya gaaga gandi muu sagula: Ba tulanga Mwaana wa Mundu mu minyu ya balwiishi baayi.» <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Haboobwa gaaga mahuya nda gabu shweela mu mishu ya ndingizi. Na haba mona mooyo woo mu yuujya Yeesu byeebya byee bwanangi muu sagula. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 9.32</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Bibi habu kila, ndingizi ya Yeesu haba kilu yi yuujyijyeena ebu ba nindu, inaani wa shagalanga edi mu bwaata bwaabu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 22.24</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Ihani Yeesu haya yu'a migejyu yi bwanangi, munda mwa ma tima gaabu, haya bugula mwaana wa mulenge haya mu bii'a hangondo waayi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 9.4</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />Na haya ba sawiila: «Yoowa gooso wa tambulanga mwaana wa mulenge bidi guugu mu zina dyaami, wani taambula miimi. Na yoowa wooso wani tambulanga mimi, wamu tambula yoowa gubu nitaki'a. Manee yoowa gudi mulenge mu bwaata bwiinu banyu booso, i yoowa wa yananga edi wiinu.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 10.40; Malako 9.35</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Ihani Yohana haya mu sawiila Yeesu: «Mulangidijyi, tubu mona mundu yumu gubwanangi mu bwaata muu jyanga misimbusimbu mu zina dyoobe. Hatu kidi mumu nyaajya, manee ndilu namata kuni kwa tudi.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Malako 9.38; Hes 11.28</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Ihani Yeesu haya mu lunga: «Nangu mu nyaajya, manee yoowa gushidi mu lwiishi wiinu, gudi mugela wiinu.»<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Moola gumu wa Samaliya bakeezema u mu tambula Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Boobwa bubu bengeneena ihindi kya Yeesu u weena u lububi heebu nenama, haya bagasha mooyo mu tima haya weena u Yelusalema.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Malaku 16.19; Lka 18-31; 19.28</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Ihani haya yiisha bandu mabusu gaayi, na ebu haba weena haba shweela mu moola wa Samaliya koo boya tii, bamu longedi buga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 10.5</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Haboobwa bandu ba moola woowa, haba keezema manee gubwa nangi ayinanga u Yelusalema.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Yohana 4.9; 4.4</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Haŋa ndingizi yaayi Yakobo na Yohana hababu mona bibi, haba mu sawiila: «Vidi-nyambi, gulu vula tu haajya mudilu u lububi waba jyijyi?»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.54 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 4.21; 2Fal 10.12</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Ihani Yeesu haya fululu'a kwabadi na haya ba nyaajya, <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />na ebu haba weena u moola gungi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.56 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Yohana 3.17; 12.27</char></note><verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baaba balu vula umu kumba Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:18-22">Mat 8.18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Haŋa haba bu wenanga mu zila, mundu yumu haya vueya haya mu sawiila Yeesu: «Miimi naku kumbanga kooso kwa wa yinanga.» <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yeesu haya mu lunga: «Milende yidi na mi tubula, na tuuni tudi na mashwa, haboobwa mwaana wa Adamu ndidi na buga dyoo yegela mushu.» <verse eid="LUK 9:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Ihani Yeesu haya mu sawiila mundu yungi: «Unikumbi miimi.» Haboobwa yuugu haya mu lunga: «Ngana, unisami bangu miimi neenangi nazii'i shaami.» <verse eid="LUK 9:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yeesu haya mu lunga: «Sama bandu bamote ba zii'i mundu waabu womota, haboobwa beebe inanga waa sawiidi bangu Butangala bwa Kabejya.» <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.60 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 3.2</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Mundu yungi haya mu sawiila: «Ngana, naku kumbanga unisami bangu nenangi naalagi bandu badi u yendi kyaami.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.61 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Loli Mat 3.2</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yeesu haya mu lunga: «Mundu gooso wa watanga lwasu na eyu muunima, na ishu wa lola manyuma, ndilu bengeneema u yaama mu butangala bwa Kabejya.»<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yeesu wayiisha badingisi* baye makumi musambo na babidi kumudimo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Nyuma ya bebya, Vidi-nyambi we sobola bangi badingisi* makumi musambo na babidi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kudi bitabu bingi bikiyakula ti makumi musambo.</char></note>. Na kubayiisha babidibabidi, kwa kuboya ti bayene kumbala yaye mumikola yooso na mu mabua mooso mevuleye kwena. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Bya basaudila ti: «Bidyazi bya kungula mbyabule, lakini bakungula mbashenene. Kwa biibi, muajye mwini wabidyazi byakungula, kwakuboya ti wayiishe bakungula bidyazi kukunda dyaye. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Haŋa mweene! Muyuke ti nabayiisha banyu bidi baana bamikoko benanga hamukidi habishepele. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Ndamushwala nee mbote, nee ni taba dyaluendo, nee mikalabanda. Ndamutukama muzila kwaku sambitila yumo mundu.<verse eid="LUK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Itu mwashweela mukimo kyende, muyakule bangu: ‹Nyaa dya yakane mukiino kyende!› <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Itu yumo mundu wa nyaa ukiyakana momwa mukeekya kyende, haŋo nyaa diinu diyakana haulu yaye. Lakini itu ndakudi mundu yumo wabebya, nyaa diinu dimualukilanga. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Muyakane mukyakee kye kyende, mudye na munywa bebya byabimuabilanga, kwa kumona ti kila muvubi ukibambana kuebwa kitata kyaye. Ndamubuluuka buluuka kunyomoka mukiiki kyende na kuyena mukingi kyende. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Itu mwasosoka muumo mukola na bamutabuka mwakale, mudye bebya bidyazi byabimuabila; <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />mufuule baba badi na lufu muwowa mukola na mubasaudile ti: ‹Butangala bwa Kabejya* bwa tonanana kwamudi.› <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Lakini itu mwashwela mumukola umo naibo bakushwa kubatabuka, mweene banyu kukila muzila yaabo muye kuyakula ti: <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‹Nee ngauto kamukola wiinu kavatukwata kubindimba biitu twakakukumuna busu bwiinu. Kwa biibi muyuke ti butangala bwa Kabejya* bwatonanana kwamudi.› <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Kwa kwinikindu ngibasaudila ti, lolwa lufuku lwa kusubisha, Kabejya usubisha bandu bawowa mukola kwa mulomo bata kukila kwa baba bandu ba Sodoma.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Musombo 19.24-28</char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lusa lwa mikola yashakufunduluka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mat 11.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />«Yeesu bya yakula lungi lusa lwoobe mukola wa Kolazini! Lusa lwoobe mukola Bethesaida! Kumona ti itu biibi bingulungulu bya mbeeta kwiinu byandi tebwa mumukola wa Tilo na mumukola wa Sidoni, bandu bayeya mikola kee beyakana haasi na kutubila kale gunia na kukwilalabisha muto mukuboya ti bafundulujya buyakane bwaabo. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Ni kumona, lufuku lwa kusuba, banyu musuba binyumine kukila bandu ba Tilo na bandu ba Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Na beebe mukola wa Kafalanaumu, mbini, ukiejya ti ukwibajya mupaka ku ulu? Nda beebyo! Ushajyibwa mupaka kunengo.»<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Haŋo Yeesu bya saudila mitonge yaye ti: «Kimu teejya banyu, miimi ni kiteejyeye, na yowa wooso kiba benga banyu, jyaami ni kibengeye. Ila yowa wooso kingubenga miimi, njyowa wenguyiisha ni wabengaye.»<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kualuka kwa baba badingisi makumi musambo na babidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Nyuma yabebya, baba badingisi* makumi musambo na babidi ba Yeesu habaaluka buyudibwe na tuseo na haba yakula ti: «Vidi-nyambi, nee mizuka yatuteejya hatuvane mukuyijyanga muzina dyoobe!» <verse eid="LUK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Ni Yeesu byabasaudila: «Va monanga Musimbusimbu bivanengiye mukuona kunyomokela ku ulu bidi mwiimwi. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Muteejye bangu: Nabaabila butangala bwakufinya nyoka na kiushi, na butangala haulu ha butangala bwooso bwa yowa mulwishi, na kindu neekimo ndakyakumuta bubi. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Lakini ndamuseelelanga kumona ti mizuka yamuteejya, haŋo museelelange kumona mazina miinu masinyibwa ku ulu.»<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuseelela kwa Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mat 11.25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13.16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Mukyakekee kindi, Yeesu byayudibwa na tuseo kukidila Tima dya Kabejya, bya yakula ti: «Abee Shami Vidi-nyambi wa ulu na musenge, kumona wafyamisha badi na nyinyi na badi na kuyuka makumo maama, bya wamabika ululu ku bashee. Nibeebyo, Shami, kumona ni byauvavula!»<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />Ihani Yeesu haya boya: «Shaami gubu ni gabila bindu byooso mu minyu yaami. Nda udi mundu lumu yu'a miimi Mwaana wa Kabejya Shaayi halaa. Na nda udi mundu lumu yu'a Kabejya Shaami. Ha Mwaana waayi ye, halaa, i gulu mu yu'a, na baaba bandu Mwaana waayi beeluvula uba monesha Kabejya; gulu ba monesha.»<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Ihani haya fululu'a udi mitongi yaayi na haya ba sawiila ebu bunga: «Bandu ba sehelelanga, baaba bandu, ba monanga biibi bya mwanona banyu!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 13.16, 17. Bitabu bingi bilu sagula: buya banyu badimona biibi byamudi muu mona.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Manee nami sawiila unindu tii, ba nganga bilooto* na ba ngana ba butu babu vula umona biibi bya mudi muu mona banyu nda babu mona. Na uvula utelegejya biibi bya mudi muu telegejya ndababu bitelegejya.»<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muele wa Musamalia mulweela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Biibi ukila, mundu yumu mulangidijyi wa Buta* haya tebema, haya muyujya na umutega: «Mulangidijyi, naati bini koo boya tii, na yaani na buumi bwa milumbu na milumbu?» <verse eid="LUK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Na Yeesu haya mu lunga tii: «Babu sinya bini mu Buta bwiitu*? Na gulu ga telegejya bini hoolu ga buulula?» <verse eid="LUK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Yuugu mundu wa Buta* haya mu lunga Yeesu binu: «Yilu ku haajya umu vudi Vidi-nyambi Kabejya woobe mu tima dyoobe dyooso na mubuyaani boobe booso na butangala boobi booso na mu nyinyi yoobe yooso na: ‹Vula mundu gudi hangondo goobe, byeebye byoolu yi vula beebe mu nindu.›»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Kumb 6.5; Law 19.18; Mat 5.43</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Umongo, Yeesu haya mu sawiila tii: «Wa lunga bilegela! Tanga biibi mweena lusu; byeebya na wa yananga.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Law 18; 5; Rum 7.10</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Ihani yuugu mulangidijyi wa buta* gubu vula uyi monesha tii, gudi mu buludi, Ihani haya mu yuujya Yeesu: «Haboobwa inaani gudi watonono naami?» <verse eid="LUK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yeesu haya mu lunga tii: «Mundu yumu gubuhuma u Yelusalema, haya sala mu zila yilu yelela u Yeliko. Hebwa nangi mu zila, haya hulu'a mu babo'o ga bilwanyi. Baaba bilwanyi, haba kuujya bindu byaayi byooso, haba mu tutugula na haba mu siga muu huminina.<verse eid="LUK 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Hakwa huma, Mupelu yumu haya kidila mu yanga yeeya zila, haŋa heebu mu moona yuugu mundu gubu teebwa, haya kila hangondo na haya weena.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Law 21-3</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Mulawi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Balawi babwa nangi bandu ba ilongo kya Isilaeli babwa nangi muu luula ba Mupelo mu mwambu wa Lubunga. Lola Bala 3.1-13</char></note> yumu na eyu hayafi'a haŋa heebu mumona yuugu mundu, haya mu heenga hangondo na haya weena.<verse eid="LUK 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Ihani Musamaliya yumu, gubwa nangi mu lugendu lwayi, haŋa heebu mu mona yoowa mundu, haya mu fwiila lusa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 10.5</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Haya sheena kwebwanangi, haya tumba malonda gaayi na umuhudila divai hamonga na maŋani na ubiganga. Na haya mu bandisha heegulu wa punda yaayi, haya mu shwaala na u mufisha u yende kya banyini tii, bamu buke. <figure style="fig" alt=" Le bon Samaritain soigne les plaie du blaissé" file="WA03863b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref=" 10.34">Musadiya mulegela wavuba malonda ga guugu gubu teebwa</figure> <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Bwesha bwaayi, yoowa Musamaliya haya loosha dinari yi bidi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dinali yi bidi yilu bengeneena 'u gabila mundu waku vubila masu ga bidi.</char></note> haya mu gabila mwiini wa yendi kya banyini na haya mu sawiila: ‹Umubuke, yuugu mundu bilegela, haŋa handa galushanga naku gabilanga mona yooso ya heegula ya wa looshanga koo mu fuhulula.›»<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Ihani Yeesu haya mu yuujya yuugu mulangidijyi wa Mahuya Golulu* tii: «U mesu goobe, munda mwa baba bandu basatu, inaani gudi mundu watonono wa yuugu mundu gubu hulu'a mu mabo'o ga bilwanyi?» <verse eid="LUK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Yuugu mulangidijyi wa buta* haya mu lunga tii: «Na niijya tii, ni yuugu gubu mu fwiila lusa.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Ihani Yeesu haya mu sawiila: «Inanga, na beeba inanga tanga byeebya bibuta yuugu mundu wa bu satu.»<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wa yegeleela Malata na Maliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Mu ihindi kii'i Yeesu na mitongi yaayi haba weena mulugendo, haya shweela mu moola gumu, na mu goowa moola mubwa nangi wa mwaazi yumu wa ba luteena Malata haya mu tambula Yeesu munda mwa yendi kyaayi. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Haŋa habu shweela Ngana munda mwa yende, ngazi bandu wa Malata, wa balu teena Maliya, yuugu Madiya haya vueya haya yaana haasi nena ga magulu ga Yeesu, na heekilu telegejya byeebya bibwa naagi muluula Yeesu. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Haboobwa Malata na eyu, gubwa nangi muu kilaŋana mu miambu ya butu yoo tee'a biyaazi. Haboobwa haya sheena udi Yeesu na haya mu sawiila: «Ngana, biibi ndabilu kumonesha indu, mona mwina waami wani sama mimi bunga uta mwambu, umu sawiidi wa vueye na eyu wani yangudi.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Malako 4.38</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 6.25-34; Luka 12.11; 22</char></note>Ihani Yeesu haya mu lunga: «Malata, Malata! Beebe wa hoo'a na gudi muu kilaŋana mu miambu ya butu. <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />Ihani Yeesu haya mu lunga Malata. Udi indi kiimu kya sungu. Maliya eyu, wa sobola indu ilegela u nindu, nda udi mundu wa mu kuujyanga ekyu.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Za 27.4</char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yeesu walangidila badingisi baye kuajya Kabejya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mat 6.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7.7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Lusu lumo, Yeesu wene mudimo bua mukuajya. Haŋa heeweye kuajya, yumo dingisi waye byamusaudila ti: «Vidi-nyambi, tukikuajya utulangidile kuajya bebya Yohane we langidila badingisi baye.» <verse eid="LUK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yeesu byabasaudila: «Haŋa hamukiajya, muyakane mukuyakula bibi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">‹Tata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">zina dyobe dyatumbibwe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">butangala bwoobe bwave!<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Utuabilange bidyazi biitu byakila lusu.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Utufilange lusa mububi bwiitu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">kumona bashu tukimonena lusa baa booso bakitutela bubi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">na ndutusama kushwelanga mubindu byakutu shidimusha.›» <verse eid="LUK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Haŋo Yeesu byabasaudila badingisi baye lungi: «Tuyakule bangu ti: yumo hamukidi hiinu udi na mwizinaye, naiye yowa mwizinaye wayena kwaye hamukidi habufuku na kumusaudila: ‹Mwizinami nguyambishe bangu mikati yisatu, <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />Kumona yumo mwizinami yidi mulwendo wakidila kwaami, na sidi nakindu kyakumwabila.› <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Itu yowa yidi mu kyende wamuyaka ti: ‹Ndungu suvya miimi! Na yizila kibelo. Na miimi na baana baami twa tandabala; shaku buuka lungi ti na kuabile mikati.› <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Kwa kwinikindu, ngimusaudila ti: Itu ndaku buuka wa mwabile mikati kwakuboya ti iye mwizinaye, ubuukanga na kumuabila byooso biajyaye kukidila kukomena kyaye.<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Kwabiibi nabasaudila ti muyakane mukuajya na muebwanga; muyakane mukukeba na mumona; muyakane mukukumuna kukibelo na muyujyuludibwe. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Kumona yowa wooso kiajyanga ni kiebwanga, kikebanga ni kimonanga na kikumunanga kukibelo ni kiyujyuludibwa kibelo. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Buune bangu, hamukidi iinu batata babaana, itu mwana woobe wakuajya mukati, umwabila ibwe ao itu wamwajya kibelelo kikimo, umwabila nyoka? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Ao itu wakuajya iyi, buune umwabila kiushi? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Haŋo itu banyu badi na bubi, mukiyuka kuhana bindu bilweela ku baana biinu, kwakwinikindu Shinu yidi haulu ubaabila Tima dya Kabejya baba bakimuajya.»<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu na Belzebuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mat 12.22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Mlk 3.20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Lumo lusu, Yeesu wenange mukujyanga muzuka munda mwamundu yumo, wee bika yowa mundu kifuma. Wowa muzuka hawenyomoka munda mwa yowa kifuma, hakeaŋa yowa kifuma byasamuna kuyakula, na bandu booso benange haŋa haba habakanya. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Lakini bamo bandu benange haŋa haba boya ti: «Wajyanga mizuka kukidila butangala bwa Belzebuli, mukulu wa mizuka.» <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Bangi hamukidi haabo bevula kumuteela muteo, haba muajya wabatele kingulungulu kimo kyakumonesha ti uvanyomokela haulu. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Ila Yeesu, weyuka miejyo yabo, bya basaudila: «Itu bandu ba butangala bwooso bakikwiabulula hamukidi haabwo buonanga. Byakebee, bandu bakilongo kyooso badi mulwaku ibo kwaibo kwinikindu bionanga. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Itu Musimbusimbu wakwilwisha iye mwinikindu, butangala bwaye butebama bini? Nabasaudila bebya kumona banyu mwayakula ti ngijyanga Musimbusimbu kwabutangala bwa Belzebuli? <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Itu miimi na jyanga mizuka kwa butangala bwa Belzebuli, baana binu bakiyijyanga na butangala bwa naani? Kukidila bebya, ibo ni bimonesha ti banyu ndamudi musambo. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Lakini itu yayakana ti miimi ngijyanga mizuka na butangala bwa Kabejya, haŋo muyuke ti butangala bwa Kabejya* bwa tuyuka kwamudi.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />Itu mundu yidi mwejyo na udi na byeela, bindu byaye biyakana nyaa. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Ila mundu yidi mwejyo kumukila iye waava wamukundukila na wamuima, yowa umukuzula byeela byaye bivabadilangeye na kuaba bindu byooso bivamukuzuleye.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />Yowa wooso sidi mwajyo waami, ukingulwisha. Na yowa wooso sikingunyangujya kukongakanya naami, ukimwangidijya.»<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kualuka kwa mizuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mat 12.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />Haŋo Yeesu byasaula: «Itu muzuka wa nyomoka munda mwamundu, ukinyunganyunga mumabua masidi bandu mukukeba bua dyakuyoyela. Itu ndavamona, ni wakwijyobojya: Nialuka kukyende kyami kyambivanyomoka. <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Itu waaluka, ukibanga kekya kyende kyakombebwa na kulungakanyibwa bilweela. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Haŋo, huyena na kukabuula mizuka yingi musambo yibiyibi kukila iye mwinikindu; booso bashwela mukekya kyende kukumo na kuyakana munda mwa yowa mundu, buyakane bwayowa mundu bwaava bubibubi kukila bebya byenangiye busu.»<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kufiyudibwa kwakwinikindu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Haŋa heyakula Yeesu mama mauya, mwamukazi yumo mukekya kiandu kya bandu byabajya muuya na kuboya ti: «Wafiyudibwe mwamukazi wekubutula na kukunyamwisha! <verse eid="LUK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Ihani Yeesu haya mu lunga: Badi na fiyugujyi, mbaaba balu telegejya mahuya ga Kabejya na u gata.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Heb 4.12; Mit 8.32; Yn 14.21</char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bandu baluvula bijyongoto byooba hanunusha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat 12.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Boobwa bigandu bya bandu bya bibu vinina na umu nyungangala Yeesu, Yeesu haya booya: «Bandu ba lelo ndaba legela. Balu vula umona bijyongoto byooba hanunusha. Haboobwa shooba teela indu nangi imu bijyongoto kyooba haa nunusha, ha u hanunu'a ubu hanunusha Yona. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Ukidila byeebya Kabejya byeebu bijyongoto byoo hanunusha bandu ba Ninawi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Yona 3.3-5</char></note> ukidila Yona, ibyeeebya miimi Mwaana wa Mundu bya ya kananga bijyongoto iluhanunusha kya bandu ba lelu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Yn 1.17; 2.10</char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Haŋa Kabejya haya hondololanga buyaani bwa bandu, wa mwaazi gubwa nangi muu tebemena bandu u isi kya ulwaasi, wafuku'anga na u hondolola bandu ba buyaani bwa lelo. Manee yuugu wa mwaazi gubu vueya u isi kya uula koo boya ti, wa telegejyi mahuya ga nyinyi ga ngana Salomoni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola 1Fal 10.1; 2Nya 9.1</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Haŋa Kabejya haya hondololanga buyaani bwa bandu, bandu ba Ninawi na ebu bafuku'anga hamonga na bahondololanga bandu ba leelo, manee ebu hababu telegejye byeebya Yona byeebu ba sawiila; babu yi heta na u fululujya matima gaabu. Na hanu hatudi hadi mundu mwatagadi ukila Yona.»<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Meesu i taala dya mubidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />«Nda udi mundu gulu teema taala na udi fwamisha mwii tala, haboobwa balu dibii'a heegulu na udi haki'a, kooboya tii bandu balu shweela mu yendi bamone mungenge. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Mesu goobe i tala dya mubidi goobe. Ishu mesu goobe gadi muu mona bilegela, mubidi goobe gooso wa yananga mumu ngenge. Haboobwa ishu mesu goobe gadi na lufu, mubidi woobe wooso na eyu gudi mumu ziibwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 6.22; 27 </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Lola bilegela mungenge gudi munda moobe wafululu'a u yaana mu zimbwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Ishu mubidi goobe gooso gudi munda mwa mungenge, na imanu kyoobe nangi imu nda idi munda mwa muzimbwa, mubidi goobe gooso wa yananga na mungenge wa unindu, byeebya taala bya dilu monesha mungenge ukidila mungenge waayi.»<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu wa langa ba Falisayo na ba Langidijyi ba buta*</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mlk 12.38-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luk 20.45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Haŋa Yeeesu heebuhwa usagula, mu Falisayo* yumu gubu mu taŋana Yeesu wenanga kuudya bi yaazi u yendi kyaayi. Ihani Yeesu haya fi'a na haya shweela munda mwa yende haya yaana muudya bi yaazi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 7.36; 14.1</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Yuugu mu Falisayo* bweebu mumona Yeesu muudya bi yaazi eyu na ngu tumba miyu yaayi, haya haanunua.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Malako 7.3</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Ngana Yeesu haya mu sawiila: «Banyu ba Falisayo*, mulu tumba haajya wa lubaya na muhejya. Haboobwa, ulola munda mwa matima yiinu, mudi ba yudi baababa na afyulu na matima gabigabi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 7.13; Mat 23.25-26; Malako 7.20-23</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Banyu baaba ba shidi na nyinyi! Nda muluyu'a tii, gubu longa haajya i gubu longa munda?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 12.20; 1Kolinto 15.36</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Mu ba gabidilangi tusuvi byeebya bidi munda mwa lubaya na munda mwa mihejya, koo boya tii, bindu byooso bya yaani bi to'ato'a* kwa mudi.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />Lusa lwiinu banyu ba Falisayo*, banyu badi mu loosha iba imu kya umi bya bindemba na munyinyi na bindemba bingi byeebya byooso bya mudi muu shuula mu monda giinu. Haboobwa mwa yaana muu lubanga buta na utuvula kwa Kabejya. Na ngangu vidigijya utuula ihindi kya umi kya biibi bingi byooso.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />Mwa yiloga banyu ba Falisayo*! Manee banyu muluvula u yaana mu nge'a ya mabusu munda mwa tulububunga. Lungi muluvula<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 23.6-7; Malako 12.38-39</char></note> umi hanywiina na ineemo mu bigandu bya bandu ba butu. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Lusa lwiinu! Manee banyu mudi bidi bivwa bishikilu mone'a, na bandu badi muubi yatigila ebu nanguyu'a.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 23.27-35</char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Mulangidijyi yumu wa buta* haya mu sawiila: «Mulangidijyi, Kuu'u usagula koobe koodi muu sagula, gudi muutukaya na baashu byanga byeebya.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 22.35</char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yeesu haya mu lunga: «Mwayiloga na banyu Balangidijyi ba buta! Manee mudi muuba hibi'a bandu mizigu yaba shidi muu samuna uyi shwaala, haboobwa na banyu nda mulu shweejya munyu nangi gugumu tii, muba yangudi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 23.4</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Lusa lwiinu, manee banyu muluvubilanga bivwa bya ba ngangabiloto ba shiinu muulu bababu hega.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 23.29</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Na banyu mwa monesha bandu booso hululu ti, mudi hamonga na ba shiinu muulu babu hega ba ngangabiloto manee mwa sehelela na mwa ba vubila bivwa!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 23.29-32; Mdo 7.51-53</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Ukidila biibi bya mubuta, Kabejya muu nyinyi yaayi haya boya: ‹Lola, naba yishilanga ba ngangabiloto* na ndingisi*, haboobwa ebu bakananga muu hega bamu na bangi muu ba suvya.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1Kolito 1.24; Kolosayi 2.3</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Ukidila biibi, Kabejya wa mi titiminyanga banyu bandu ba lelo manee ga muloha wa ba ngangabiloto* babu hegebwa usomba u musombo wa bwiinadu. <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />Koo'a uhegebwa ubusomba udi Abeli na ufi'a udi ngangabiloto Zakalia,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu kitabu kyululu A.T. Bayuda balluya tii, wababu hegu busu ni Abedi na wa mongo ni Zakadiya. Lola Mwanzo.</char></note> wa babu hege mu babumuhegela mu Lubunga* mubwata bwa mazabahu na buga di to'ato'a dyoo tudila bindu udi Kabejya. unindu nami sawiila: Kabejya waba titiminyanga bandu ba leelo manee ga muloha wa bandu booso gubu hegebwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mwa 4.8; 2nya 24.20-21; 24.35-36</char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />Lusa lwiinu banyu ba langidijyi ba buta! Mwa zimbila bandu zila kooboya ti, ndaba yu'anga byeebya biluvula Kabejya. Banyu banindu nda mudi muu vula ushweela, na baaba baluvula ushweela, banyu mwaba zimbila.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 23.13</char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Haŋa Yeesu hebu huma munda mwa yendi, ba Falisayo* na balangidijyi ba buta* haba muwatila iizi kyumini na umu yuujya mahuya ga butu. <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />Manee bamoni zila yoo muwaata ukila mahuya gaayi.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Nda mu yananga bidi ba Falisayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-33">Mat 10.26-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Mu ihindi kyee'a, bandu ba butu habu ganda na haba kidi muuyi yatijyeena. Yeesu haya ba sawiila mitongi yaayi mabusu: «Muyi lodi na ugaga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vunda: Lola Mat 13.33 beebya bidi vunda, 'u huula gaza dya bunga muuda mwa bunga boote'a mukate na 'u fululuzya bunga, 'ibyeebya bikidi ba Falisayo babutu bachweela mu mazyiindi Mat 16.6, 12; Malako 8.15</char></note> udi naba Falisayo, manee ga mahuya gaabu ya ngenu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngenu: ba Falisayo balu fwaama. Lola Mat 10.26; Malako 4.22; Luka 8.17. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Manee indu kyooso ibu fwamishwa kya moneanga hululu, na indu kyooso idi mu ijyejyi kya yuibwanga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Malako 4.12; 8.17</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Ukidila biibi, kyee kyooso kyamwa sagulanga mwii jyejyi kya sagudibwanga mubwata bwa Yuba. Na kyee kyooso kya mwa sagulanga munda mwa kyumba iyizidi, kya sagudibwanga hegulu wa mutondolo na muhuya watagadi.»<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mundu wa bandu utiina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />Yeesu haya sagula lungi: «Nangu yananga muu tina bandu balu hega mubidi, manyuma goo hega ndabaluta indu kingi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Yn 15.14-15</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Habobwa nami moneshanga yoowa wa banyu u tiina: Mumu tiini Kabejya gudi na butanga ukujya buumi bwa mboo hega mundu na umu taasha mu ziba dya mudilu. Unindu namisawiila, yuugu i gulu bengeneena utiinibwa!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Ebal 10.31</char></note><verse eid="LUK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Mi tii, tuluyu'a baashu booso tii, misodi yi tanoo yidi na mugulu wa bihidi bibidi bya fwalanga yega! Haboobwa Kabejya ndilu luba musodi nangi gumu. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Unindu Kabejya gulu yu'a bungi bwa fu'i didi mu, mishu yiinu na uyi badi'a. ubiibi nda muyananga muu tiina manee banyu mudi na ineemo mabusu ga Kabejya ukila misodi ya butu.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 10.30; 12.12</char></note><verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umutabu'a Yeesu na umu keezema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Mat 10.32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12.32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10.19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />Na miimi na mi sawiila: «Unindu, mundu yoowa wooso wani tabuanga mabusu ga bandu tii ni dingisi* waami, na miimi Mwaana wa Mundu namu tabuanga mabusu ga Malaika.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola L</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Habobwa yoowa wani kazemange miimi mabusu ga bandu, na miimi Mwaana wa Mundu na mukezemanga mabusu ga malaika* ba Kabejya.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Malaku 8.38; 2Tim 2.12</char></note><verse eid="LUK 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Mundu yoowa wooso wasagulanga mahuya gabigabi manee gaami, miimi Mwaana wa Mundu, wa fwilwanga lusa. Haboobwa yoowa wasagulanga mahuya gabigabi udi Tima dya Kabejya yoowa ndoo fwilwa lusa nangi lumu.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />Haŋa haba mi filanga tii bami namununi, munda ga sinagogi*, ao mabusu ga ngana ao mabusu ga mitangala, nda muyananga na mooyo, goo keba byamwa nanunanga ao byamwa sagulanga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 10.17-19; Malako 13.11</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Manee Tima dya Kabejya dya milangidilanga bya banyu unamuna na banyu usagula.»<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mundu gudi na bindu haboobwa wahina nyinyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">12.13 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Yeesu wa monesha mitingi yaani bya ebu 'u yaana mabusu ga mona.</char>
    </note>Mundu yumu gubwa nangi mu igandu haya mu sawiila Yeesu: «Mulangidijyi unihajyidi udi muwaami wani gabidi dyaami sala dibu tusigila shiitu.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mweena lusu balangidizyi ba Bayahudi babwa naangi mumu yuuzya Yeesu mahuya bidi gaga. Lola Kumb 21.15-17</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yeesu haya mu lunga: «Mwizi naami, inani gubu ni bii'a miimi uyaana mulanuzi wa mona yiinu, ao mundu goo mi gabwiila bindu biinu?»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mdo 7.27</char></note><verse eid="LUK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />'Ihani Yeesu haya ba sawiila bandu booso: «Muyilodi bilegela! Nda mu yananga na afwiilu na uyana na mona ya butu. Manee buumi bwa mundu nda bulu fwandana na bungi bwa bindu byeedi nabyu nangi gudi na bindu bya butu.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ay 31.24; Zak 62.10</char></note><verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Ihani Yeesu haya ba teela muele guugu: «Unda dya mundu yumu gubwa nangi na monda mabutu, gudi na mona ya butu. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Yuugu gudi na mona haya geejya munda mwa tima dyaayi na uyi yuujya ti: ‹Naati bini? Shidi na buga dyatadyata dyoo bii'ila biyaazi byaami.› <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Ihani haya boya ti: Biibi i byandatanga: Na longanga masegi gaami gooso goo bii'ila biyaazi, na uvuba gangi gatagadi goo kila gaaga bwaata, na bii'i moo munda biyaazi byaami byooso byaami bingi na ubi longa bilegele. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Ihani na sawiilanga tima dyaami: ‹Miimi nayisawiilanga miimi nidi na bindu bya butu bya ni bii'anga misha ya butu, buni nayoyanga nadyanga, nanywanga na usehelela.› <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Muh 11.9; 1Kolito 15.35; Yak 5.5</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Yel 17.11; Luka 11.40; Ay 27.8; Zak 39.6; 49.19</char></note>Ihani Kabejya haya mu sawiila tii, ‹Gudi tindi beebe! Buni bufu'u bwa leelo na kuheganga. Haboobwa biibi bindu byabu yi bii'ila, bya yanaga bya naani?›»<verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Ihani Yeesu haya sagula lungi: «Biibi ibyabilu yaana udi mundu gulu yi bii'ila bindu eyu mu nindu, haboobwa eyu ni asuvi mabusu ga meesu ga Kabejya.»<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ulungila Kabejya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat 6.25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Ihani Yeesu haya sawiila mitongi yaayi: «Iboobwa bwambu misawiila, nda muyananga matima giinu uhalalala manee ga buumi bwiini; mwa dyanga ayi ao uhalalala manee ga mibidi yiinu mwa vualanga ayi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 6.25-33</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Manee buumi bwiinu budi na ineemo kyatagadi ukila biyaazi na mubidi gudi na ineemo kyatagadi ukila ngubu. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Mulodi fanda dya magoowo: Nda galu kuna na nda galu shuula na nda gadi na segi dyoo bii'ila abokosho ka biyaazi byaabu, haboobwa Kabezya gulu ba diisha. Haboobwa banyu nda mulu'a tii, mudi na ineemo ukila tuuni?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Ay 38.41; Zab 147.9</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Inani mubwata bwiinu gudi na butangala boo kulumujya misha yaayi ya buumi? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Ishu nda mulusamuna u huya di shoo bidi diidi, ngyayi kya mudi muu yisubijya na biibi bingi byooso?<verse eid="LUK 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">12.27 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola 1Fal 10.4-7</char>
    </note>Lola byeebya bitombo bya bilu tombele. nda biluta mwaabu wala nda bilufuma ngubu. Haboobya nami sawiila banyu, nangi Solomono munindu na mu bindu byaayi byooso ndibu vuala ngubu yilegela yilu bengeneene na byeebya bitombo. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Mabizi ga monda galu mone'a leelo haboowa na bwesha bayi tayi tashanga u mudilu, haboobwa Kabejya gudi yi tubila bilegela. Haboobwa ndomi tubila banyu bilegela ukila gaaga mabizi, banyu badi na ulungidila ushoo!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 6.30</char></note><verse eid="LUK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Nangu yaana muu suba munda mwa matima giinu muu keba, mwa dyanga ayi au mwa nywanga ayi. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Kumona ma mooso makikebebwanga kusidi kulebela na bandu bamusenge na basikiyuka Kabejya. Ila banyu Tata wiinu ukiyuka ti mudi nasungu ya bindu byooso. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Kwa biibi, banyu muyakane mukukeba bangu butangala bwa Kabejya, naiye umuabila maa mooso mamukiajya.» <verse eid="LUK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />Ndamutiinanga, banyu kiandu ki shenene! Kumona yivane bilweela kumeeso ma Shinu kubaabila butangala bwaye.<verse eid="LUK 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mona yaaulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mat 6.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Yeesu bya boya lungi: «Muudishe bindu biinu mukaabile tushuvi yeya mona. Mukakwibikile mbote ya mona yashakuvundaana, na kukwibikila mona haulu yashakuzizimina. Kokwa bakuyiba ndabakutuluka tonono, wala mushwa ndawaku vundanya. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Kumona haŋa iyakana mona yobe ni iyakana tima dyobe.»<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bavubi bakiyakana na mbambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />Yeesu bya jyongola lungi: «Muyakanange tonaa bukwiange mushapadi mulutino, na katoditodi kiinu kayakanange mukuteema; <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />muyakanange bidi bavubi bakidindikijya mwini kyende waaluke kualusi, kwakuboya ti haŋa ialukeye na hikumuneye kukibelo hakeaŋa bamuyuzuludile. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Buuya baba bavubi bibanga mwini kyende wabo ialukeye ubabanga badi na mbambi! Ngibasaudila byakwinikindu, yowa mwini kyende hukwianga mushapadi mulutino lwaye, na kubayakanisha kumeza na kubaabila bidyaazi. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Buuya baba bavubi itu mwini kyende waaluka wababanga badi na mbambi, nee waaluka hamukidi habufuku ao tonono na bufuku kukya!<verse eid="LUK 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Lakini muyuke bibi: Itu mwiini kyende wandiyuka kindi kiva yowa wakuyiba, ndandi sama kyende kyaye kubelebwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Haŋo banyu naabo byakebee, muyakane tonaa, kumona ti miimi Mwana wa Mundu niva mukindi kyamusikiejya.»<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muvubi wabuludi na muvubi sidi wabuludi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mat 24.45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Haŋo Petelo bya yuujya Yeesu ti: «Vidi-nyambi wuuwu muele ukitusaudila baashu bobo, ao ngukidila bandu booso?» <verse eid="LUK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Naiye Vidi-nyambi bya yaka: «Ŋjyuni muvubi yidi buludi na yidi na nyinyi? Ni yowa mwiini kyende waaye ukimubiikanga wakudindikijya kyende kyaye na kumubika haulu ya bavubi baaye booso ti wabilange bavubi bezinaye bidyaazi mukindi kikibambana. <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Buuya yowa muvubi ialuka mwini kyende umubanga ukita bebya. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Ngimusaudila byakwinikindu, yowa mwini kyende umubika yuu muvubi mukulu wa mona yaye yooso.<verse eid="LUK 12:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Lakini itu yowa muvubi wasomba kukwijyoboojya mutima dyaye ti: ‹Mwiini kyende waloa kwakualuka,› na kusomba kutuuta bavubi bezinaye, babaabalume na babaabakazi, na kudya na kunywa na kulewa, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />haŋo mwini kyende ualukanga mukindi kisikiejyeye na kindi kisikiyukeye; umututa kwabule yowa muvubi na kumubika mubuvu didimo na baba basikitabuka.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />Yowa muvubi kiyuka bebya bikivula mwiini kyende kyaye, lakini ndakikwibika tonaa wala kuta bebya bikivula mwinikyende kyaye, utebwa kwabitutu byabule. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Lakini yowa muvubi sikiyuka bebya biki vula mwiini kyende kyaye na wata bibibibi, utebwa bishenene. Kwa kila yowa we ebwa byabule, uajyiba byabule; na yowa wooso we ebwa byabule kukila, kwaye uajyibwa byabule kukila.»<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ukivisha kukwisamijyena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mat 10.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />Yeesu bya jyongola lungi: «Mbeeva kuvamunika mudilo mumusenge; na ngivula wowa modilo wasombe kuteema! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Ngibambana kuyabikibwa, na mbandivula kokwa kuyabikibwa kwa teebwe! <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Mukiejya ti naava kuvisha nyaa muune mumusenge? Hebo! Ngukwisamijyena. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Kusomba leelo, kilongo kikimo kya bandu batano bikwisamijyena; basatu bikwikala mububi kubandu babidi, na babidi bikwikala mububi kukidila bandu basatu. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Tata ukwikala kwabubi kukidila mwaana waye na mwana ukwikala kwabubi kukidila shaye; najye na mundu ukwikala mububi kukidila musika waye, na musika ukwikala mububi kukidila najyaye, na najyemweno na mundu ukwikala mububi kukidila mukazi wamwaana waye na yuu mukazi wa mwaana ukwikala mububi kukidila najyaye mweno.»<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuyuka bindi mbalambala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mat 16.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Haŋo Yeesu byasaudila kekya kiandu kya bandu: «Haŋa hamukimonanga matimba makibanda kokwa ku kalaa yuba, hakeaŋa mukiboya: Vula yinywa, yikinywanga bobo. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Haŋa hamukimona muee ndaukiumba kukalaa yuba, banyu mwayakula ti: ‹Kuyakana kivuuvu› yayakana byakebee. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Habanyu balweleme lwa ndimi yibidi! Mukiyuka kusosobola bindi mbalambala bya bwaama bwa musenge na ulu; kwakaayi kaa, ndamukisamuna kuyuka ngingu ya kindi kiiki kya leelo?»<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukwiteejyejyene na mulwishi woobe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mat 5.25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />Yeesu bya yakula lungi: «Kwakaayi ndamukikwilamuna banyu benikindu kindu kilweela kyakuta? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Itu kilondola beebe naye wayena noobe kubakulu bakumilamuna, yandi yakana bileela kwaudi kukwitejyejyena naye haŋa hamukidi muzila, kwakuboya ti ngasi wakushwala busu bwamukulu wakulamuna, na yowa mukulu wakulamuna ukuana mubiboko bya misipadi na misipadi bikukasa muzitikilu. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Kwinikindu ngikusaudila ti ndwakunyomoka kookwa, mupaka hauwa kuloosha lufalanga lwa mongo.»<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Faida ya kusama bubi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Mu ihindi kyee'a bandu bamo beeva, habasaudila Yeesu kukidila bandu ba Galilaya baaba be yaishibwa na Pilato haŋa habene mukujyijya nyama yaabo ya kutuula kudi Kabejya. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Ni Yeesu haya ba yujya ti: «Muluninga tii, baaba ba Galatiya babumota babwanangi na bubi ukila ba Galilaya baaba booso?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola 9.2-3</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Ndabeebyo! Ila nabasaudila ti ishu na banyu nda mubufunduluka mububi bwiinu, na banyu mumota bobo byakebee naibo byabeemota.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zab 7.12</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Na mu moola wa Silolwamo, kyendi kyatagadi ibu hulwiila bandu kumi na muanda ha bamota. Haŋo, muluninga tii ni ebu yega, babwa nangi na bubi ukila baaba booso balu yaana u Yelusalema? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Nda beebo! Ila Unindu namisawiila na banyu ishu nda mubu fululujya matima miinu, banyu booso mwa titiminywanga bobo bidi ebu.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 3.2; Mdo 2.38</char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muele wa muti usikihaa bimuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Ni Yeesu haya ba teela muele hungi ti: «Mundu yumu gubu kuna muti wa Tini mukunda dyaye dya mizabibu*. Lumo lusu, haya weena wakaola bimuka kwaudi, Ila ndee banga kindu kwaudi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Isa 5.2; Mat 21.19</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Haŋa haya mu sawiila muvubi waye wa dedya kunda ti: ‹Lola! Nda yite sasa misha yi satu i yoota guugu mutini, haboobwa shiluheta indu kwaudi. Ugu tembe! Manee gudi mu vundaŋanya maavu busadi.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 3.10</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Ila, yowa muvubi wa unda haya mu sawiila ti: ‹Vidi, usama bangu lungi musha gugumu, na miimi nagu yihi dilanga na ugu teela maavu galegela.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola 3.9, 15</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Hangi watanga mimu'a musha wa vueyanga. Itu nda gubuta bimuka wagu tembanga.› »<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu wa fuula wa mwaazi yumu lusu lwa Sabato*</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Lusu lumu lwa Sabato*, Yeesu gubwa nangi muu luula bandu mu Sinagogi*. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Mu dyeedya Sinagogi* mwenange mwamukazi wenange na lufu. Yowa mwamukazi wene waata misha umi na mugandaa mukusuba na musimbusimbu. Woowa musimbusimbu wene wa muvunga muongo, na ndibu samuna lungi ugolo'a.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 13.16</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Haŋa Yeesu hebu mumona, haya mu taŋana na haya mu sawiila ti: «Yeeya! Wafuudibwa lufu lwoobe.» <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Yeesu haya mu hibiila mabo'o gaayi hanga haŋa howa yeeye haya talu'a teba hee kilu mu tumbijya Kabejya.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 5.23</char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Ila mukulu wa yeya sinagogi* haya zingukila Yeesu, manee Yeesu wa fuula mundu lusu lwa Sabato*. Haŋo haya sawiila kyee'a igandu 'ibwa nangi momwa: «Kukiyakananga masu mutubaa woota miambu. Kwabiibi, mumaama masu ni mamukibambana kuviyanga kufudibwa lufu lwiinu, ila ndati lusu lwa Sabato.»*<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 12.2; Luka 14.3; Kut 20.9; Malako 5.22</char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Ila, Vidi-nyambi haya mu lunga ti: «Habanyu bandimi yibidi! Ko lusu lwa Sabato* kila yowa hamukidi hiinu hukilekelanga punda ao ŋombe yaaye kunyomoka mu mukumba, na kuyenakuyinywisha meema.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 14.5</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Yuugu mwamukazi ngwa kilongo kya Abalahamu ila musimbusimbu we zitika mumisha kumi na mugandaa. Buune ndebambana wazitudibwe lusu lwa Sabato*?»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 3.8; 19.9; Mat 4.10</char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Yeesu heweye kuboya biibi, balwishi baayi booso habamona buuvu. Ila bangi bandu booso, ibo bene mukuseelela mahuya mooso makuhanunusha meneeye mukuta.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Is 66.5</char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muele wa tumuka tusheenene dwa haladali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-33">Mat 13.31-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mlk 4.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Haŋo Yeesu bya yakula lungi ti: «Butangala bwa Kabejya* bukifandakana na kaayi? Na tukibambana kubuyuudishwa na kaayi? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Boobwa Butangala bukifandakana bidi kamuka kasheenene kahaladali, kekuna kukunda dyaye. Kaka kamuka haka mena hakava muti. Tuni hatwaluka maishwa maato mumatabi maaye.»<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Yeesu byayakula lungi ti: «Butangala bwa Kabejya*, ngibambana kuyudisha na kaayi? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Buubu Butangala* bukifandakanishwa na kuhaa* kwe buula yumo mwamukazi, byausobakanya na fufu dya bule, mupaka kokwa kuhaa* hakwa yudisha dedya fufu dyooso.»<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kibelo kimomakane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mat 7.13-14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21">21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23">23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Yeesu weyidididye na luendo lwaaye kuyena ku Yelusalemu. We yenanga kulangidila bandu mumikola yikata na mutukola. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Mundu yumo byamuyuujya ti: «Ha Vidi-nyambi, bandu bifukanga matima mbashoo bobo?» Yeesu bya muyaka ti: <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />«Mudinge kushwela kukibelo kimomakane. Kumona ngibasaudila byakwinikindu, bandu babule bieleka kushwela mwakidi, ila ndabakusamuna.<verse eid="LUK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Haŋa hiyakaneeye mwini kyende wataluka na kuyizila kibelo, banyu muyakana mukutaluka haaza. Na musomba kukumuna kukibelo na kuboya ti: ‹Ha Vidi-nyambi, utuyuzuludile kibelo!› Na iye ubayakanga ti: ‹Banyu sikibayuka kwamuvanga!› <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Haŋo musomba kuyakula ti: ‹Bashu ni baaba beedya na beekubila kukumo noobe. Lungi welangidila bandu mumazila mamikola yiitu makatamakata.› <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Ila iye ubayakanga ti: ‹Banyu, sikibayuka muva viila kuni, mutuluke munonga naami, banyu booso bakita bubi!›<verse eid="LUK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Haŋo mumonanga Abulaamu, na Isaaka na Yakobo na babushi* booso mubutangala bwa Kabejya*. Ila banyu bimukasa haaza. Kokwa mudila na muta ngekenyi. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Bandu binyomoka kunyomokelo dya yuba na kokwa kumulaa yuba, na kunyomoka ku kumbala na kumuongo. Baaba bandu biyakana mukudya mu Butangala bwa Kabejya*. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Mulengeke bangu! Bandu bamo badi bamongo, biyakana ba busu. Na badi babusu, biyakana ba mongo.»<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wahojwela bandu ba Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mat 23.37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Mukyakekyee kindi, bamo Mafalisayo* habatuluka tonono na Yeesu na kumujyongodela ti: «Hezela haŋa, ukwiyiile mudingi bua! Kumona Helode ukikeba wakuyae.» <verse eid="LUK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yeesu byabayaka: «Mwene mukasaudile yowa mulende ti leelo na mweesa nijyanga misimbusimbu na kufuula badi na lufu. Na mweesa waaye ni yakana naawa mudimo waami.»  <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Ila yikinguajya kuyidididye na luendo lwaami leelo, na mweesa na mweesa waaye. Kumona ndayikisamunika mubushi* wa yaibwe mumukola hungi ila mu Yelusalemu bobo.<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />«Ee bandu ba Yelusalemu! Banyu mukiyanga babushi*. Na bandu ba Kabejya baki bayishila, mukibayaa mukubakasila mabu. Mbendo ya bule ngivulanga kubafukikila bidi zoolo yikifukikila baana baye kuusi kwabibabwa byaye! Ila banyu ndamwevula! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Buune muteejye bangu! Kyende kiinu kishaala mamba. Ngibasaudila byakwinikindu ti ndamwakungumona lungi, kufika mukindi kya muboya ti: ‹Wafiyudibwe yowa vanga muzina dya Vidi-nyambi!›»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Zabuli 118.26.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Yeesu wafuula mundu lusu lwa Sabatu*</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">14.1 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 7.36; 11.37; Mat 12.10</char>
    </note>Lusu lumu lwa Sabato*, Yeesu hayaweena udi ngana yumu wa Bafalisayo* kuudya biyaazi. Bandu bene mukekya kyende bemulola sokosoko mukuboya ti bamone biteeye. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Mabusu ga Yeesu ubwanangi mundu yumo na lufu loo yula mubidi. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yeesu haya yuujya balangidijyi ba Buta* na Bafalisayo* ti: «Buta* bwiitu yikihananga zila ao yikibenganga kufula mundu lusu lwa Sabato?»* <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Ila, habakwihumina nyaa Yeesu haya lengela yowa mubeele, byamufuula na bya musaudila wa yeene byaaye. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Ni, Yeesu haya bayuujya lungi: «Ni naani hamukidi hiinu itu mwaana waye ao ŋombe yaye yaonena mukineene kidi meema lusu lwa Sabato* wakushwe kujyukila kukayinyomosha nee yayakana lusu lwa Sabato*?»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 13.15</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Ila ndababu mona huuya dyoo sagula.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kukwibajya ao uyi sajya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Yeesu haya mona bebya bandu babu taŋanibwa badi muku kwisobolela bua dya busu. Ni byabaabila diidi langu: <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />«Ishu mundu wa kuloba ku halusi, nangu yakananga ku ngeka ya mabusu. kumona hangi kukibambana kuva yungi va lobebwa yidi na kineemo kukukila.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mez 25.6</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Na yowa yidi na kineemo kukukila wa sosoka, yowa vamiloba banyu booso babidi ukibambana kukujyongodela ti: ‹Samina yuhu mundu bua.› Haŋo uteejya buuvu ya kuyena kukuyana mungeka ya nyuma. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mez 25.6</char></note>Haboobwa ishu bakuloba, yenaa ukayakane mungeka ya nyuma. Haŋo, yowa vakuloba uviyanga na kukujyongodela ti: ‹Mwizinami, viyaa kuku kumbala.› Haŋo, uvuka kineemo busu bwa bandu booso baukidya nabo. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Manee, yoowa wooso wayi bajyanga, usajyangwa. Ila yowa wooso kikwishajyanga, iye ubajyibwanga.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mez 23.12; Luka 18.14</char></note><verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Ihani Yeesu haya sawiila yoowa gubu muloba: «Haŋa haukihaana bidyazi bya kiandu kyakuseelela bya munyinya, ao kyoolwa, nduyakana mukuloba bamonyi nobe bobo, aubabushi bakilingo kyoobebobo, bashobe, ao tubobo twizinobe bobo. Kumona itu waata bebya, ibo byakebee bikuloba kudya kwaabo mukualusha maama ma weebateela. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Ila, haukita kiandu kyakuseelela, yakana mukuloba tusuvi, na badi na binema, na bibula na bakufu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Neh 8.10; Kumb 14.19</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />Haŋo, tuvuka fiyujyi kumona baaba bandu ndabadi na kindu kyakukualushila. Ila Kabejya ukualushilanga haŋa bakita malweela habi fukukanga.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mdo 24.16; Yn 5.29</char></note><verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muele wa kiandu kikata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mat 22.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Mundu yumo wedyanga bidyazi na kukumo na Yeesu hewetejyeye maamo, bya mujyongodela ti: «Buuya mundu yowa yidyanga bidyazi mu Butangala bwa Kabejya!*»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Isa 25.6; Uf 19.9; Mat 3.2</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yeesu haya muyaka kukidila wuu muele ti: «Mundu yumu gu buta igandu kyatagadi, haya loba na bandu ba butu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 22.2</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Kindi kya kudya bidyazi hakyebambana, haya yiisha muvubi waaye wakasaudile baaba belobebwa ti, ‹Muvaaye sasa, kumona bindu byooso ndakite tonaa.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mez 9.2, 3</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Ila, kila yumo hamukidi habaaba be lobebwa bya somba kusaula ngikai kivamuzikila ti ndafikanga. Wa busu byamujyongodela ti: ‹Naula kunda, buune yikinguajya kuyena nakadiyengeele. Ngikwiaya noobe, monene lusa!› <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Yungi bya jyongola: ‹Naula ŋombe kumi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kubayaudi, mukuvubisha, bevubishanga ŋombe yibidiyibidi kwakukakata lukasu lwa kuvuba.</char></note> ya kuvuba kumba. Biino nayena kukaileka bangu na mone itu yisamunanga kuvuba. Ngikwiaya noobe, monene lusa.› <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Yungi byakebee byajyongola ti: ‹Na tundula akeano. kwa biibi shakusamuna kuva.›<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Yowa muvubi byahaluka kudi vidi-nyambi waaye. Bya mujyongodela mama makumo mooso. Yowa vidi waaye hevateejyeye beebyo, bya zinguka jyobijyobi. Ni bya mujyongodela yowa muvubi waaye ti: ‹Yena yayaya mumazila makatamakata na masheenene ma mukola, na mukavishe haŋa tushuvi, na babinema, na mikufu na bibula.› <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Ni, yowa muvubi byahaluka na jyongola ti: ‹vidi-nyambi, mama mauva nguzaudila naate naata. Ila nembimbi kukidi bua.› <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Yowa vidi-nyambi waaye byajyongodela yowa muvubi waye ti: ‹Yena lungi muzila yamikola yi shenene na mumazila ma makunda. Bandu booso baumonanga, uba humbe kwakuboya ti bashweele kwaami, mukuboya ti kyende kyami kyayule bandu. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Kwinikindu na mujyongodela ti ndakudi nee yumo hamukidi ha baaba bambivalobebwa yidya bidyazi byami.›»<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusama byooso kukidila kujyanga Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mat 10.37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Lumo lusu, bandu babule bejyanga Yeesu. Byabakibukila na kubasaudila ti: <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />«Kivula kungujyanga, wanguvule kukila shaye na naajye, na mukazi waaye, na baana baaye, na bakwaaye na misadi yaye. Lungi wanguvule kukila mwejyo waaye iye mwinikindu. Itu ndabeebya ndakusamuna kuyakana dingisi* waami. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Mundu sivasamuna kushwala musalaba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kushwala musalaba: Ngutabuka kusuba ao kumota kukidila Kilisito*</char></note> waye, na kunguvula, ndakusamuna kuyakana dingisi* waami.<verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Itu yumo hamukidi hiinu, ukivula kuluka mushumba wa kyende, hikimuajya wayakane bangu, wamone itu husamuna kuvuka mona yaiye kuvubisha kwa kuwa wowa mudimo na kuwididijya. <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Ila, itu wasamuna kuluka mabu mahaasi, kisha wakushwa kuluka kekya kyende, bandu booso biyakana mukukimona, biyakana mukumusea <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />Mukuboya ti: ‹Yuu mundu uvasombesha kuluka kyende, ila wakushwa kuwididijya mudimo.› <verse eid="LUK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Itu kolo yumo ukivula kulwa na kolo yungi, yikimuajya wa yakane bangu, wamone ti kukidila mwejyo wabalonga-buvadi baaye elufu kumi badiye nabo, ukibambana kuhima yowa mwizinaye yidi na balonga-buvadi elufu makumi mabidi. <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Wamona ti ndakusamuna, ukibambana kuyishila yowa mwizinaye mukizi haŋa hekidiye kulakula mukuboya ti wamuyuujye jyike namuna yaibo kuta mukuboya ti nyaa dya yakane hamukidi haabo. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Na banyu mbyakebee! Ndakudi mundu hamukidi hiinu yisamuna kuyakana dingisi* waami itu ndee sama byooso bidiye nabyo.»<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mungwa usidi lungi na mudimo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat 5.13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mlk 9.50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />Yeesu bya yakula lungi ti: «Mungwa ukiyakananga kindu kilweela. Ila wazizimisha kisa kyawo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mungwa wabayaudi ndayeene bidi mungwa wa leelo. kumona yene bidi ibwe dye bikibwa mubidyazi itu ya kola mubidyazi baunyomosha na kuubika lungi beebyo ni beebyo. Hayewanga kisa kyawo wekasibwanga.</char></note>, ngikaayi kyabaki bambana kuta munda mukuboya ti waalushe lungi kisa? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Wuuwu mungwa, ndaukidi na mudimo nee humo, yayakane kumateke ao kumboleo. Bakiukasanga haaza. Yidi na makushu makuteejya, wateejye.»<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Muele wa muko'o gubuzizimi na kumoneka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mat 18.12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Lusu lumu, baaba baluhaajya mitulu na baluta bubi bangi, bemufinga Yeesu mukuboya ti bamulengeke.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luk 15.25-32; Mat 18.12-14 Kabezya ndiluvula muundu nangi yumu uzizimina</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Bafalisayo* na balangidizyi ba Buta* habeemona bebya, habasomba kumuyakula Yeesu bibibibi ti: «Yuugu mundu uki tambula bandu babibabi na mukuyakana mukudya nabo bidyaazi!»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 9.11</char></note><verse eid="LUK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Haŋo Yeesu haya ba teela muele guugu: <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 13.3</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />«Mundu yumo hamukidi hiinu wayakana na mikooko yaye mia yiyimo, umo hamukidi haayo itu wazizimina, ukibambana kuta kaayi? Miti husama yeya makumi kitema na kitema mubua dyakuyidishila na kuyena kukakeba wowa huumo uva zizimina, mupaka wauyimona! <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Ishu waumona, wayi shwaala mu mahehe gaayi na eyu muu sehelela kwa butu. <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />Hi sosokeeye kwaaye, utaana bamonyi baaye, na bandu ba tonono naye na kubasaudila ti: ‹Museelele kukumo naami! Kumona namona yeya mikoko yaami yivazizimina.› <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Unindu nami sawiila ti ni byakebee bikiyakananga Kabejya mukuseelela kwabule itu yidi na bubi yumo wasama bubi bwaaye. Kokwa kuseela kwaye kukiyakananga kukata kukila bandu makumi kitema na kitema basikikeba lungi kufuka kwa tima.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 15.10</char></note><verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muele wa kishedi kya kyalanga kiva zizimina na kumoneka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />Yeesu wetetebejya kuyakula lungi ti: «Muteejye lungi: mbini, itu wa mwaazi yumu gudi na bishedi byaayi bya fwalanga umi, itu kishedi kikimu kya mu zizimina, wa tanga bini? Miti ukibambana kumunika taala, na ukomba kyendi bilegela na kukikeba mupaka wa kimone! <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Ishu wamona kyee'a kishedi, wa taŋanga bamonyi baayi na badi hangondu waayi na uba sawiila ti: ‹Mu sehelele ha monga naami! Manee namona kishedi kyaami kya fwalanga ibu zizimina.› <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Ngibasaudila ti, ibyeebya biki sehelelanga malaika* ba Kabejya manee ga mundu yuumo wabubi ukisamanga bubi bwaaye.»<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muele wa henda we zizimina na kumoneka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yeesu haya boya lungi ti: «Mundu yumo wenange na baana baaye babidi babaabalume. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Lusu lumo, yowa wa mwina mubaa baana babidi haya jyongodela shaye ti: ‹Shaami, ngi kuajya ngwabile mbyana yaami mumona yoobe.› Aŋo shaabo haya aba bindu byaye kudi wamukulu na wa mwina.<verse eid="LUK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Mafuku ma shoo kukila, yowa wamwina haya hudisha mbyana yaye yooso, haya yena na falanga yaye kukisi kya kulakula. Kokwa haya yakana mukuvundanya yeya falanga. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Aŋa heeweye kuvundanya yeya falanga, hakwa nyomokela kamesha mukekya kisi. Naiye hasikikushwa nembidyazi byakudya. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Aŋo haya yena kukavubila mundu yumo wakyekisi. Yowa mundu haya mushwala kumakunda maaye ti wakamudindikijyile bizazako byaye. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Yowa henda hasikivuleeye kudya nee bidyazi bikidya bizazakoo, bobwa ndakwenee mundu we mwabila beebya bidyazi.<verse eid="LUK 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Aŋo, hayasomba kuhejya mutima dyaye ti: Hee! ‹Bavubi ba shaami booso bakidya bidyazi na kubisoba, ila miimi haŋa mukumota nazala! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Si haluka kudi shaami na nikamujyongodele ti: Shaami naata bubi busu bwa Kabejya na busu bwoobe. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Sikibambana ku taanibwa lungi mwana woobe. Ngwate sasa bidi yumo muvubi woobe!›<verse eid="LUK 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Haŋo, yowa henda somba luendo bya haluka kudi shaye. Kumona wenange ukidi munonga na kyende kyaabo, shaye bya mumona, na bya mufiila lusa. Bya yena kabilo kukamusambitila na kumuyambitila.<figure style="fig" alt="Le fils prodigue" file="WA03876b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="15.20">Henda wezizimina wasambitidibwa na shaye</figure> <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Mwaana waaye haya mujyongodela ti: ‹Shaami, nata bubi kudi Kabejya, na kudi beebe. Kwa biibi sikibambana lungi kutaanibwa mwana woobe.› <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Ila, shaye bya saudila bavubi baaye: ‹Muvishe yayaya ngubu yileela mumutubile! Mumutubile jyumu ya munyu na makubaati ku maulu!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Shaye wamualushila shanya ya kilao kyaye kyakuyakana mwaana waye wa mwamulume, ngubu yileela: Ni shanya ya butangala na mikalabanda ni shanya ya mundu sidi haasi habutangala bungi; mukekya kindi muvubi weyenanga byai haasi ao byai hululu!</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Muvishe byakebee mutubwatubwa wa ŋombe munune mu shiijye; tuseelele bashu mukudya! <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Kumona ti mwaana waami yuhu we mota ila wafukuka. Uvanange wazizimina, ila wa moneka lungi.› Habasomba kusehelela.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />Mukekya kindi mbadi wa tata wene kuma kunda. Aŋa hehalukeeye ndatee tonono na kyende, bya teejya kijyeejye kya simo na singi. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Haya taana yumo muvubi wa shaye, haya muyuujya ti: ‹Kukyende kudi kaayi?› <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Yowa muvubi haya muyaka ti: ‹Mwinawoobe ni waaluka, na shoobe wamushijyila mutubwatubwa wa ŋombe yinune, kwa kumona ti mwaana waaye waaluka mwejyo.› <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Yowa mukulu bandu hakeaŋa bya zinguka, na kubenga nengushwela kukyende. Shaye bya nyomoka haaza na kukwihaya naye washweele kukyende. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Ila mukulu bandu haya yaka shaye ti: ‹Teejya bangu! misha yabule yiiyi yangi kuvubila, nee lumo lusu sikikolemanga mubyooso bikinguboya beebe. Ila nembiino ndwengwabila nee mubamba wa mbuzi ti miimi na sehelele na kudya nabeezi nami! <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Ila bobwa bwava mwana wobe, yuhu va vundanya bindu byobe byoso mubabakazi bamasenga wasosoka, wamushijyila mutubwatubwa wa ŋombi yinune!›<verse eid="LUK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Aŋo shaye bya mujyongodela ti: ‹Hamwaana waami! Beebe udinaami kukumo mafuku mooso, na byooso byambidinabyo mbyobe bobo. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Miti yivatuajya bashu kukumaana na kusehelela! Kumona yuhu mwinawobe uvanange wamota, ila wafukuka. Wene buzizimine, ila wamoneka›»!<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Muele wa mulolezi wa nyinyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yeesu hayateela mitongi* yaye wuu muele ti: «Ubwanangi kabobo yumu gubwanangi na mulolezi wakutebamina mona yaayi. Bandu habakwaa musosela yowa wakutebamina mona udi wiini wamona ti, gudi muusonya mona yoobe bibibibi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola kuu u Plestine baaba babwanangi na mona babwanangi mubagabila baaba babwanangi muu tebemena mona yaabu, butangala booyitebemena na uyifululuzya.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Yowa kabobo bya mutaŋana na umu sawiila ti: ‹Bandu baki saula bini mwajyo woobe? Buune unibadikile mona yaami, manee ndwakuyitalukila lungi.›<verse eid="LUK 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Yowa mudindikijyi bya hejya ti: ‹Kabobo waami ndakivula kungujyanga kumudimo, haŋa nate bini? Kudima sikisamuna, na nimona buuvu kuajya. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Na yu'a byanda tanga; kumona haŋa habi ngujyejyanga muwuu mudimo, bandu bani tambulanga u byendi byaabu.› <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Na haya taŋana yumu kwa yumu baaba booso babwa nangi na iyu udi vidi waayi. Haya muyujya mundu wa busu ti: ‹Iyu dyoobe ndinga udi vidi waami?› <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Yuugu haya mu lunga ti: ‹Mbidi na kiyo kya ngungulu mia ya maŋani.› Yowa gulu tebemena bindu haya mujyongodela ti: ‹Yakana haŋa, kabilo bugula ishoshwa na gusinye ngungulu makumi matano.› <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Ihani haya yuujya yoowa yungi ti: ‹Na beebe gudi na iyu kya yinga?› Yuugu haya mu lunga ti: ‹Ngidi na kiyo kya misanda mia yi yimo ya fufu dya ngano.› Yuugu gulu tebemena bindu haya mu sawiila ti: ‹Bugula ishoshwa, sinya makumi muanda.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu kiyanuni, ufululuzya mu Kiebalania mbidi byeebya gisengi 89 au milangi ya manani 390.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Loa Za 17.14; 18.26; Ef 5.8; 1The 5.5</char></note>Haŋo, yowa kabobo bya mushisha yowa mulolezi sidi buludi, kukidila bubango bwaaye. Manee bandu ba mumusenge bakitanga mauya mabo hamukidi haabo na bubangu kukila bandu ba munyinya.»<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Yeesu haya basawiila: «Na miimi naba saudila ti muyakane mukukwiteela bamonyi na mona ya kubembela ya muune mumusenge! Kumona timukuboya ti ayiwa kwiinu, Kabejya wamitabuke mukyende kya misha yooso.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 11.13; Mat 19.21; Luka 12.33</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Mundu kibadiibwa mu bindu bishoonono, udi wakubadiibwa byakebee mubindu bikataadi. Na yowa kielongoka mubindu bishonono, udi muelongoke byakebee mubindu bikataadi. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Itu kaa, banyu ndamudi batabukibwe mukudindikijya mona ya kubembela ya mumusenge huu, ni naani yimibadila mukudindikijya mona ya kwinikindu? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Na itu banyu ndamubu samuna bangu kuyakana batabuke mu mona ya bangi, inaani kibambana kubaabila bindu bidi biinu?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />«Nda udi mundu wa samunanga kuvubila ngana bavidi badibidi. Manee biibi, wa vulanga yumu na ukeezema yoo yungi. Au wanamatanga udi yumu na kumona yoo yungi busadi. Nda mwakusamuna kumu vubila Kabejya na kuvubila mona kyakekye kindi.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 6.24 Mu Kigiliki mona ni «Mamona»</char></note><verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu wa yaka Bafalisayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mat 11.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5.31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mlk 10.11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Haŋa Bafalisayo* hababu telegejya biibi byooso, haba musea Yeesu, kumona bene mukuvula falanga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola 1Tim 3.3; Luka 23.35</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Haŋo, Yeesu haya basawiila ti: «Banyu muluvulanga uyimonesha mabusu ga bandu ti mudibaleela. Ila Kabejya guluyukanga madi matima yiinu. Manee byee bindu bilumonanga bandu kalunga na sungu dya butu, Kabejya ukiyakananga mukubimona mbibibibi. <verse eid="LUK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />Buta* bwa Musa na businye bwa babushi*, ni byelondanga bandu kufikila lusu lwa Yohane luyabika. Kusombela haŋa, Musau Uleela wa Butangala bwa Kabejya* ni ukisaudibwa bobo. Na kila mundu ukita haaye hooso mukuboya ti washweele mu bobwa Butangala*.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 5.17; 11.12-13; 4.24</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Ila nembiibi, ulu na matekee bikila kusidi kusuba. Ila, Buta* bwa Kabejya ndabwakushejyebwa nee ni helufi didimo.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />Mundu wooso kijyanga mukazi waye na kutundula mwamukazi yungi, wayuke ti waata masenga. Na yowa wooso kitundula mwamukazi wee jyangibwa na mulume waaye, naiye waata masenga.»<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muele wa kabobo na Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />Yeesu byata lungi huu muele: «Kwenange kabobo yumo. Yowa kabobo wene muku tubila ngubu yilweela na ya muulu ubande. Wene mukuta biandu byakuseelele lusu kwa lusu. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Kwene byakebee kauku kamo ketaanibwa Lazalo. Yowa Lazalo wene na tusungu lukoba lwooso wene mukuyakana kukibelo kya kyende kya yowa kabobo. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Wevula kudya makombwa mee honanga kunyomokela ku meza ya yowa kabobo; na mbooze byakebee yeviyanga na kulemba tusungu twaye.<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Lumo lusu, Lazalo byamota, ba malaika* haba kumushwaala tonono na Abulaamu. Nyuma ya haŋo, kabobo naaye bya mota, habamuzika. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Yowa kabobo bya suba kwabule kokwa kunengo. Byatundula meeso maye, bya mona Abulaamu mumunonga, na bya mona Lazalo tonono naye. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Haŋo, bya bajya muuya ti: ‹Hee tata shami Abulaamu, ungu fiile lusa! jyongodela Lazalo wa tabike songo ya munyu waye mu meema, wangujyajyile mbombo dimo dyameema kwaku boya ti na talajye ludimi lwaami, kumona nasuba kwabule muune mumudilo.›<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Ila, Abulaamu bya muyaka ti: ‹Ee! ha mwana waami! Hejya ti beebe mu mwejyo woobe wene nakuseelala kwa bule. Ila Lazalo we vuka bobo kusuba. Haŋa leelo iye ndate mukuseelela na beebe ndute mukusuba. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Lungi, hamukidi hiinu na bashu kudi kineene kikaata. Kwakuboya ti baaba bakivula kunyomoka kuune kwatudi bayene kokwa kwamudi ndabakusamuna. Byakebee baaba badi kokwa kwamudi, naibo ndaba kusamuna kuva kuuku kwatudi.› <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Yowa kabobo bya saula ti: ‹Tata itu mbebya, ngikwiaya noobe ti yiisha Lazalo wayene kukilongo kiitu, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />kumona mbidi nabakwami batanoo, wayeene kukabamanye ngasi ibo na ibo baviyaa kuune mudiino bua dyakusuba.› <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Ila Abulaamu bya mujyongodela ti: ‹Bakwobe badi na businye bwa Musa na bwa Babushi.*<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Badi na Musa na Babushi; nguboya ti: «Badi na businye bwa musa na businye bwa Babushi ao itu ndabavateezye mauya ma Musa na Mauya ma Babushi.»</char></note> Bayakane mukuteejya beebya bya bukiyakula!› <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Ila yowa kabobo bya jyongola ti: ‹Ndabeebyo, tata Abulaamu, yeeya ndayikibambana. Ila itu mundu yumo wanyomokela kokwa ku nengo na wayena kwabadi, bifundulujya matima maabo.› <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Ila Abulaamu byamujyongodela ti: ‹Itu baaba bakwoobe ndabavasamuna kuteejya beebya biki saula Businye bwa Musa na bwa babushi* byabukisaula, ndabakuteejya nee itu mundu wa zikuka kunengo.›»<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Yeesu wa langidila kukidila kuta bubi na kufiila lusa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mat 18.6-7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21">21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 22">22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mlk 9.42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Ni, Yeesu haya sawiila badingisi* baayi ti: «Mauya makushwejya bandu mu bubi mitetebela bobo. Ila, kuloebwa kwa yowa mundu yivishila bangi mauya makushwejya mu bubi. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Yandi yakana bilegela kudi yowa mundu kuangibwa ibu dikata mu singu na umu taasha mu iziba, kusidi iye kuonesha mububi yumo mu baaba basheenene.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luk 17.2 mushoo iyoowa muundu gubumutabu'a Yeesu na umukumba.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Muyakane mukukwikengeyela! Ishu mu kwoobe wa kuteela bubi, beebe kamufiike kyaala! Na itu wakwibanga, umu fiile lusa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 18.15; Ef 4.32, Kol 3.13</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Nangi waku teela bubi myunda musambo mu lusu lulumu, na ishu wa galusha koodi na, ‹Waku haajya lusa›, mbendo musambo, Umufiidi lusa bobo.»<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu wa langidila bandu kukidila butabuke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Nyuma ya haŋo, mitonge* haya mu sawiila Vidi-nyambi ti: «Hee! Vidi-nyambi utu hibikile kutabuka.» <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Na eyu haya ba sawiila ti: «Ishu kutabuka kwiinu kwandiyakana bushu kamuka kasheenene ga haladali, mwandi saudila wuu muti ti ukwitukune na ukakwikase muluuyi, naiwo ukibambana kumuteejya.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 13.31; 17.21; Malako 9.23</char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bikibambana kuta muvubi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mutongi mu Kgiliki ni «Mutumwa» lola Kol 3.23</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />Yeesu haya saula lungi ti: «Mundu yumo hamukidi hiinu uki bambana kuyakana na muvubi waaye wakunda ao kidindikijya bishi byaye. Yowa muvubi itu wagalusha ku makunda, buune, vidi waaye ukibambana kumusaudila ti: ‹Wayakane na wasombe kudye?› <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 12.37</char></note>Bogo! Ukibambana kumusaudila ti: ‹Uni te kedi bidyaazi bangu, kisha ufundulujye ngubu yileela ni unitudile. Ni na beebe udya na unywe.› <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Haŋo, mukiejya ti vidi wa yowa muvubi umuteela abee kumona ti waata byooso biva musaudileeye? Hebo! <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola 1Kolito 9.16</char></note>Na banyu mbeebyo bobo. Hamukita byooso bikimulaa Kabejya kuta, muyakane mukuyakula ti: ‹Baashu tudi bavubi basidi na kitaata, twaata bobo maama matuvahajyibwa kuta.›»<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu wa fuula badi na kivu umi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Yeesu uvange mulwendo ku Yelusalema, haya kila mu mihandu ya kisi kya Samaliya na Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Havanangiye mukusosoka mumukola humo, bakivu bamo habaava kuvakumaana naye. Haba taluka munonga naye, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.12</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kukidila bebya bidi buta bwa Musa* yikiyakana mukuyakula, mundu yidi na kivu ndebambana kutuluka tonono na bandu bangi. Lola Walawi 13. 46.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />na kusomba kuyaba ti: «Hee! Mulangidijyi Yeesu utu fiile lusa!» <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Loa Luka 5.5</char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Yeesu bweebu bamona, haya ba sawiila ti: «Mwenange muka kwimoneshe uba mupelo*.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Walawi 14.2-3</char></note> Haŋa haba bwanangi bakidi zila kuyenanga kokwa, haba fuu'a.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Law 14.2; Mat 8.4</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Yumo hamukidi haabo havamoneye ti waafuka haŋo, haya galu'a udi Yeesu, eyu mumu tumbijya Kabejya na muhuya watagadi. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Haya kwaa hulu'a u magulu ga Yeesu na lukebo lwaaye mupaka mumavu, byamu teela abee. Yowa mundu gubwanangi mu Musamaliya.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 10.5</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Haŋo Yeesu haya yakula ti: «Miti, badi nanimba kumi bavafudibwa! Baaba bangi kitema badi kuni? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Nda kukimoneka yungi hamukidi haabo gubu galu'a kuu mu hidiminya Kabejya mbungu, ha yuugu bobo sidi Muyaudi ye, halaa?» <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Haŋo Yeesu bya jyongodela yowa Musamalia ti: «Taluka, yene byobe. Butabuke bwoobe bwakufuula.»<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuviyaa kwa butangala bwa Kabejya*</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-41">Mat 24.23-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Lusu lumo, Bafalisayo haba yuujya Yesu ti: Butangala bwa Kabejya* buuva akaayi? Bya bayaka ti: «Butangala bwa Kabejya* ndabukiva bidi kindu kikimoneka. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Bandu ndabakuboya ti: ‹Mumone budi haŋa!›, ao ‹Niboobwa budi kokwa!› Muhudikijye bangu! Bobwa butangala ndabute tonaa hamukidi hiinu.»<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Ni Yeesu bya jyongodela badingisi* baaye ti: «Kindi kivanga muvula kungumona miimi Mwana wa Mundu nendusu lulumo, ila ndamwakungumona. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Bandu bimusaudila ti: ‹Mulole udi kokwa!› Ao ‹Mulole udi haŋa!› Ila, banyu ndamueleka kujyukila kokwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Kumona lusu lwa miimi Mwana wa Mundu hambialukanga, nimonekanga bushwa mwimwi ukimonekanga ku ulu na kumunukila musenge wooso. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Ila, busu bwa beebyo, yinguajya busu nasube kwabule, na kubengeebwe na bandu ba masu maleelo. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Byake bee byenange kindi kya Nuu, ni byakebee byabiyakananga mukindi kya miimi Mwana wa Mundu hambialuka. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Kumona maama masu, bandu bene byake bee mukudya na kunywa, ku tundula na kukwitundujyena, mupaka lolwa lusu lwe shwela Nuhu mu safina. Haŋo mbila yikata haya nyomokela, na kubatotejya booso.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Sombelo 6.5-22, 7.1-23</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Yiyakana byake bee bya yeene kindi kya Loti. Bandu bene mukudya na kunywa, bene mukuula na kuudisha, benemukukunanga tumuka na kuyebeka byende. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Ila, lusu lwenyomoka Loti mumukola Sodoma, Kabejya bya hukula mudilo bidi vula ya mabu kunyomoka ku ulu. Wowa mudilo hawafikinya bandu booso.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Sombelo 18.20-33, 19.1-25</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Nibebya byayi yakana mu masu mambialuka miimi Mwana wa Mundu.<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Mu lolwa lusu, yowa wooso yiyakana haulu ha kyende kyaye, nda sala lungi kwakushwela mukyende na kubuula bindu byaye mwakale. Byake bee yowa yiyakana kukunda dyaye nda loboka lungi kumukola. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Muejye mama meebanga mukazi wa Loti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mulole Sombelo 19.26</char></note>! <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Mundu wooso yikebanga kufuula mwejyo waye, uuzizimisha. Ila, yowa wooso yizizimisha mwejyo waye uyakana uufula. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Ngibasaudila ti: bobwa bufuku bandu babidi biyakana mukutandabala mu buadidimo, yumo ubuudibwanga na yungi usiibwanga. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Baabakazi babidi biyakananga mukushwa kukumo; yumo ubuudibwanga na yungi usiibwanga. [<verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Babalume babidi biyakana mukuvuba mu kunda didimo yumo ubuudibwa na yungi usiibwa.]»<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Haŋo badingisi* ba Yeesu haba muyuujya ti: «Vidi-nyambi, mama mitebwela kuni?» Bya bayaka ti: «Haŋa hadi kitumba, ni haŋa haki kumaananga zalula.»<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Muele wa mwadyangu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Ni, Yeesu haya teele lungi badingisi* baaye wuuwu muele kwakubamonesha ti yiluba haajya kuyakana mukuajya Kabejya kusidi kulebela. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Haya saula ti: «Mu moola gumu mubwa nangi mulamuzi yumo. Yuu mulamuzi ndi bwanangi mumu tiina Kabejya, na gubwa nangi muu mona mundu wooso wa busadi mabusu gaayi. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Na muwowa mukola muvanange byakebee mwadyangu yumu. Yuu mwadyangu gubwanangi mu vueya kudi yuu mulamuzi mwena lusu na umu sawiila ti: ‹Uni lamunine bilweela mauya maami mangiyakananga namo na mu lwiishi waami!›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa 1.17</char></note><verse eid="LUK 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Ila, masu ga butu hamakila na yowa mulamuzi ndava vula kumulamunina. Kumongo, yowa mulamuzi haya kwijyoboojya ti: ‹Unindu miimi shilu tiina Kabejya, na nilu mona mundu wooso busadi, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 11.8</char></note>'Ila, umona ti yuugu mwadyangu wani hosho, nimunamunina bilweela mauya maaye. Kumona itu sivata biibi, utetebejya kunihosha bobo.›»<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Kukidila beebyo Vidi-nyambi byaya boya lungi ti: «Mutelegejye bileela byeebya yuugu mulamuzi mubimubi byeebu boya.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 7.13</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Buune, Kabejya naaye ndaku lamunina bileela baaba besoboleye baki mudidila bufuku munyinya? Buune, ulowanga kwakubanyangujya? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Nami sawiila ti: ubalamunina imo kabilo. Ila, haŋa miimi Mwaana wa Mundu hambialukanga, nibanganga bandu badi na butabuke muune mumusenge?»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 8.20, 16.27</char></note><verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muele wa Mufalisayo* na mundu gulu haajya mulambu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Kwenange bandu bene mukukwimona badi buludi busu bwa Kabejya na kumona bangi busadi. Ni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 16.15; Isa 65.5</char></note> Yeesu haya ba teela huu muele: <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mdo 3.1</char></note>«Lusu lumu, bandu babidi bava yena ku Lubunga* kukahaajya Kabejya. Yumu gubwanangi mu Falisayo*, na yungi uvanange gulu haajya mulambu. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Yuugu mu Falisayo*, haya talu'a, na heekilu haajya Kabejya munda mwa tima dyaayi ti: ‹Ha Kabejya waami, noota abee koodi beebe manee miimi sikiyakananga bidi bangi bandu. Ibo bakiyakananga bakiyiba, lungi bakibembela, lungi bamasenga. Na kuteela abee manee miimi shidi bidi yuugu lu haajya mulambu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Zab 135.2; Isa 1; 15; 58.2; Ufu 3.17</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Mala kabidi mu yinga, Ngiajyanga kusidi kudya. Na nilu tuula luba lwa kumi lwa bindu byaami byooso.›<verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">18.13 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Isa 66.2; Luka 23.48; 5.32; 1tim 1.15</char>
    </note>Ila, yoowa hulu haajya mulambu iye, haya tebemena munonga, ndavaheleka nee kutundula meeso maaye haulu. Ila, uvanange bobo mukukwituta biboko muanga dyaye na susu, mukuajya lusa ti: ‹Kabejya waami, nguviile lusa! Miimi mbidi mundu kita bubi!› »<verse eid="LUK 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Ni Yeesu bya boya ti: «Namujyongodela ti yuu kihajya mulambu we haluka kukyende kyaaye na Kabejya wamumona bidi mundu yidi buludi busu bwaaye. Ila, yowa Mufalisayo*, ndabeebya! Kumona kila yowa kikwibajyanga ushajyibwanga. Ila kila yowa kikwishajyanga iye ubajyibwanga.»<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wafiyuula baana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mlk 10.13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">18.15 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 19.13; Luka 10.13</char>
    </note>Lusu lumu, bandu babuvishila Yeesu baana basheenene mukuboya ti wahibike biboko. Haŋa badingisi* baaye habeemona beebyo, haba hanunukila baaba bandu. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola 1Kolito 14.20; 1Pet 2.2</char></note>Ila, Yeesu haya tabukila bamu vishile baaba baana. Haya saudila lungi baaba badingisi* baaye ti: «Musame baaba baana baave kwambidi! Ndamuba zikilanga. Manayaaye, Butangala bwa Kabejya* ngwa baaba badi bidi baaba baana. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Namu saudila byakwinikindu ti mundu neeyumo sikitabuka Butangala bwa Kabejya* bidi mwaana musheenene, ndakushweela neehamo mubobwa butangala*.»<figure style="fig" alt="Jésus acceuille les petits enfants" file="WA03880b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="18.17">Yeesu wafiyuula baana basheenene</figure><verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu wajyobola na yumo kabobo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mlk 10.17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Mukulu yumo wa Bayaudi bya yuujya Yeesu ti:«Mulangidijyi muleela, nate kaayi kwaku boya ti navuke mwejyo wamisha yooso?» <verse eid="LUK 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yeesu hayamu lunga ti: «Kwakaayi wangundaane muleela? Nda kudi yidi muleela kabejya iye bunga. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Miti ukiyukanga bikiyakulanga buta* bwa Kabejya ti: ‹Ndu yakana mukuta masenga, ndu yakana mukuyaijyana, ndu yakana mukuyiba, ndu yakana mukusaula bya manu kudi mundu. Lungi uyakane mukuteejya shobe na najyoobe.›»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Kut 20.12-16; Deut 5.16-20</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Yowa mundu hayajyongodela Yeesu ti: «Ngitanga bobwa buta* kusombela buenda bwaami.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">'Usomba bugenda bwaami: genda, micha 'umi na yi bidi, koo boya tii mwaana bamu tabu'i mu diini dya Bayuda. (2.42)</char></note><verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Haŋa heva teejya Yeesu maamo, hayamujyongodela ti: «Kukishaala kindu kikimo kya wesheeta: Udisha bindu byooso byaudi nabyo, na mona yooso yauvukanga uhabanyine tushuvi yeya mona, waata bebya beebe uyakana nakabokosho kuaulu. Kiisha viyaa ungujyange.»<verse eid="LUK 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Ila, yowa mundu heeva teejyeye beebyo, weteejya susu kabisa, kumona wene kabobo kabisa.<verse eid="LUK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yeesu hemumoneye ti yuhu mundu wateejya susu dyabule, bya boya ti: «Kwinikindu binyumine kwa tubobo kushwela mu butangala bwa Kabejya*!<verse eid="LUK 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Mbieleela kabisa kwa ngamia kukila muhundu ndya mutubulo, kusidi kabobo kushwela mubutangala bwa Kabejya*»<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Baba bandu habeetejya maamo mauya haba yuujya ti: «Itu mbeebyo, njyuni kaa yi fuka kwa tima?» <verse eid="LUK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yeesu bya saula ti: «Kindu kyooso kisiki samunika kudi bandu kalunga, kiki samunika kudi Kabejya.»<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Haŋo Petelo bya jyongola Yeesu ti: «Lola bangu! Bashu twasama byooso byatwene nabyo kwakukujyanga!» <verse eid="LUK 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yeesu bya basaudila ti: «Kwinikindu ngibasaudila, mundu wooso itu wasama kyende kyaye, ao mukajyaye, ao bakwaye, ao bashaye, au baana baye kukidila butangala bwa Kabejya,* <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />uebwa bindu byabule mukindi kikidiye muune mumusenge. Na mukindi kivanga, uebwanga byakee bee mwejyo wa misha yooso.»<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wajyongola lungi kukidila kumota na kufukuka kwaye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mlk 10.32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Nyuma ya haŋo, Yeesu bya buula baba mitonge baye kumi na babidi, haya bajyongodela ti: «Muteejye bangu! Bashu baano twabanda kuyenanga ku Yelusalemu, na kokwa kibojywa kindu kyoso kyesinyibwa na babushi* kukidila miimi Mwaana wa Mundu <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Kumona nitudibwa mubiboko bya bandu basidi Bayaudi. Naibo bingusea, na kungungaya, na kunifidila mata, <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />na bingushwika tundendele, kisha binguyaa. Na masu masatu kisha kumota kwaami ni fukuka.» <verse eid="LUK 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Ila, mitonge baye ndabe yuka ngingu ya mama mauya, kumona yene bufyamishibwe kwabadi. Na ndabeyuka ti Yeesu we yakudila kaayi.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wa fula mukufu yumo ku Yeliko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mlk 10.46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Haŋa Yeesu hetuluka tonono na kusosoka ku mukola wa Yeliko, byabanga mukufu yumo wene buyakane haasi hangondo ya zila, mukuta kalabwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kalabwa nguboya ti: wene mukuajya bandu bamu nyangujye. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Yowa mukufu heteejyeye kiandu kyabandu muku kila bya yuujya ti: «Kudi kayi?» <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Bandu haba muyaka ti: «Ni Yeesu wa Nazaleti yidi muku kila.» <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Haŋa heetejyeye bebyo bya bajya muuya na kuboya: «Yeesu Mwana wa Daudi ungufiile lusa!» <verse eid="LUK 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Baba bandu beyena kumbala ya Yeesu haba muhanunukila na kumuboya ti wauume nyaa. Ila iye bya bajya muuya lungi: «Mwana wa Daudi ungufiile lusa!»<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yeesu bya tukama, bya boya bamuvishile yowa mukufu. Haŋa hetulukeye tonono na Yeesu, Yeesu bya muyuujya ti: <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />«Ukivula nakuteele kayi?» Naiye bya boya ti: «Vidi-nyambi, ngivula na mone lungi.» <verse eid="LUK 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Ni Yeesu bya mujyongodela ti: «Mona lungi! Butabuke bwobe bwakufuula.» <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Hakeaŋa, yowa mukufu bya mona lungi. Byajyanga Yeesu kutumbijya Kabejya. Haŋa heeva mona bandu booso maamo, naibo haba yakana byakebee naibo mukushisha Kabejya.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Yeesu na Zakayo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luk 19.1-10 Luka eyu buunga i gubusaguhu musahu wa Yeesu na Zakayo. Yeesu walola baandu babumonebwa busadi na mangana ya Lubunga*. Zakayo, heebu kumaŋana na Yeesu ndibuta byeebya bibuta yoowa gudi na mona.</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Haŋa hesosoka Yeesu mumukola wa Yeliko, uvane muku kidila muzila ya wowa mukola. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Mu wowa mukola mwene mundu yumo wetaanibwa Zakayo, naiye wene mukulu wababa bakiajya mulambu, na wenange kabobo. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Wevula kumona Yeesu itu ngwayike namuna. Ila kumona wene kapimbi, ndesamuna kumumona Yeesu kukidila bungi bwa bandu. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Kumona beebya, bya yena kumbala kabilo byaka banda haulu hamuti ti wa mumone Yeesu. Manee yivahajya Yeesu wakidile muyee zila.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola 1Fal10.27; 1Nya27.28; 18.37</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Haŋo Yeesu heebufi'a mudedya bua, haya lola heegulu na haya mu sawiila Zakayo ti: «Zakayo, sala bwidibwidi Manee nayananga munyini woobe leelo!»<figure style="fig" alt="Zaché est monté sur l'arbre pour quil voit Jésus" file="WA03891b.tif" size="Span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="19.5">Zakayo wabanda kumuti ti wamone Yeesu</figure><verse eid="LUK 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Zakayo haya sala bwidibwidi, haya mu tambula Yeesu na tuseo. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 9.11</char></note>Bandu booso bemona beebyo, habasomba kuojywa mukuboya ti: «Yee! Wayena kukayakana kukyende kya mundu yidi na bubi!»<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Ila, Zakayo haya talu'a busu bwa Yeesu na kumujyongodela ti: «Hee! Vidi-yambi, teejya bangu! Miimi ni gabilanga tusuvi luba lwa mona yaami. Na itu vakenda mundu wooso kindu kukila jyamba, nimuhalushila mala yinaa.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 7.13; 3.12-13; Hes 5.7; Eze 33.14-15</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yeesu haya mujyongodela ti: «Leelo kufuuka kwa shweela mukiiki kyendi. Kumona, Yuu naye ngwakilongo kya Abalahamu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Rum 4.16; Gal 3.17</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Kumona Miimi Mwaana wa Mundu vaava kukeba na ufuula baaba babu zizimina.»<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muele wa bavubi basatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat 25.14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">19.11 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 17.20; Mat 3.2; Mdo 1.16</char>
    </note>Bandu beyidididye kuhudikijya mauya me yakulanga Yeesu. Hetulukeye tonono na kusosoka na mukola wa Yelusalema, bandu haba niijya ti, Butangala bwa Kabejya* ndabukajya mu kyakekye kindi. Kukidila beebyo, Yeesu haya ba teele wuu muele gungi ti: <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Malako 13.34; Mat 25.14</char></note> «Kuvanange mundu yumu uvanange mu kilongo kya bu kolo. Yowa mundu we yeena mu issi kya ula ti, mukuboya ti bamubajye kauna kabukolo kokwa, ni waaluke kutalukila kisi kyaaye. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 13.34</char></note>Ila, busu bwaiye kuyena, bya taŋana bandu kumi hamukidi habavubi baayi. Bya baabanyina kila mundu mona yimo kwa yimo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mona yiyimo: yene mbindu biki bambana kuvubibwa bindi mia yiyimo.</char></note> na kubasaudila ti: ‹Musunge na yiiyi mona ti yabande, mupaka hambialuka.› <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Yohana 1.11</char></note>Ila bandu ba kisi kyaayi bemubenganga. Ni haba yiisha bandu basaule ti: Ndabakivula wabatalukile.<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />Ila nembebya yowa mundu webajyibwa kauna bya haluka kukisi kyaye. Hehalukeye, hakeaŋa hayaboya bamutaanine baaba bavubi baayi kumi, Kumona uvavula wayuke kila mundu uvafumisha yinga. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Muvubi wabusu bya sosoka nakuboya ti: ‹Vidi-nyambi, yeya mona yiyimo yawenguziila yivabutula yingi kumi.› <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Naiye vidi-nyambi waye bya yakula ti: ‹Udimwamulume! Beebe muvubi muleela. Kumona uvanange mutabuki mubindu bisheenene, na kuabila bukolo kwakutebemena mikola kumi.› <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Muvubi wakabidi na eyu hayavueya na haya saula ti: ‹vidi yaaulu yiva fuma yingi yitano ku yeya mona yiyimo yauvangwabila.› <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />vidi naiye byamujyongodela ti: ‹Na beebe nakubajya kauna ka bukolo bwakutebemena mikola yitano.›<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Ni muvubi yungi haya vueya na hayaboya ti: ‹vidi-nyambi buula mona yoobe. Mbeyifyamisha bileela mukiba kya ngubu. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola 2Sam 1.16; Ay 15.6; Mat 25.26</char></note>Vanemukukutiina kwa bule, kumona ukiyakananga mwamulume munyumiine. Beebe ukibuulanga bisidi byoobe, na ukiolanga byawashe kuna.› <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola 2Sam 1.16; Ay 15.6; Mat 25.26</char></note>Naiye vidi waye bya mujyongodela ti: ‹Beebe ni Muvubi mubimubi! Nakuonesha kukidila kekya kyanyomoka kuusi kwa ludimi lwoobe, uvayuka ti kiyakananga mwamulume munyumine, na ngibuula bindu bisidi byaami, na kungula bindu byambisiva kuna. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Kwa kaayi kaa, nduvabika mona yaami ku banki? Mukualuka kwami, miti mbandi yibanga yavudila!› <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Ni yowa vidi haya basawiila baaba babwanangi haŋa ti: ‹Yu muvubi mumukuuzule yeya mona yeedi nayu, mumugabidi yoowa yidi na kumi.› <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Naibo haba musaudila ti: ‹Mulangidijyi, miti yuu udi kalekale na falanga kumi!› <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Naiye bya bayaka ti: ‹Nabasaudila ti mundu yowa yidi na kindu ni yiiebwanga na kingi. Ila yowa sidi na kindu, nee ngekya kishee kidiye nakyo bimukuzulanga. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Lungi yowa vidi byaboya ti: Balwishi baami, basheevula ti na yakane kolo wabo, Mubavishe haŋa na mubayae busu bwaami.›»<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wa shwela mu Yelusalemu na kineemo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mlk 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoh 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Haŋa heewa Yeesu kuyakula maamo, bya yidididye na luendo lwaaye ku Yelusalemu iye busu bwa bandu. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Hesosokeye tonono mumukola wa Bethfage na wa Bethania, tonono na kituulu kya Mizeituni. Bya yiisha badingisi* baye babidi, byaba jyongodela ti: <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />«Mwene mumukola udi kumbala yiinu. Hamuyakana mwashwela mumukola, mubanga mwana wa punda muangibwe, na ndeshwala mundu nee yumo. Mumuangule munguvisheleye haŋa. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Itu mundu wamuyuujya ti kwakayi muki muangula, mubasaudile ti: ‹Vidi-nyambi udi naye sungu.›»<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Haŋo baba badingisi* beyishibwa haba yena. Hababanga byakebee biva yakula Yeesu. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Haŋa habenange mukuangula yowa mwaana wa punda, beni waye haba ba yujya ti: «Kwakayi mukiangula yowa mwaana wa punda?» <verse eid="LUK 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Naibo haba bayaka ti: «Vidi-nyambi ni yidi naye sungu.»<verse eid="LUK 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Haŋo habashwala yowa mwana wa punda kudi Yeesu. Kisha haba baza ngubu yabo haulu ha yowa mwana punda, ni haba bajya Yeesu haulu haye. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Haŋa henange Yeesu mukutuluka muluendo, bandu habasikiye kusikibaza ngubu yabo haulu hazila<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bayaudi habaki tabuka kolo, bene mukumubazila ngubu muzila kwakumuneemesha.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Haŋa he tuluka Yeesu tonono na mukola wa Yelusalemu, mukuulumuka kukituulu kya Mizeituni, kiandu kyooso kya badingisi* baye haba yudibwa na mwenye haba somba kushisha Kabejya kwa muuya ukata kukidila bingulungulu byooso byabemona. <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Haba yakana mukuyakula ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">«Wafiyudibwe Kolo uvanga kwa zina dya Vidi-nyambi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">Nyaa yayakane ku haulu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">na Kabejya watumbibwe!»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Zabuli 118.26</char></note><verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Haŋo bamo Mafalisayo benange mu kiandu haba musaudila Yeesu ti: «Mulangidishi, humisha badingisi* boobe!»  <verse eid="LUK 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Ila Yeesu byaba saudila ti: «Ngiba saudila, itu baaba bauuma, mabu ni mibajya miuya!»<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wadila kukidila Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Haŋa hetuluka Yeesu tonono na mukola wa Yelusalemu, hehumoneye, bya udidila. <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />Haya jyongola ti: «Itu wandiyuka leelo diino mauya makibambana kuvisha nyaa! Ila buune mafyamishibwa busu bwoobe, ndukibambana kumamona. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Kumona mafuku mavanga balwishi boobe, bikunyunganga ti bakulwiishe kiaya. Na haŋa habiyakana bakwilukila mubwiila wakukwizikila tonono nobe ni habikufinga mbanga yooso. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Biku sobasoba beebe kukumo na bandu boobe. Ndaba kukusamina ibu nee dino didi haulu hadingi, kumona nduvayuka kindi kyeva Kabejya kukufuula.»<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wajyanga bakisunga mulubunga*</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-17">Mat 21.1-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mlk 11.15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoh 2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Haŋa heshwela Yeesu mu lubunga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lubunga: Haŋa, yene luba lwa lubunga kwabeene mukuudishila bindu bya kutudila Kabejya. Na baaba basidi bayaudi ni habenyinamina ao kuajya Kabejya. </char></note>, bya somba kujyanga baba bakisunga. <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />bya basaudila ti: «Businye bwa Kabejya makisaula biibi: ‹Kyende kyami kiyakananga kyende kyakuajyila Kabejya.› Ila banyu, mwakifululujyaka lumba dya baba bakiyiba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isaya56.7; Yelemia 7.11</char></note>!»<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Masu mooso Yeesu we langidila bandu munda mwa lubunga*. Ila bakulu baba Mupelo*, na balangidishi ba Buta*, na Batutu bava vula kumuyaisha. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Ila ndabesamuna kumona bandu booso benange muku muteejya zizii.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">Butangala bwa Yeesu bubu vueya 'uni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mlk 11.27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Lusu lumu, Yeesu gubwa nangi mu Lubunga.* Momwa gubwa nangi mukulangidila bandu Musau uleela. Hanga hanha, bakulu ba mupelo*, Balangidijyi Buta* hamonga na banunu ba Bayuda habafi'a momwa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luk 19.28-48, 45 Yeesu wazyaanga baaba babwanaangu muugula na ugudisha muunda Lubunga*.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Yohana 2.18; Mdo 4.7</char></note>na haba mu yuujya Yeesu ti: «Utu sawiidi, ukita buubu butangala? Boodi muuta nabu bindu ni naani fuku gabila?» <verse eid="LUK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Ihani Yeesu haya balunga: «Na miimi shaa miyujyanga huuya didimu. Muni sawiidi: <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />Butangala bwa Yohana, boo yabika bandu, bubuvueya Udi Kabejya au udi bandu?» Nguni 'ubu vueya<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Ni baaba bandu habasomba kukwisaujyejyijyeena ti: «Itu twamuyaka ti: ‹Butangala bwa Yohane buvaviyaa kudi Kabejya›, na iye utuyuujya ti: ‹Ngyaayi kyatusiva tabukila bebya bivayakula Yohana?› <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 7.29; Mat 11.9</char></note>Ila itu twa mulunga ti: ‹Butangala bubu vueya u bandu›, bandu booso badi haŋa batu heganga na mabu. Manee booso balu yu'a bilegela ti, Yohana ni mubushi* wa Kabejya.» <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Ihani haba mu lunga ti: «Boobwa butangala bwa Yohane nda tuluyu'a kwa bubu huma.» <verse eid="LUK 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yeesu na eyu haya ba lunga tii: «Na miimi shoomi sawiila biibi nidi muu bita mubutangala bwa naani.»<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muele wabakikuna babibabi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mlk 12.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">20.9 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Isa 5.17; Mat 25.14</char>
    </note>Biibi ukila, Yeesu hayaba hondolweela bandu guunga muele: «Mundu yumu gubu kuna unda dyaye dya mizabibu*, haya yambisha bandu bamu ti, badikuni didi unda; na hoo shuula bamugabilangi na eyu iba kya bebya byabihungulanga. ihani haya weena u issi kya ula, ha yaana koo'a masu ga butu. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola 2Nya 36.15, 16</char></note>Ihindi kyoo shuula hakibu fi'a, mundu yuugu haya yiisha muvubi waayi yumu udi baaba balu kuna, ti bamu gabidi kyaayi iba kya biyaazi. Ila, baabu balu nima, babu muta na umujyanga minyu busadi. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Yule mwiini wa unda haya tinda muvubi yungi wa bubidi, yowa na eyu haba mu kaya na umuta na haba mu jyanga minyu busadi. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Haya bayiishila muvubi yungi wa busatu. Yoowa na eyu haba muta byeela na umu taasha haajya ya unda. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 3.17</char></note>Habobwa mwiini wa unda haya yiyujya: ‹Naati bini? Shaa taki'anga mwaana waami wandu vula kwa butu; hangi bamu teejyanga na umu gabila ineemu kyaayi!› <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Ila, baaba balu yihila unda dya mizabibu hababu mona mwaana avueyanga, haba kilu yi sagujyeena mu bwaata bwaabu: ‹Miti yuu ni wa hyananga didi 'unda! Tumu hege, koo mona ti, didi unda dya yambu hyaana dya yaani diishu!› <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Kisha haba mu waata na kumukakata haaza ya na kumu hega.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Ni Yeesu haya ba yuujya: Yuugu mwiini unda dya mizabibu watanga bini na baaba ba vubi? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 19.27</char></note>Wa vueyanga na ubatotejya baaba ba vubi booso ba unda dya mizabibu* na ugabila bangi ba vubi didi 'unda dya mizabibu.» Bandu hababu telegejya biibi haba boya: «Kabejya ndi samanga biibi byoodi muu sagula ti nda bi tufi'inga nangi lumu!»<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Ila, Yeesu haya balola na meesu ga bwaazi na haya boya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">«Maama mauya matokatoka ma Kabejyamakiboya bini?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">‹Abu kaa'a baaba balu yenga ka babu keezema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">buni nda adi abu kaatakaata ka sina!›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abu kaatakaata ka sina. Lola Zab 118.22 Ni Yeesu beedi ba madini ba Isilaeli babu mu keezema. Yeesu 'ukidila eyu, 'ihani muundu wa mumone Kabezya. Malako 12.10-11; Rom 9.31-33; 1Pet 2.6-8</char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Mundu yoowa wooso wa hulu'anga mu abu kaa'a ubelekabeleka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:18">na abu kaa'a itu kamu hulwiila kamu tanyanga pekeshipekeshi.»<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">20.19 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 19.47; Malako 11.18</char>
    </note>Bakulu ba Balangidijyi ba Buta* na ba mupelu batagadi haba kilu keba zila yoo mu waata Yeesu. Manee babu yu'a tii, guugu musunga wa yoota waba teela ebu. Habobwa babwa nangi muu tiina kiandu kya bandu. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 12.10; 27.2</char></note>Habobwa haba kidi mumu yundila, na haba bii'a bandu ha ngondo waayi babu yi bii'a mugela wa Yeesu; koo boya tii, bamu waati mu busahudi na bamu waati na 'umu bii'a mu minyu ya ngana ya issi.<verse eid="LUK 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utuula milambu udi kolo wa issi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-27">Mlk 12.13-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Habobwa baaba babwa nangi mumu yundila haba mu sawiila: «Mulangidijyi, twa yu'a unindu tii, gudi muu sagula na utuluula bindu bya unindu. Ndudi na mbangu ludi; beebe gulu ludi'a bandu mu zila ya buludi. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Haŋa utu sawiidi: Buta* bulutabu'a, baashu tu tuudi mulambu udi Kaizaliya* wakisi?» <verse eid="LUK 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Yeesu gubu yu'a ti ndabamuteela mumauya maabo, haya basawiila ti: <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />«Muni moneshe lufalanga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dinali ni fwalanga ya Kiloma. Yibwanangi na lweebu lwa Kaisali Tibelio, ngana mwatagadi wa Loma, na mahuuya: «Tibelio Kaisali, mwaana kabezya Augusto.» Habanyungalazya kuu'u, usinya.</char></note> Haboobwa, haya ba yuuja ti: Mu yiiyi fwalanga mudi lweebu lwa naani na zina dya naani?» Haba mu lunga ti: «Lweebu na zina ndya Kaizali.» <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Ihani Yeesu haya ba sawiila ti; «Mu yaani muumu gabila Kaizali byaayi na Kabejya byaayi.» <verse eid="LUK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Baaba bandu haba hina huuya dyoo mu waatila manee gubwa nangi babusu ga bandu. Ila haba yaana nyaa na haba sheeka yega na byeebya byeebu ba lunga.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Basandukayo bamu yuujya Yeesu ukidila kufukuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mlk 12.18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Masadukayo, bamu habava udi Yeesu. Basadukayo ni hibo babwa nangi muu keezema na uboya ti, bamote bifukukanga. Haba mu sawiila ti: <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />«Mulangidishi, Musa gubu tusinyina biibi mu Buta* bwiishu ti; ishu muwaayi na mundu yumu wamota na umusiga mwadyangu nangi baana, mbilegela muwaayi wamuyaane yuuyu mwadyangu, koo boya ti watotedi muwayi uvamota baana. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Ubwa nangi balungwa musamboo ba ifu kiimu. Yowa mbadi haya tundula na hayamota ndibusiga baana. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Yowa muwaayi wa bubidi haya mu tundula yowa mwadyangu, na eyu hayamota na ndibu tota nayu; <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />na muwaayi wa busatu na eyu byanga byeebya. Booso musamboo bavamota nangu siga mwaana nangi yumu na yuugu mwadyangu. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Umongo, yowa mwaana wa mwaazi na eyu hayamota. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Haboobwa mu ihindi kyee'a kyakufukuka baaba bavamota, yoowa wa mwaazi wayananga wa naani? Manee booso musamboo babu mu tundula.»<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yeesu haya balunga: «Muune mumusenge babanumi bakitundulanga na babaazi bakitundukanga. <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Haboobwa baaba Kabejya baya monanga tii, balu bengeneena ufuulu'a, koo boya tii, bashweele mu butangala boobwa bwa vueyanga nda boo tundula na nda boo tundudibwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Unindu nda bakumota lungi. Baya nanga byeebya bidi Malaika*. Ni ebu baana ba Kabejya, manee Kabejya waba fukula. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Haboobwa ukidila ufuulu'a kwa bafu, Musa gubu monesha hululu ti, ba fukukanga. Bilusagula Businyi, bwa safu didi mukutema mudilu. Mu buga ndyebu muteena Kabejya ti: ‹Kabejya wa Abulaamu na Kabejya wa Isaka na Kabejya wa Yakobo.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yeesu wa lengele mahuya ga Kut 3.2-6. Kabejya wa baaba boomi: i Abalaamu na Isaka na Yakobo baaba babufwa, badi boomi.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Yeesu haya boya lungi tii: Kabejya ndilu yaana Kabejya wa bafu, haboobwa gulu yaana Kabejya wa bandu badi mwejyo, manee kwaayi booso badi na buumi.» <verse eid="LUK 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Bamu balangidishi ba Buta* haba sagula tii: «Mulangidishi wa lunga mu buludi unindu!» <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Na haŋa nda babu heleka lungi umuyujya mauya.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilisito na Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22.41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mlk 12.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Yeesu haya ba yuujya bandu lungi tii: «Ngyaayi idi muu sawiila bandu ti Kilisito* Mwaana wa Daudi? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Daudi eyu mwinikindu ukiyakula mubu sinye bwa Zabuli:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">‹Vidi-Kabejya uva saudila Vidi wami ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">Viyaa uva yakane haŋa ha kiboko kyami kyamwajyo mulume,<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />mupaka bebya byambibika balwishi boobe biyatidilo byabi ndimba byoobe.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Zabuli110.1</char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Itu Daudi wamu taana iye: ‹Kilisito Vidi-nyambi›; bini uyakana byakebee mwana wa Daudi?»<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wa langidila bandu bakwikengeyele na balangidishi ba Buta*</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mlk 12.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Haŋa henange bandu booso mukuudikijya Yeesu, bya saudila badingisi* ti: <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />«Mukwikengeyele na balangidishi ba Buta*. Kumona, baki vula kusumukasumuka na ngubu yilayila na bakivula kusambitidibwa na bandu mukinemo munda mwama udishilu na kuyakana muma bua makinemo mubyende byakuajyila byaba Yaudi na kubuula mabua makineemo mubiandu bikata byakuseelela. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Bakibulanga bindu byooso byabaadyangu, lungi bakiajyanga Kabejya ajyo diladila mukuboya ti bamoneke balweela busu bwa bandu. Kwa biibi Ibo bilamunibwa binyumine kabisa.»<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Salaka ya mwadyangu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mlk 12.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">21.1 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 27.6; Yohaha 8.20</char>
    </note>Yeesu henangiye mulubunga, haya nyujya meeso mubandu booso haya mona beebya tubobo tukituula salaka* yaabu munda mwa kinyamanda. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Haya mona byakebee mwadyangu yumu asuvi haya tuula tufalanga tubidi twa mona moomwa mukinyamanda. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola 2Kolito 8.12</char></note>Haŋo, Yeesu haya boya ti: «Nami sawiila umindu: yuugu mwadyangu asuvi ni wa tuula salaka* ukila bandu booso. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola 2Kolito 8.12</char></note>Manee bandu bangi booso babu tuula byeebya bindu bisivane byabusadi mumona yaabo. Ila yuugu mwadyangu asuvi watuula byooso bivanangiye nabyo kwakuyakana kwaye.»<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu wa sagula uhongola kwa lubunga* ya Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mlk 13.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Bandu bamo bene mukuyakula kukidila lubunga lwa Yelusalemu. Bavane mukuboya ti lwalukibwa bileela na mabu maleela kukumo na bindu bingi bilweela bye tula bandu kudi Kabejya. Ila, Yeesu haya ba sawiila ti: <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />«Maama mooso mamukimona kuyakana lusu luvanga nda koo shagala abu heegulu wa abu dingi, bindu byooso bya bihongolebwa.» <figure style="fig" alt="Le Temple de Jérusalem" file="LB00250B.TIF" size="span" copy="Horace Knowles" ref="21.6">Lubunga lwa Yelusalemu</figure><verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Makumo mavanga busu bwa mongo ya musenge</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24.3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mlk 13.3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Ni baaba bandu habamuyuujya Yeesu ti: «Mulangidijyi, maama mooso miiva hakayi? Na ngingulungulu kai kitumoneshanga ti matonanana na kunyomokela?»<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">21.8 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 17.23</char>
    </note>Yeesu haya lunga ti: «Mukwikengeyele, mundu nangi yumu ndimi zimbanga! Kumona bandu babutu ba vueyanga muzina dyaami. Biyakana mukuboya ti ibo ni Kilisito!* Nakuboya ti kindi kyabambana. Ila banyu ndamubajyanga. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Dan 2.28</char></note>Haŋo, muteejyanga bandu mukuyakula kukidila kiaya na kukidila luvundu ndamuyakana mukutiina. Kumona maama mooso makibambana kunyomokela bangu, ila kekya kindi kyamongo kiyakana ndawesosoka.»<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">21.10 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola 2Nyak 15.6; Isa 19.2</char>
    </note>Haŋo Yeesu haya ba sawiila ti: «Issi imu kya lwanga na issi kingi. Butangala bulwa na butangala bungi. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Isa 29.6; Yoeli </char></note>Kuyakana kandengenya mumusenge wooso. Na kuyakana zala na kimbunga mabua mabule. Na mbinguni kunyomoka shanya ya kuhanunusha na yakutiinisha bandu kwa bule.<verse eid="LUK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">21.12 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 12.11; Malako 13.9; Uf 2.10; Mdo 1.3; 5.18; 21.4; 16.24;25.23; 1Pet 2.13</char>
    </note>Ila, busu bwa maama mooso kunyomokela, bimu watanga na kuba suvya. Na Bimishwaala kulamuna ku masinagogi*, na kubakasa muzitikilu. Na Bami filanga mabusu ma bakolo babutangala na bakulu ba kisi kukidila zina dyaami. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Filipi 1.12</char></note>Muyeya zila ni yamuyakana mukuyakula bebya byamukiyuka kungidila miimi. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lol Luka 12.11-12</char></note>Haŋa yamuki bambana kuyuka biibi: Ndamuyakanga mukukwisubisha busu bwa kindi ti mulamuna kaayi. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mdo 6.10</char></note>Kumona jyaami mibunga ni yimiabila mauya ma nyinyi ma muyakana mukuyakula. mupaka kindi balwishi biinu ndabakusamuna kuyaka ao kubenga maama mamuyakula. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Nee bashiinu banyu, na bakilongo kiinu, na bamonyi biinu, naibo bimutuula busu bwa bakulu. Na bamo hamukidi hiini bilamunibwa kumota. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Yohana 15.21</char></note>Bandu booso bimubenga banyu kungidila miimi. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 10.30</char></note>Ila, nembebya ndakudi lufuki neelumo lwa mishu yiinu luzizimina. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Muyaani na kulembelejya, kumona muyeya zila ni mwamufula mwejyo wiinu.»<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wa busha kukidila kuongolebwa kwa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mat 24.15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mlk 13.14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />Yeesu bya yakula lungi ti: «Haŋa, hamumona mukola wa Yelusalemu wanyungibwa na balonga-buvadi, haŋo muyuke ti kindi kya kuongolebwa kwa huu mukola kwa tonanana. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Kwabiibi, mukekya kindi bandu biyakana ku Yudea bajyukile kubituulu. Na baba biyakana munda mwa mukola wa Yelusalemu banyomoke mwakale. Na baba biyakana kubisooso ndabahaluka lungi.<verse eid="LUK 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Kumona mama masu, miyakana masu mi misubisha Kabejya bandu, kwakuboya ti mooso mesinyibwa mabambane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Hosea 9.7 </char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Maama masu, miyakana kusuba kwabo babakazi biyakana na mayimi na baba biyakana mukunyamwisha baana mu mama masu! Kumona kuyakana na kusuba kukata mukisi, na kiizi kya Kabejya kimoneka kubaba bandu. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Bamo bandu biyaibwa na luete, na bangi bikwatibwa buika mubisi bwoso; na kisi kya Yelusalemu kiyatidibwa na bandu ba bisi bingi basidi ba Yaudi, mupaka bebya bibambana kindi kyabo kyakunyomoka.»<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuviyaa kwa Mwaana wa Mundu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mlk 13.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />«Yeesu bya yidididye na kuyakula ti: Kuyakana byakuanunusha ku yuba na ku mwango na tumwinuulu. Hano hasi hayuba, bandu booso biyakana mukusuba kukata na kuobama kukidila titi dya muhee na ya mabimbi ma meema. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Bandu babule bikala kakuzi kukidila moyo, mukulodela mama mivanga muune mumusenge; kumona byooso bidi na butangala mbinguni butenganya. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Haŋo, bandu bimona miimi Mwana wa Mundu kuviyanga aulu hatimba, yidi na butangala na mbunda yi kata. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Haŋa hisomba mama makumo kutebwa, mutaluke na mutundule mishu, kumona kindi kyakufuka kwinu kwatima kwa tonanana.»<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muele wa muti wa mutini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24.32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mlk 13.28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Haŋo Yeesu bya ba teela wuu muele: «Mulole bangu muti wa mutini na miti yingi yooso!  <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Haŋa hamukimonanga mabizi maamo ma tombela, mukiyuka ti gyoo dyasala. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Byakebee, hamumona maama makumo matebwa, muyuke ti Butangala bwa Kabejya bwa tonanana. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Kwinikindu ngibasaudila ti, mama makumo mooso mibambana mukindi kya bamo bandu ba kiiki kilongo kya leelo ndabe mota. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Ulu na musenge bikilanga, ila mauya maami ndama kukila nee lumo.»<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kudindila kualuka kwa Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />Yeesu byajyongola lungi «Mukwikengeyele, ti matima miinu ndama nemenenwa bobo na kalabwa, bulevi na ndamunanama na mwejyo wiinu. Itu ndabeebyo lolwa lusu lwa kualuka kwa Kilisito lumuvilanga mukivuku, <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Bidi bebya biki subukanga muteo. Kumona lolwa lusu luviila bandu booso bamuune mu musenge mukivuku. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Muyakane na mbambi na kuajya Kabejya kindi kyooso. Mwaata biibi muyakane na butangala bwakukila nyaa mumama mooso minyomokela, na kutaluka busu bwa miimi Mwana wa Mundu.»<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Mukekya kindi kyamunyinya, Yeesu we langidila bandu mu Lubunga; ila bufuku weyenanganga ku kituulu kya Mizeituni na kukatandabala kokwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Na mukisi pupu, bandu booso be yenanganga kulubunga kwaku muteejya.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Mulango wakuyaa Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mlk 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoh 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Igandu kya mikati yishidi buhae* kya Bayuuda, ilu teenebwa Pasaka*, heebu ne naama. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Ba mupeelu* baa tagadi na balangidijyi ba Buta* babwa nangi muu keba zila yoo muhegesha Yeesu, habobwa babwa nangi muu tiina bandu.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuuda wa tabu'a umu tuula Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26.14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:10-11">Mlk 1.10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">22.3 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 4.10; Malako 14.10, 11; Yohana 13.2 </char>
    </note>Habobwa Shetani hawa sheela munda mwa Yuda. wetaanibwa lungi Yuuda Isikaliote, yowa Yuda gubwa nangi yumo hamukidi ha mitonge* kumi na yibidi ba Yeesu. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mdo 1.4; 5.24</char></note>Yuugu Yuda haya weena uba kulu babamupelo* baa bakulu na ba beedi balu dindijya bibelu bya Lubunga* mukuboya ti bakwitejyejyena nabo kukidila zila ya kutuula Yeesu. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Haba moona buuya sisu na haba mubadijya ti bimuabila falanga. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yuda haya tabuka na hasikikebeeye kindi kileela kyakutuula Yeesu kwabadi kusidi bandu kuyuka.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu watekesha bidyazi bya Pasaka*</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26.17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mlk 14.12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoh 13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">22.7 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Kumb 16.5; Malako 4.12</char>
    </note> Lusu lwa kiandu kya mikati yisidi yihae* halwabambana. Lolwa lusu ni lwabeshijyanga mwaana wa punda kukiandu kya Pasaka.* <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mdo 3.1,11; 4.13-19</char></note>Yeesu hayayiisha Petelo na Yohana na hayaba sawiila ti: «Mwenange mukatutekele biyaazi bya Pasaka*.» <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Haba mu yuuja ti: «Gudi muu vula tubitekele beebya bidyazi kuni?» <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Yeesu haya bayaka ti: «Muteejye bangu! Haŋa hamushwela mumukola mubanga yumo mwamulume kushwaala mubungu wameema, mumujyange mupaka kyende kishweeleye. <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />Haŋo mujyongodela yowa mwini kekya kyendi ti: ‹Mulangidijyi wayuujya ti: nguni kudikyumba kidileye bidyazi bya Pasaka* kukumo na badingisi* baye.› <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Naiye ubamonesha bua dikata dyaaulu dya lungakanyibwa bilweela. Momwa ni mwamutekela bidyazi bya Pasaka*.» <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Haŋo, baaba badingisi habayena, habakabanga kindu kyooso byakebe bivabasaudila Yeesu. Ni hababika tonaa bidyazi bya Pasaka.*<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bidyazi byakuhejya Vidi-nyambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26.26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mlk 14.22-26</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoh 13.36-38</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Wk 11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Kindi hakyebambana, Yeesu bya yakana kudya bidyazi kukumo na mitonge* baaye. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 16.21</char></note>Yeesu haya basawiila ti: «Nidi na sungu dya bule kudya biibi bidyazi bya Pasaka* kukumo niinu busu bwa miimi kusuba. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Kumona nabasaudila ti, shakubidya lungi bidyaazi bya Pasaka mupaka beebya byambidya beebya bikibambana mubutangala bwa Kabejya*.»<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Ni Yeesu byabuula mubungu wa divai*, byata abee kudi Kabejya hajya na kuboya ti: «Mubugudi wuuwu mubungu wa divai muabaane.* <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 26.29; Malako 14.29</char></note>Kumona na basaudila, shakunya lungi divai* mupaka butangala bwa Kabejya* habuviya.»<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Haŋo Yeesu bya bugula mukate,* hayata abee! Kudi Kabejya, na haya ubela, na haya habila badingisi* baye. Na kuboya ti: «Luulu ni lukoba lwaami lutudibwa kwamudi banyu. Mutange biibi kwakunguhejya miimi.»<verse eid="LUK 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">22.20 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Zak 9.11; 2Kolito 3.6</char>
    </note>Kisha kuwa kudya Yeesu byabuula mubungu wa divai kisha kudya, nakuboya ti: «Wuuwu mubungu ni Kilao kiya* kititiminywa na muloa waami wahukuka kukidila banyu.<verse eid="LUK 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">22.21 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Loa Zab 41.9</char>
    </note>Ila, mulodi! Yoowa yingundula udi mukudya naami. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 8.20; Mdo 2.23; 4.29</char></note>Kwinikindu, miimi Mwana wa Mundu nikwimotela byaami kukidila bebya byeyakula Kabejya. Ila kuloebwa kwa yowa ungundula.» <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Ni badingisi habasomba kukwiyujyujyena hamukidi haabo ti ni naani hamukidi haabo kibambana kuta diidi kumo.<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus mange la nourriture de Paque* avec ses apotres*" file="WA03910b.tif'" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="22.23">Yeesu waadya bidyazi bya Pasaka* na mitonge* baaye</figure>.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ninaani yidi mukulu hamukidi habadingisi ba Yeesu?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">22.24 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Malako 9.34; Luka 9.46</char>
    </note>Kisha, hamukidi habadingisi* ba Yeesu hakwanyomokela mbaka ti ni naani yidikulu kukila bezinaye. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yeesu haya ba sawiila ti: «Hamukidi hakisi kisikiyuka Kabejya, bakulu baabo bakibatalukilanga na kibandibandi. Na badi na butangala haulu haabo bakikwitananga bakita buuya.» <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1Pet 5.5; Malako 9.35; Luka 12.37</char></note>Ila ndayiyakana beebya hamukidi hiinu. Mundu yidi mukulu kukila bangi, ukibambana kuyakana bidi iye ni mwaana musheenene. Na kitalukila bangi, ukibambana kuyakana bidi iye ni muvubi waabo. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 20.28; Luka 12.37</char></note>Haŋo, ni naani yidi mukulu kukila mwizinaye mubaaba babidi? Jyowa kiyakana mukudya ao jyowa kipakudila? Miti jyowa kiyakana ukidya! Ila nembiibi, miimi mbidi hamukidi hiinu bidi kimuvubila.<verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">22.28 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Ebalania 4.15</char>
    </note>«Banyu ni belembelejya kuyakana naami mukulabudibwa kwaami. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 25.34; 2Tim 2.12</char></note>Kwa biibi, na baabila Butangala* bidi beebya byengwabila Tata waami. <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />Kwa biibi, mudya na kunywa kukumo naami mu butangala* bwaami. Lungi mbanyu ni biyakananga mutuna twa bukolo, kwakulamuna bilongo kumi na bibidi bya Isilaeli.»<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wa yakula ti Petelo utuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mlk 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoh 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Yeesu haya jyongodela Simoni Petelo ti: «Simoni, Simoni! Lengeka! Shetaani* waebwa bangu ya kubayungulula beebya byabakiyungulula ngano, mukuboya ti wamilabule.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuyungulula= Ngusagula ulumonesha ti, umushelumusha mundu mu bubi kooyu'a ulungila kwaayi. Lola Amosi 9.9.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Yohana 17.9-15; Rum 8.32; Yohana 21.15-17</char></note>Ila miimi vakuajyila ti butabuke bwoobe ndabuzizimina kwambidi. Na haŋa hingualukila, ukwatishe matima mabakwoobe.»<verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">22.33 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Yohana 11.16</char>
    </note>Naiye Petelo haya muyaka ti: «Vidi-nyambi, miimi mbidi tonaa kwena kukumo noobe muzitikilu, na nengumota kukumo noobe.» <verse eid="LUK 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yeesu haya mujyongodela ti: «Nakujyongodela beebe Petelo, leelo busu bwa muko kuyakula, uyakana wangunduna mbendo yisatu ti ndukinguyuka!»<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuyakana tonaa kindi kyooso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Ni Yeesu haya yuujya badingisi* baaye ti: «Haŋa hambebayiisha kusidi falanga, ao kusidi taba dya luendo, ao kusidi mikalabanda, kudi kindu kyamwekushwa?» Naibo habamuyaka ti: «Hebo.»<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Ni Yeesu bya basaudila ti: «Ila buune, yowa yidi na falanga wayibuule; byakebee na yowa yidi na taba dyaluendo wabuule. Byakebee, yowa wooso sidi na kiyoma waukuudisha ngubu yaye wakiule. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Kumona ngimu saudila ti maama makibambana kungubanga, maama makisinyibwanga mu Businye bwa Kabejya ti: ‹Uvabadikibwa kukumo na baba bakita bubi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Isaya 53.12</char></note>.› Kumona mauya makinguyelekela, madi tonono matuyuke kumongo waamo.»<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Badingisi* baaye haba musaudila ti: «Vidi-nyambi, lola bangu; haŋa tudi na biyoma bibidi.» Naiye bya basaudila ti: «Maamo mauya mabambanina haŋa!»<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wa hajya kukituulu kya mizeituni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mlk 14.32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yeesu byaezela mudedya bua, byabanda kukituulu kya Mizeituni byene bwaama bwaye. Na badingisi* baye haba mujyanga. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Haŋa hekajyeye mudedya bua, bya jyongodela badingisi* baye ti: «Muajye Kabejya kwa kuboya ti ngasi mwaona mu bya kumuluvyakana.»<verse eid="LUK 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Haŋo, bya kwisamijyena nabo mumunonga wa mundu kukasa ibwe. Byafukika manyu, na kusomba kuajya Kabejya ti: <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />«Shami, itu wavula, wuuwu mubungu wa kusuba, ushwale munonga naami! Nembiibi, ndayiyakana bushwa byangivula, ila nguvula kwoobe ni kwateebwe.»<verse eid="LUK 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />[Haŋo Malaika* yumo kunyomokela mbinguni, bya munyomokela kwakuboya ti wamute butangala. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Yeesu byayakana na susu dya bule, bya tetebejya kuajya Kabejya na tindi dya bule. Kitaata kyene muku mufusuka hakyayakana bidi ma mbombo ma muloa, kyene mukunoka mupaka mu mateke.]<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Haŋa heweye kuajya Kabejya, byataluka na kualuka mubua dyesiyeye badingisi.* Bya babanga badi mu tulo kumona bene na susu. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Haŋo bya basaudila ti: «Kwakayi muki tandabala mutulo? Mubuuke, muajye Kabejya ngasi mwashweela mu byaku muluvya.»<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wa kwatibwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mlk 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yoh 18.3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Haŋa henange Yeesu ukidi lungi muku yakula, hakwanyomokela kiandu kyabandu. Yuda yumo hamukidi ha baba mitonge* kumi na yibidi ba Yeesu ni wene busu bwaabo. Bya tuluka tonono na Yeesu mukuboya ti wamu yambitile. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Ila Yeesu bya muyujya ti: «Yuda! Mukunguyambidila ni kwandula miimi Mwana wa Mundu?»<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Badingisi* ba Yeesu habe mona maama makivula kuteebwa, haba muyuujya ti: «Vidi-nyambi, tubashukileshukile na biyoma biitu?»  <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Yumo hakeaŋa hamukidi haabo bya temba muvubi wa mupelo* mukata kiyoma, bya mutemba kushu dyaye dya mwaajyo mulume. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Ila Yeesu bya bayaka ti: «Musame! Bebya.» Bya lengela kushu dya yowa mundu, na kudifuula.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Haŋo Yeesu bya saudila bakulu baba mupelo*, na bakulu baba lolezi ba Lubunga,* na ba nunu babayaudi beeva kuva mukwaata ti: «Kwakaayi mwanguvila na biyoma na bikooma bidi kilwanyi? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Masu mooso bene niinu mu Lubunga,* ila ndamwee kungwata. Ila kiino ni kindi kiinu, lungi kindi kya butangala bwa mukunga.»<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petelo wamutuna Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-75">Mat 26.57-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-72">Mlk 14.53-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-27">Yoh 18.12-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Haŋo, baaba bandu habakwaata Yeesu. haba muyelekejya kukyende kya mukulu wa ba mupelo*. Petelo bya yakana muku mujyanga mumunonga.<verse eid="LUK 22:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Mudilo hawamunikibwa mu kyambala kya mukulu waba mupelo.* Petelo naiye bya yakana mukuyota mudilo kukumo nabo. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Muvubi yumo wa mwamukazi, hemoneye Petelo wa yakana hangondo ya mudilo, bya mufikidijya meeso, na kuboya ti: «Yu mundu naye byakebee uvanange kukumo na Yeesu.» <verse eid="LUK 22:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Ila Petelo bya benga nakuyakula ti: «Beebe yuu mwamukazi! Miimi siki muyuka yowa mundu!»<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Kaindi kashoo kukila, yungi mundu bya mona Petelo na kumujyongodela ti: «Na beebe udi yumo bobo hamukidi haabo!» Ila Petelo byamuyaka ti: «Beebe yu mwamulume! Ndabeebyo, miimi sidi yumo hamukidi haabo!»<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Kindi kukila kya saa yiyimo, mundu yungi bya titiminyina Petelo ti: «Kwinikindu, yuu mundu uvane bobo kukumo na Yeesu, kumona iye naye udi mundu wa Galilaya.» <verse eid="LUK 22:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Ila Petelo bya yaka ti: «Bebee yuu! Miimi sikiyuka ukivula kuyakula kaayi!» Haŋa, hene Petelo ukidi yakula, hakeaŋa muko hawayakula. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Haŋo Vidi-nyambi bya kibuka na kumulola Petelo sokosoko. Ni Petelo bya hejya dedya huya diva musaudila Vidi-nyambi ti: «Leelo diino busu bwa muko kuyakula uyakana wangunduna mala kasatu.» <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Hakeaŋa, Petelo bya nyomoka mudye bua na kusomba kudila subusubu.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wa yiludibwa na kututibwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:64-68">Mat 26.64-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mlk 14.65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Baba bandu bavane mukudindikijya Yeesu, habasiki muyilula na kumutuuta. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Haba muzika meeso, haba yakana muku muyuujya: «Busha tumone, ninaani vakutuuta?» <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Haba muyakudila mauya mangi mabule ma kumukaya.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu busu bwa kaole* ka Bayaudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26.59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mlk 14.55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yoh 18.19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Haŋa heekya bufuku, banunu babayaudi, na bakulu baba mupelo* na balangidishi ba buta* haba kumaana kaole na kuvisha Yeesu busu bwa kaaka kaole* kaabo. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Haŋo haba muyuujya ti: «Beebe ni Kilisito*? Utusaudile!» Naiye Yeesu bya yaka ti: «Nee namusaudila ndamwakutabuka. <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />Nee itu na muyuujya huya ndamwakungu yaka. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Ila kusomba buune, miimi Mwana wa Mundu na yena kukayakana mwajyo mulume wa Kabejya yidi na butangala.»<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Haŋo ibo booso haba muyuujya ti: «Manee nikuboya ka ti beebe ni Mwana wa Kabejya?» Yeesu byaba yaka ti: «Banyu benikindu mwaa yakula ti miimi niiye.»<verse eid="LUK 22:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Haŋo, hibo haba yakula ti: «Ndatuki hajya sanganyi yungi kukidila yuu mundu, kumona bashu benikindu twaa kwi teejyela maama mayakuleye!»<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">Yeesu walamuna busu bwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-14">Mat 27.1-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mlk 15.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yoh 18.28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Kiisha, booso benange mukaole kabayaudi* habataluka, na habamufila Yeesu mabusu ga Pilato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pilato: Ni gavana wa Kiloma, eyu gubutemena baandu u biindu bishidi bya Kabezya. Gubwanangi ngana dya Yudea mu micha ya 26-36 K.K.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 20.22; Yohana 18.28</char></note>Habasomba kumusosela mukuboya ti: «Tubu muhete mundu yuugu muu sosela bandu bakilongo kiitu ti, baingane na bakulu. Lungi bakibabengela ndaba tulanga milambu udi Kaisalia.* Na lungi ukikwivula ti iye ni Kilisito* Kolo.»<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">23.3 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 27.11; 1Tim 6.13</char>
    </note>Pilato haya muyuujya Yeesu ti: «Beebe ni kolo waba Yuda?» Naiye Yeesu haya mulunga ti: «Beebe ni wajyongola!» <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Haŋo Pilato haya sawiila bakulu baba mipelo* na kiandu kya bandu ti: «Miimi siki mona bubi nangi bumu bukiajya yuu mundu walamune.»<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">23.5 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Malako 1.14</char>
    </note>Ila baaba bandu habafikidijya ti: «Yuu mundu mulangidijyu dyaye, uki sosela bandu kuingana na bakulu mukisi kyooso kya bayaudi. Wesombela Galilaya, iye yuu waluvisha na kuune.»<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pilato wa fila Yeesu udi Helode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">23.6 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 22.59</char>
    </note>Haŋa heteejya Pilato maamo, haya yuujya bandu ti: «Yu mundu ngwa Galilaya?» <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Malako 14.1; Luka 3.1</char></note>Habamuyaka ti: «Nibeebyo, mundu wa Galilaya.» Ni Helode wene mukutalukila kisi kya Galilaya. Na wene ku Yelusalemu mumaama masu. Ni Pilato bya muyiishila Yeesu.<verse eid="LUK 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Helode heebu mumona Yeesu haya seelela sisu. Manee masu ga butu uvanange mukuvula kumumona. Kumona wene mukuteejya bandu mukuyakula kukidila iye. Lungi uvavula wamone Yeesu mukuta bingulungulu. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Haŋo, bya bayuujya Yeesu mauya mabule, ila Yeesu ndemuyaka nee dimo huya. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Bamupelo* bakata na balangidijyi ba Buta* bavanange haŋa, habataluka na bwaazi mukusosela Yeesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Malako 15-17-19; Yohane 19.2-3</char></note>Helode kukumo na balonga-buvadi baayi haba musea Yeesu na kumumona busadi. Ni habamutubila ngubu yileelayileela, kiishai habamualusha kudi Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mdo 4.27</char></note>Busu, Helode na Pilato bene mudilo na kafa. Ila kusombela lolwa lusu habasitee kuvunga kamo kuolola kakamo.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pilato wa haana zila ti Yeesu wayaibwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27.15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mlk 15.6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Yoh 18.39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Ni Pilato haya kumanya bakulu ba bamupelo* na banunu ba Bayuda, kukumo na bandu. <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 23.1, 2, 4</char></note>Byabasaudila ti: «Mwanguvishila yuu mundu mukuboya ti ukita bandu baingane nabakulu bakisi. Haŋa, namuyuujya kukidila maama mauya busu bwiinu. ila sikimona kindu neekimo kyakuboya ti wa kokomenebwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Ne ni Helodi byakebee na eyu ndibu mona bubi nangi bumu udi Yeesu, ni kwabeebyo wamualusha kwaami. Yu mundu, ndakudi huya needimo dibidibi dyateeye dikibambana iye kumota. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mdo 16.37; 2Kolito 11.23-24</char></note>Kwa biibi nisaula bamute tundendele, haŋo nimulekela.» [<verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 27.15; Malako16.6; Yohane 18.39</char></note>Kila kiandu kya Pasaka* Pilato wenange mukuangudila bandu muzitikibwe yuumo kunyomoka muzitikilu.] <verse eid="LUK 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mdo 3.13-14</char></note>Ila, bandu booso hababajya miuya kukumo na kuboya ti: «Uyaishe yuu mundu! Utulekedele Balaba!» <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Yuu Balaba uvakasibwa muzitikilu kumona wevishisha luvundu mumukola ya kuingana na bakulu Bakilumi. Lungi weyaa mundu.<verse eid="LUK 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Pilato gubwanangi mukukeba kumusama Yeesu, ni byajyobola lungi na bandu. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Ila hibo habaata lungi muushu ti: «Umulamike kumusalaba! Umulamike kumusala!» <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Pilato haya basaudila lwa busatu: «Waata buke bubi? Miimi sikimona bubi neebumo bukibambana kuvisha kumota kwaaye. Kwa biibi, nimututisha tundendele, ni ninamusama.» <verse eid="LUK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Ila bandu hababajya kutamuushu wabule ti Yeesu walamikibwe bobo kumusalaba. Mbundu yaabo hayayakana yabule. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 27.26; Malako 15.15; Yohane 19.17</char></note>Haŋo, Pilato bya lamuna ti byabevulanga byateebwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Kisha bya bazitudila yowa Balaba, neeti mundu weingana na bakulu bakilumi na bya yaa mundu. Ni Pilato bya baabila Yeesu bamuteele bebya byabevula.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu walamikibwa kumusalaba*</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mlk 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoh 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">23.26 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 27.32; Malako 15.21; 19.17</char>
    </note>Balonga-buvuadi habeeshwala Yeesu mubua dyakumulamika kumusalaba, habakumaana mundu yumo wetaanibwa Simoni wenyomokela kumakunda. Yowa Simoni wene mundu wa mukola ukitaanibwa Kuleni. Habamukwaata, na kumushwadisha musalaba* wa Yeesu kwakibandibandi. Byena kujyanga Yeesu.<verse eid="LUK 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">23.27 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 8.52</char>
    </note>Igandu kyatakyata kya bandu hakya mu kumba Yeesu. Mu baata bwaabu, mubwanagi babaazi babu wenaga kumudilala na kukwisosasosa kwabule. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yeesu haya bakibukila kwa badi na haya basawiila ti: «Ee! bayeye ba Yelusalema!* Ndamungu didila miimi! ila mukwididile banyu benikindu na kudidila baana biinu. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Kumona, kindi kivanga kiboya bandu ti: ‹Buuya babakazi badi biumba, basiva butula na basiva nyamwisha baana!› <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Mukekya kindi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:30">bandu bisomba kusaudila bituulu ti: ‹Bituulu! Mutuonene!›</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:30">Na bisaudila tu tuulu tu sheenene ti: ‹mutu ziike!›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Hosea 10.8</char></note>  <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Kumona itu bandu bangundeela biibi, miimi yidi bushwa muti ubisi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:31">haŋo yiyakana bini kudi banyu badi bidi miti yi nyumine?»<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Kuvane byakebee bilwanyi bibidi bye budibwa ti bazibikibwe kumusalaba kukumo na Yeesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Habeefika mubua diki taanibwa: «Kabombo ka mushu», haŋo balonga-buvadi haba komena Yeesu misumaadi haulu ha musalaba kukumo na baba bakuyiba babidi: yumo mwajyo mulume wa Yeesu na yungi mwajyo mukazi waaye. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Haŋo Yeesu bya boya ti: «Shami, ubafiile lusa, kumona ndabaki yuka kyabakita!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Ni Baaba balonga-buvadi haba kwi habeena ngubu ya Yeesu muku yitela ndonge. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Bandu betaluka haŋa muku lola. Naibo bakulu ba Bayaudi haba muyilula Yeesu muku yakula ti: «Uva fuula bandu bangi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Zabuli 22.7-8, 109.25</char></note>! Wakwi fuule iye mwini kindu. Haŋo itu iye bya kwinikindu Kilisito yowa we sobola Kabejya!»<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Balonga-buvadi naabo byake bee habasomba kuyiilula Yeesu. Haba tuluka tonono naye mukuboya ti bamwabila divai diae<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zabuli 69.22</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />Habamujyongodela ti: «Kwinikindu itu beebe ni Kolo wa Bayaudi, ukwifuule beebe mwini kindu!»<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Na haulu hamushu wa Yeesu beebika kaba kalubao kabesinyina haulu hakyo ti: «Yuwu ni Kolo wa Bayaudi.»<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Yumo hamukidi ha baba bilwanyi babidi belamikibwa kumusalaba hangondo ha Yeesu bya somba kukaya Yeesu ti: «Be! miti beebe ni Kilisito! Haŋa, ukwi fuule beebe mwinikindu, na utufuule na bashu byake bee!» <verse eid="LUK 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Ila, yowa yungi iye bya hanunukila mwizinaye na kuboya ti: «Beebe nduki tiina Kabejya nenguboya ti beebe walamunibwa kukumo na yuu mundu? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Beebe na miimi tuki bambana kuuku kusuba, kumona kiiki ni kitata kya maama mabimabi matweeta. Ila iye yu mundu ndavata kindu nee kimo kibikibi.»<verse eid="LUK 23:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Kisha yowa kilwanyi bya boya ti: «Ee Yeesu, unguejye haŋa hiva beebe mu Butangala bwoobe bidi Kolo.» <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yeesu bya mu saula ti: «Ngiku saudila bya kwinikindu, Leelo diino uyakana naami paladizo.»*<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wa mota haulu ha Musalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mlk 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoh 19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Yene hangi yuba mukidi, yuba hadya sama ku munuka, mukunga hawa zika kisi kyooso mupaka yuba dya kitema. <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />na ngubu yene bu udikibwe mu lubunga haya handika biba bibidi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yeya ngubu yene mukuabanya bua ditokataka sisu na bua ditokatoka sisu dya lubunga. Bakulu babamupelo bobo ni bekila yeya ngubu kwakukumaana na Kabejya. kwa biibi Kabejya wehanda yeye ngubu ti killa mundu uki bambana kumutulukila. Lola Kulozoka 26.31-33; Waebulania 10.19-22.</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 23:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Yeesu bya yaba na muuya ukata na kuboya ti: «Shami, na biika tima dyami mu biboko byoobe.» Kisha iye kuyakula bebya, bya temba tima.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Hemona mukulu wa balonga-buvadi mama mee nyomokela, bya tumbijya Kabejya na ku yakula ti: «Kwinikindu yuhu mundu uvane bobo mundu yidi buludi.»<verse eid="LUK 23:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Baaba bandu booso bee fika kuvamona maama metebwa, haba haluka ma kwabo kukwituta ma hanga maabo muku hojwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Bandu booso be yukanga Yeesu, kukumo na baa babakazi be mujyanganga kunyomokela Galilaya, be taluka mumunonga, na kulola mama makumo.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wa teebwa mumufungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mlk 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoh 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Kwenange mundu yumo zina dyaye Yosefu, wene wamukola umo wa Bayaudi uki taanibwa Alimathayo. Yuhu Yozefu wene mundu mulweela na yidi buludi. <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />Na wene muku dindila kuva kwa bukolo bwa Kabejya. Wene lungi yumo hamukidi ha lwa Bayaudi, Ila iye ndava bela nabo kakamo kukidila dedya kumo dya kuyaa Yeesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Iye Yosefu bya yena kudi Pilato, na kuajya kitumba kya Yeesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Haŋo bya ki shajya ku musalaba, bya kivunga mu ngubu yitokatoka, bya yena kuka kizika mumufungu we fudibwa mu hibu. munda mwaye bene ndabe biika mundu mwakale. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Lolwa lusu, lwene lwa tano, na sabato yene ya somba. <verse eid="LUK 23:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Baaba baabakazi beeva na Yeesu ku nyomokela ku Galilaya, be jyanga Yosefu, ha baka mona wowa mufungu na bebya byabee zika kitumba kya Yeesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Haŋo, haba haluka kwabo, na kuka bika tonaa subidi na maani mavumba ya kulalabisha lukoba lwa Yeesu, lusu lwa Sabato be huuma bebya bye saudibwa na buta.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s1">Yeesu wa fukuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mat 28.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mlk 16.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoh 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Hayefika lusu lwa yinga mukisi pupu, baaba babakazi bahabukila kumifungu, bushwaale maani na malashi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yeesu hayambu yaana nangufuku'a ulungidila kwiichu udi Yeesu kwambwanangi kwa busadi. twa sehelela manee Yeesu gubufuku'a.</char></note>mabavalungakanya. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 24.2; Malako 16.5</char></note>Baaba babaazi haba heta abu kabaga shibwa heegulu wa kwanywa kwa mufungu. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Ila <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 24.23; Malako 16.5</char></note>habeshwela munda mwa mufungu, ndabeemona kitumba kya Yeesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Kekya kindu kye baanunusha kwabule. Habeenange bakidi hanunuka hakeaŋa bandu babidi badi na ngubu yitokatoka kabisa habataluka tonono nabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Haŋo, kukidila moyo, baaba baabakazi habashajya meeso maabo haasi. Ila baaba bandu hababasaudila ti: «Kwakai mukikebela mundu yidi mwejyo hamukidi habamote? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 17.22-23; Malako 9.30-31</char></note>Ndidi lungi hanu, wa fukuka! Muejye mauya mebasaudileye haŋa henangiye ukidi kokwa Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 8.20; 16.21</char></note>Miti weboya ti: ‹Yikinguajya miimi Mwaana wa Mundu na tudibwe mubiboko bya bandu babibabi! Bingulamika kumusalaba, ila masu masatu kisha kumota kwaami, nifukuka.›»<verse eid="LUK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">24.8 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Yohane 2.22</char>
    </note>Haŋo, baaba baabakazi ni haba heejya maama mauya mebasaudila Yeesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 28.8; Malako 16.10</char></note>Habahezela kuwowa mufungu, habayena kukasaudila mitonge* kumi na yimo ba Yeesu na bangi bandu booso wowa mukizi. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 8.1-3; Malako 6.30</char></note>Babakazi besaula wowa mukizi kudi mitonge* ni baaba: Madiya wamukola wa Magadalene, na Yoana, na Maliya naajye na Yakobo, hamonga na babaazi bangi. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Malako 16.11</char></note>Ila mitonge* benijya ti wowa mukizi wa baaba baabakazi ngwabusadi, na ndabeutabuka.<verse eid="LUK 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">24.12 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Yohane 20.3-7; 20.10</char>
    </note>Ila Petelo iye byataluka yoko, na kujyuka kabilo kumufungu. Hekajyeye kwakale, byanyinama, byamona sanda bobo yabevungila kitumba kya Yeesu. Ni, byahaluka kwaye, iye kusheeka biino kumona makumo mateebwa.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu wa nyomokela badingisi* babidi kuyeena ku Emau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mlk 16.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">24.13 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Malako 16.12</char>
    </note>Mulwanga loolwa lusu, badingisi babidi ba Yeesu bavayenanga kumukola ukitaanibwa Emau, wowa mukola uvanange mu munonga hangi bilomitele kumi na yimo na mukola wa Yelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Moomwa mu zila beyenanga kujyobola kukidila maama mauya moosomeekila. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 18.20</char></note>Habenange bakidi jyobola nakukwiyujyujyena, Yeesu mwinikindu bya banyomokela, na bya yena nabo kukumo muluendo <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Yohane 20.14; 21.4</char></note>Bemumona kwa meeso, ila meeso maabo mezikibwa kusidi kumuyuka.<verse eid="LUK 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Yeesu haya bayuuja: «Mwena kujyobola kukidila kayi?» Ibo habatukama buobame. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Loa Yohane 19.25</char></note>Yumo hamukidi haabo wetaanibwa Keleopa haya muyaka ti: «Nguboya tii, udi beebunga muune Muyelusalemu sikiyuka byakila mwakale maa masu mabidi?» <verse eid="LUK 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mat 9.24</char></note>Naiye bya bayuujya ti: «Ko! Makemauya lungi?» Naibo habamuyaka ti: «Tukijyobodela kukidila mauya mavatebwa kudi Yeesu wa Nazaleti! Yuu Yeesu wene mubushi* mukata. Lungi wemonesha butangala bwaaye mukuyakula na mukuta bingulungulu busu bwa Kabejya na busu bwa bandu booso.<verse eid="LUK 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Bakulu biitu babamupelo* na banunu biitu bemutula mukuboya ti walamudibwe kumote. Kisha habamulamika kumusalaba. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 1.68; 2.38; Mat 16.21</char></note>Baashu tuvanange mukubadila ti ni iye ni wifuula Isilaeli. Ila leelo ndusu lwa kasatu kusomba beebya bye teebwa maama mauya. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Lungi baabakazi bamo bakiandu kiitu bava tuanunusha. Baaba baabakazi bavabukila kumufungu mukisi pupu, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />Ila ndabavabanga lukoba lwaye. Habaaluka habatuvishila mukizi ti ba malaika* bava banyomokela na kubasaudila ti Yeesu udi mwejyo. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Luka 24.12; Yohana 20.3-19</char></note>Kisha bamo hamukidi hiitu bavayena kumufungu, habakabanga mauya byakebee bivayakula baaba baabakazi. Ibo naabo ndabeemona kitumba kya Yeesu.»<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Ni Yeesu haya basaudila baaba badingisi ti: «Ha banyu bandu basidi na lukanyi, matima miinu ndamakitabuka kabilo mauya mooso me yakula babushi.* <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Ebalania 2.10; 1Pet 1.11</char></note>Miti yivahajya Kilisito* wasube beebya busu ni washwele mubutangala bwaaye!» <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Kiisha, haya bafifuludila ma mauya mesinyibwa mwajyo waye mu Businye Butokatoka ba Kabejya bwooso. Bya somba kubitabu kya Musa, mupaka ku bitabu bya babushi booso.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bitabu bya ilagu kyu luulu bilumonesha bitabu bya Musa na ba nganga bilooto. Lola Luka 24.44.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Haŋa habe tuluka tonono na mukola wabee yenanga mwakale, Yeesu byata bushwa wayidididye na luendo; <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Ila baaba badingisi* haba kwiaya naye na kuyakula ti: «Huuma niitu, kumona bufuku bwa tonanana.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:29">Haŋo, bya shwela mukyende, bya yakana kukumo nabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Haŋa he yakana mukudya bidyazi kukumo nabo, bya buula mukati byata abee kudi Kabejya, kisha byaubela na kubaabila. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Hakeaŋa meeso maabo hama humbuka, na haba muyuka sasa. Ila Yeesu bya zizimina kumeeso maabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Habasomba kukwi saujyena yumo kwa yumo ti: «Ngwinikindu! Matima miitu mavane muku seelela haŋa havanangiye muku tufifuludila Businye Butokatoka bwa Kabejya kokwa muzila!»<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Hakeaŋa baaba badingisi* babidi haba taluka, haba haluka ku Yelusalemu. Haba banga baba mitonge* kumi na yumo ba Yeesu na baa bangi bandu bakiandu kyaabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />Baaba bene bukumaana haba saudila baaba badingisi* babidi ti: «Byakwinikindu, Vidi-nyambi wa fukuka! Na uvanyomokela Simoni!»<verse eid="LUK 24:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Na baba badingisi* babidi, naibo habasaudila beezinabo mauya mooso mee kidika muzila, na beebya byabe muyuka Yeesu mu kindi kyebeleye mukati.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wa sosokela ba dingisi* baye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mlk 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoh 20.19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Bym 1.6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Baaba badingi* babidi habenange bekidi yakula kukidila maama mauya, hakeaŋa Yeesu mwinikindu bya sosokela hamukidi haabo. Bya basaudila: «Muyakane nyaa!»<verse eid="LUK 24:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Baaba badingisi booso haba hanunuka na kutiina kwabule, kumona bavanijya ti bamona musimbusimbu. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Ila Yeesu bya bayuujya t: «Kwa kayi matima miinu maobama? Kwakayi mudi na mbaka muma tima miinu? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Mulole biazaza byami na bidimba byami, ti jyami mwinikindu! Mungulengele na mungulole, kumona muzuka ndaukiyakananga na nyama wala na mifua. Ila miimi mwangulola mbidi nabyo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yeesu weboya beebya mukuboya ti badingisi* bamone mikuvu ya misumadi mubiboko na mubidimba byaaye. Uvavula batabuke byakwinikindu ti niiye bobo. </char></note>.» <verse eid="LUK 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Hewa Yeesu kuyakula maamo, bya bamonesha byazaza byaye na bidimba byaye. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Baaba badingisi bavane ndabetabuka kukidila kuseelela na kusheeka. Haŋo Yeesu byabayuujya ti: «Mudi na kindu kimo haŋa kyakudya?» <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Haŋo haba mwabila kindi kimo kya kibelelo kyabeeyekela. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Bya kibuula, na kukidya ibo booso muku mona. <verse eid="LUK 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Kisha beebya bya basaudila: «Haŋa hambenange kukumo niinu mbebasaudila ti: ‹Mauya mooso mesinyibwa mwajyo waami mu Buta* bwa Musa, na mubitabu bya babushi*, na mukitabu kya Zabuli, makiajyibwa mabambane mooso.›»<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Haŋo Yeesu bya bahumbula lukanyi lwaabo ti bayuke Businye Butakatoka. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Na bya basaudila lungi ti: «Yikisinyibwa ti yikibambana Kilisito* wasube, na masu masatu nyuma ya kumota kwaye wafukuke.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Isaya 53; Hosea 6.2.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />Na muzina dyaaye ni mwabisaudila bandu booso ti basame bubi bwaabo mukuboya ti bafiilwe lusa bubi bwaabo. Na Yeeya yasombele Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Banyu ni basanganyi ba maa makumo. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Miimi mwinikindu ni muyishila yowa we badijya Tata. Ila banyu mudindile bangu ku Yelusalemu mupaka bebya byamu hebwa bobwa butangala kunyomokela mbinguni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Byeta mitonge 1.4-5</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wabanda mbinguni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mlk 16.19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Bym 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Haŋo, Yeesu bya hezela na badingisi* baye mumukola wa Yelusalema, bya baswaala tonono na mukola wa Bethania. Habetuyuka haŋo bya tundula biboko byaaye haulu, na bya bafiyudila. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Henangiye ukidi ba fiyudila, bya basama; na bya buudibwa haulu mbinguni. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus va au ciel" file="WA03935b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="24.51">Yeesu wayena mbinguni</figure> <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Naibo byakebee, haba munyinamina. Kisha habahaluka ku Yelusalemu na kuseelela kukata. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Masu mooso, benangange munda mwalubunga muku shisha Kabejya.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>